(101855, 4244, 2643, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this is something new, I guess you were trying to show that after the rain there will be a new rainbow?  But it is a very nice picture, I''d like a link to it, so I can make it a screensaver.  titotapado</td>', 'I''m not sure how this is something new, I guess you were trying to show that after the rain there will be a new rainbow?  But it is a very nice picture, I''d like a link to it, so I can make it a screensaver.  titotapado', '2002-08-13 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101856, 4244, 2798, '<td valign="top">The gloom is captured very well here without losing too much foreground detail. I think I might have cropped closer in to lose the bush in the lower left.</td>', 'The gloom is captured very well here without losing too much foreground detail. I think I might have cropped closer in to lose the bush in the lower left.', '2002-08-14 07:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101857, 4244, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a really atmospheric shot; it''s full of drama, great lighting.  What I really like is the way it also captures the sense of calm. Thus, it really does capture the beginning of a new storm (10)</td>', 'This is a really atmospheric shot; it''s full of drama, great lighting.  What I really like is the way it also captures the sense of calm. Thus, it really does capture the beginning of a new storm (10)', '2002-08-14 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
