(101862, 4244, 806, '<td valign="top">The horizon is slightly tilted - if this was intentional, I don''t think it adds anything. Otherwise, the photo does not hold my attention. Sorry ;} (sheepish grin)</td>', 'The horizon is slightly tilted - if this was intentional, I don''t think it adds anything. Otherwise, the photo does not hold my attention. Sorry ;} (sheepish grin)', '2002-08-15 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
