(101870, 4244, 3080, '<td valign="top">Is the idea behing this that it''s a "new storm"?  I like the location of this.  Nice with the leaves to the left, and the horizon like that.  The horizon is a bit crooked in relation to the edge of the photo.  You could tilt it a slight bit to the right and be just fine.    I like the natural grey-ish blues.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Is the idea behing this that it''s a "new storm"?  I like the location of this.  Nice with the leaves to the left, and the horizon like that.  The horizon is a bit crooked in relation to the edge of the photo.  You could tilt it a slight bit to the right and be just fine.    I like the natural grey-ish blues.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-19 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
