(101895, 4246, 1280, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge:Looks new in the modern sense, especially compared to the mountains.<br/>Technical aspects:A bit too centered but lighting and exposure is good.<br/>Artistic Merit:ok<br/>Suggestions: maybe try a few different compositions. I think I''d try to isolate the tower against the mtns minus the rest of the structure to enhance the "Other world" look. Glad to see some blue sky...nice picture.</td>', 'Meets challenge:Looks new in the modern sense, especially compared to the mountains.Technical aspects:A bit too centered but lighting and exposure is good.Artistic Merit:okSuggestions: maybe try a few different compositions. I think I''d try to isolate the tower against the mtns minus the rest of the structure to enhance the "Other world" look. Glad to see some blue sky...nice picture.', '2002-08-16 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
