(101906, 4248, 3102, '<td valign="top">Ok, I am completely missing the point of this one.  Is the subject the girl, or the car? In either case, the girl seems to be in the shade too much.   Is her future bright because she''s a student... Does the handicapped spot have something to do with it?  I''m sorry... I''m just lost.</td>', 'Ok, I am completely missing the point of this one.  Is the subject the girl, or the car? In either case, the girl seems to be in the shade too much.   Is her future bright because she''s a student... Does the handicapped spot have something to do with it?  I''m sorry... I''m just lost.', '2002-08-12 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101907, 4248, 1005, '<td valign="top">Who the girl or the bug?  The girl seems too dark (shadowed) and off any kind of attention lines to be the subject, so I have to assume it''s the car, which is old enough to have a regular california license plate.  Less than appealing background.  Good DOF.  5 Swash</td>', 'Who the girl or the bug?  The girl seems too dark (shadowed) and off any kind of attention lines to be the subject, so I have to assume it''s the car, which is old enough to have a regular california license plate.  Less than appealing background.  Good DOF.  5 Swash', '2002-08-12 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101908, 4248, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition5<br/>Technical Aspects5<br/>Appeal6<br/>Creativity5<br/>Rating5Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition5Technical Aspects5Appeal6Creativity5Rating5Autool', '2002-08-12 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101909, 4248, 1759, '<td valign="top">Here is my honest response to this photo. I am not certain which is the subject, the car or the girl. I will assume that it is the girl, since the car will only degenerate from this point on. She is a nice subject with a great smile and hopefully a bright future, but she is not exposed well enough to really see her. The image is composed such that she hasn''t fully entered the frame, which might be okay except that the background is so distracting that it dominates and becomes forground, which I presume you don''t want. There may be a relationship between the girl and the car, but I don''t have any visual clues to indicate that this is so, which leaves me wondering why the image is composed with the car so dominating the frame.</td>', 'Here is my honest response to this photo. I am not certain which is the subject, the car or the girl. I will assume that it is the girl, since the car will only degenerate from this point on. She is a nice subject with a great smile and hopefully a bright future, but she is not exposed well enough to really see her. The image is composed such that she hasn''t fully entered the frame, which might be okay except that the background is so distracting that it dominates and becomes forground, which I presume you don''t want. There may be a relationship between the girl and the car, but I don''t have any visual clues to indicate that this is so, which leaves me wondering why the image is composed with the car so dominating the frame.', '2002-08-13 19:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101910, 4248, 3273, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Not too sure about the sun reflecting on the back of the car though.</td>', 'Nice.  Not too sure about the sun reflecting on the back of the car though.', '2002-08-14 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101911, 4248, 2560, '<td valign="top">The bigest problem with this photo is the pixelation.  You used 45,000 but you can go up to 153,600(150kb).  I think that would make it alot crisper.  Find a way to save with less compression.  Let me know if i can help.  Niten</td>', 'The bigest problem with this photo is the pixelation.  You used 45,000 but you can go up to 153,600(150kb).  I think that would make it alot crisper.  Find a way to save with less compression.  Let me know if i can help.  Niten', '2002-08-15 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101912, 4248, 616, '<td valign="top">A bright future for the car or the girl?</td>', 'A bright future for the car or the girl?', '2002-08-15 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101913, 4248, 3242, '<td valign="top">The girl on the left distracts</td>', 'The girl on the left distracts', '2002-08-16 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101914, 4248, 1280, '<td valign="top">Not really sure how this fits.  A new car?  What does the person add to the picture? It lacks artistic character.</td>', 'Not really sure how this fits.  A new car?  What does the person add to the picture? It lacks artistic character.', '2002-08-16 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
