(101916, 4248, 3080, '<td valign="top">I am a bit confused on what the central focus is suposed to be.  The car or the girl.  If it''s the girl (which is my first choice) I think that she should be in the picture a bit more.  Is she going to school?  Is that how she is having a "bright future".  Just because I don''t understand it, doesn''t mean that someone else doesn''t though.  I wasn''t there, so I''m not getting the feel of the photo.  I think this is a personal meaning photo.  I think the main focus is suposed to be the girl, but the lighting and the focal point seem to draw me to the trunk of the car.  I was thinking that this could be her new car, but she doesn''t look handicapped.  I guess I just have too many questions about this photo.  I am keeping into consideration that I''m missing something obvious. And if this is the case, I''m very sorry.   Someone said they didn''t get my photo too, and I myself thought that it was very obvious.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I am a bit confused on what the central focus is suposed to be.  The car or the girl.  If it''s the girl (which is my first choice) I think that she should be in the picture a bit more.  Is she going to school?  Is that how she is having a "bright future".  Just because I don''t understand it, doesn''t mean that someone else doesn''t though.  I wasn''t there, so I''m not getting the feel of the photo.  I think this is a personal meaning photo.  I think the main focus is suposed to be the girl, but the lighting and the focal point seem to draw me to the trunk of the car.  I was thinking that this could be her new car, but she doesn''t look handicapped.  I guess I just have too many questions about this photo.  I am keeping into consideration that I''m missing something obvious. And if this is the case, I''m very sorry.   Someone said they didn''t get my photo too, and I myself thought that it was very obvious.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-17 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101917, 4248, 2829, '<td valign="top">I dunno...I am guessing you''re trying to say that this girl has a nice bright future...<br/>On the other hand, it looks like this beetle is the main subject of this photo...And it''s parked in a handicapped spot...So, are you implying that this girl has a bright future by being handicapped? (Or am I just reading too much into this photo)</td>', 'I dunno...I am guessing you''re trying to say that this girl has a nice bright future...On the other hand, it looks like this beetle is the main subject of this photo...And it''s parked in a handicapped spot...So, are you implying that this girl has a bright future by being handicapped? (Or am I just reading too much into this photo)', '2002-08-18 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
