(101923, 4254, 1037, '<td valign="top">This photo seems almost perfect, other than a bit of graininess. The light especially is very gentle, so the delicate colours and textures of the petals are well exposed. The composition is beautifully balanced and contemplative.</td>', 'This photo seems almost perfect, other than a bit of graininess. The light especially is very gentle, so the delicate colours and textures of the petals are well exposed. The composition is beautifully balanced and contemplative.', '2002-08-13 07:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
