(101925, 4254, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice flower shot :)  One thing that you can try sometime in this type of photography is to hold a dark cloth up behind the flowers to remove any distractions from your background.  A dark background on flower photos quite often makes a great enhancement to the detail of your subject :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'Nice flower shot :)  One thing that you can try sometime in this type of photography is to hold a dark cloth up behind the flowers to remove any distractions from your background.  A dark background on flower photos quite often makes a great enhancement to the detail of your subject :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-13 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101926, 4254, 3087, '<td valign="top">Pretty but not grabbing me. Would like a bluer sky (I know I know, I am a fussy b*tch!)<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Pretty but not grabbing me. Would like a bluer sky (I know I know, I am a fussy b*tch!)5, Kavey', '2002-08-13 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
