(101929, 4254, 1041, '<td valign="top">my initial reaction was ''that photo needs to be rotated''.  the top left flower seems to be the dominant one and it gives the appearance that the photo is on its side.  in fact, so do the leaves on the right.   i like the colors of the flowers, but personally, i think the composition is too busy, maybe if you had focused in closer on one of the flowers ... but that''s just my personal taste. -- gr8photos (4)</td>', 'my initial reaction was ''that photo needs to be rotated''.  the top left flower seems to be the dominant one and it gives the appearance that the photo is on its side.  in fact, so do the leaves on the right.   i like the colors of the flowers, but personally, i think the composition is too busy, maybe if you had focused in closer on one of the flowers ... but that''s just my personal taste. -- gr8photos (4)', '2002-08-15 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101930, 4254, 2881, '<td valign="top">I''m usually not much for flower pictures but I like this one lots.  The detail is exquisite.  Balance and overall clarity is great, although I found the bluriness in the background on the bottom left to be a bit distracting. I know somethims, though, there''s just no way to crop or eliminate that sort of thing.  Beautiful color and light.</td>', 'I''m usually not much for flower pictures but I like this one lots.  The detail is exquisite.  Balance and overall clarity is great, although I found the bluriness in the background on the bottom left to be a bit distracting. I know somethims, though, there''s just no way to crop or eliminate that sort of thing.  Beautiful color and light.', '2002-08-15 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101931, 4254, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, but a difficult concept to have promoted had you not entitled it.  The picture doesn''t really speak for it''s self.   I still like it though.</td>', 'Very pretty, but a difficult concept to have promoted had you not entitled it.  The picture doesn''t really speak for it''s self.   I still like it though.', '2002-08-16 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
