(101934, 4254, 3080, '<td valign="top">Without the title, this would be just another picture of flowers to me.  I am assuming that this is a lemon tree?  I''ve never seen one before, so please forgive my ignorance.  Setting that aside, the lighting is beautiful on this and the contrast of the colors to the green background is great.  There are no funky shadows or bright spots, so this in an overall nice photo.  Thanks for the view of the lemon tree (IF I''m right in assuming that''s what this is) Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Without the title, this would be just another picture of flowers to me.  I am assuming that this is a lemon tree?  I''ve never seen one before, so please forgive my ignorance.  Setting that aside, the lighting is beautiful on this and the contrast of the colors to the green background is great.  There are no funky shadows or bright spots, so this in an overall nice photo.  Thanks for the view of the lemon tree (IF I''m right in assuming that''s what this is) Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-18 02:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
