(101953, 4256, 1759, '<td valign="top">I like the brush in the background. It is visible, yet subdued enough that it isn''t a distraction. The highlights on the glass are a bit of a distraction. Overall a very good effort on this shot.</td>', 'I like the brush in the background. It is visible, yet subdued enough that it isn''t a distraction. The highlights on the glass are a bit of a distraction. Overall a very good effort on this shot.', '2002-08-13 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
