(101971, 4263, 2798, '<td valign="top">OMG - I almost did new soap! I didnt think anyone else would think of it :) Great idea. Your picture is a little too dark, though. A couple of extra lights in the room would have improved things. Still love the concept though. :)</td>', 'OMG - I almost did new soap! I didnt think anyone else would think of it :) Great idea. Your picture is a little too dark, though. A couple of extra lights in the room would have improved things. Still love the concept though. :)', '2002-08-12 08:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
