(101998, 4265, 1005, '<td valign="top">First, the point of focus seems to be the child''s shirt collar.  While I understand the meaning of your shot, New Hero, the title has to carry this shot.  6 Swash</td>', 'First, the point of focus seems to be the child''s shirt collar.  While I understand the meaning of your shot, New Hero, the title has to carry this shot.  6 Swash', '2002-08-14 17:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(101999, 4265, 2829, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...Might have made more sense if I knew what you were trying to point out. The kid is definitely young...But he''s not young enough to be new. Is he going through a new experience in his life? The image doesn''t tell a lot. Also, half of his head is cropped off that''s a pretty big problem for this image...</td>', 'Hmmm...Might have made more sense if I knew what you were trying to point out. The kid is definitely young...But he''s not young enough to be new. Is he going through a new experience in his life? The image doesn''t tell a lot. Also, half of his head is cropped off that''s a pretty big problem for this image...', '2002-08-14 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
