(102002, 4265, 1280, '<td valign="top">I am wondering how in the world did you get the shirt sleeve to stay up?  Amazing!  IS this child about to get a needle?  Yeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeikes!  I HATE needles...if that is the case and he/she isn''t crying they are a little hero. I''d like this better with more of the face showing...but not everyone will agree.  I like the way you got the contrast against the black background.  Good luck in the challenge!  :-)</td>', 'I am wondering how in the world did you get the shirt sleeve to stay up?  Amazing!  IS this child about to get a needle?  Yeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeikes!  I HATE needles...if that is the case and he/she isn''t crying they are a little hero. I''d like this better with more of the face showing...but not everyone will agree.  I like the way you got the contrast against the black background.  Good luck in the challenge!  :-)', '2002-08-18 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
