(102014, 4266, 2928, '<td valign="top">Well, I know they meet the challenge, but I had decided to mark down babies and puppies for not being original But this is a class act picture.  Its a great shot, I really like the angle, its sharp and, of course, it also get the ahhh vote :)  I have to score it 10</td>', 'Well, I know they meet the challenge, but I had decided to mark down babies and puppies for not being original But this is a class act picture.  Its a great shot, I really like the angle, its sharp and, of course, it also get the ahhh vote :)  I have to score it 10', '2002-08-13 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
