(102016, 4266, 3105, '<td valign="top">What an adorable expression!  This makes me want to go out and get a new puppy.  The focus on the face is good and the big eyes don''t hurt any either.  The flash might be a tad bit too bright but depending on the camera you may not be able to control that.  I''m curious about the title though: "New chance at life"?  Is there some story behind this puppy?<br/>Score: 8<br/>Courtenay</td>', 'What an adorable expression!  This makes me want to go out and get a new puppy.  The focus on the face is good and the big eyes don''t hurt any either.  The flash might be a tad bit too bright but depending on the camera you may not be able to control that.  I''m curious about the title though: "New chance at life"?  Is there some story behind this puppy?Score: 8Courtenay', '2002-08-14 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
