(102032, 4267, 3080, '<td valign="top">not real sure what''s in the reflection up there (other than the light post) but I think that it would be really cool if you could have gotten a clear reflection of the actual car sales building on the truck.  Also, (and I know this is REAL picky) but it looks like the photo was taken at an angle and I realize that this was probably to get the 0.0% into the pic, but my head tips to the right when I look at the licence plate.  Since the plate seems to be the main focus, maybe tilting the pic a small bit to the left would straighten it up and still allow for the 0.0% to be clear.  Congrats on the pic and good luck!!!</td>', 'not real sure what''s in the reflection up there (other than the light post) but I think that it would be really cool if you could have gotten a clear reflection of the actual car sales building on the truck.  Also, (and I know this is REAL picky) but it looks like the photo was taken at an angle and I realize that this was probably to get the 0.0% into the pic, but my head tips to the right when I look at the licence plate.  Since the plate seems to be the main focus, maybe tilting the pic a small bit to the left would straighten it up and still allow for the 0.0% to be clear.  Congrats on the pic and good luck!!!', '2002-08-12 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
