(102097, 4276, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice catch!  Details are so clear!  Not certain how much I like the large open space around the edges, but I call that personal choice.  How about a 9?  Swash</td>', 'Nice catch!  Details are so clear!  Not certain how much I like the large open space around the edges, but I call that personal choice.  How about a 9?  Swash', '2002-08-16 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
