(102120, 4277, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually very impressed with photos of flowers, however it''s the color that draws me to this one.  It''s a LITTLE dark on the right side, but I think that was probably not avoidable due to the lighting.  If it were possible to lighten it up a bit, you could try that but ONLY if it didn''t take away from the beautiful color.   I think the color is more important.  Very nice!  Congrats and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not usually very impressed with photos of flowers, however it''s the color that draws me to this one.  It''s a LITTLE dark on the right side, but I think that was probably not avoidable due to the lighting.  If it were possible to lighten it up a bit, you could try that but ONLY if it didn''t take away from the beautiful color.   I think the color is more important.  Very nice!  Congrats and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-13 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102121, 4277, 2798, '<td valign="top">...and aparrently about to be eaten. Why is it on a plate? :) Seriously, though - focus and depth of field are excellent. The lighting and colour are also great as is the framing.</td>', '...and aparrently about to be eaten. Why is it on a plate? :) Seriously, though - focus and depth of field are excellent. The lighting and colour are also great as is the framing.', '2002-08-14 07:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102122, 4277, 3273, '<td valign="top">Outstanding. Cannot fault it.</td>', 'Outstanding. Cannot fault it.', '2002-08-14 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102123, 4277, 3105, '<td valign="top">The color cast works pretty well for this image to set the mood it could possibly be a little lighter though.  The dominant shadows on the right and the somewhat shallow depth of field also help the photos mood.  Good job.<br/>Score: 6<br/>Courtenay</td>', 'The color cast works pretty well for this image to set the mood it could possibly be a little lighter though.  The dominant shadows on the right and the somewhat shallow depth of field also help the photos mood.  Good job.Score: 6Courtenay', '2002-08-14 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102124, 4277, 2881, '<td valign="top">I would have used a title something like "Freshly picked" rather than use the word NEW in the title. Overall, a good picture, interesting to use an ordinary dinner plate for background. It seems a little shadowy on the right, but it''s still nice and clear even in the dark parts, and balance is good.</td>', 'I would have used a title something like "Freshly picked" rather than use the word NEW in the title. Overall, a good picture, interesting to use an ordinary dinner plate for background. It seems a little shadowy on the right, but it''s still nice and clear even in the dark parts, and balance is good.', '2002-08-15 09:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102125, 4277, 3044, '<td valign="top">very nice composition. the coloring looks a little too saturated to me. nice job overall though.</td>', 'very nice composition. the coloring looks a little too saturated to me. nice job overall though.', '2002-08-15 12:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
