(102258, 4285, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo.  Is this a new stadium?  I don''t know much about baseball (only that they have a strike planned for the 30th) so I wouldn''t know what stadium this is or who was playing.  I actually went to my very first ever baseball game on Thursday.  It was just a local team, but they are owned by the Huston Astros, so it was cool.  I like the grass, it looks new too.  And it always seems that way.  looked like a great day for a game, and great light for taking photos.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a nice photo.  Is this a new stadium?  I don''t know much about baseball (only that they have a strike planned for the 30th) so I wouldn''t know what stadium this is or who was playing.  I actually went to my very first ever baseball game on Thursday.  It was just a local team, but they are owned by the Huston Astros, so it was cool.  I like the grass, it looks new too.  And it always seems that way.  looked like a great day for a game, and great light for taking photos.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-17 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102259, 4285, 2829, '<td valign="top">This photo makes no sense...I do not see how there is a connection even with the title...<br/>I could stipulate that this person (in the photo) is enjoying their first baseball game...this being their new experience...Alternatively, if they were not in the photo, I could stipulate this is a new inning or the beginning of a new game...But I can''t make a clear and distinct connection here.</td>', 'This photo makes no sense...I do not see how there is a connection even with the title...I could stipulate that this person (in the photo) is enjoying their first baseball game...this being their new experience...Alternatively, if they were not in the photo, I could stipulate this is a new inning or the beginning of a new game...But I can''t make a clear and distinct connection here.', '2002-08-18 23:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
