(102269, 4287, 2928, '<td valign="top">This would have hard to get shot with no people in the background, but it would have been better  I think  The colour is a bit washy, perhaps a little more contrast is needed</td>', 'This would have hard to get shot with no people in the background, but it would have been better  I think  The colour is a bit washy, perhaps a little more contrast is needed', '2002-08-15 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102270, 4287, 2221, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. I think this photo would be better with a wider aperture so that the background is more blurred and thus less distracting from the subject.</td>', 'Nice subject. I think this photo would be better with a wider aperture so that the background is more blurred and thus less distracting from the subject.', '2002-08-17 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102271, 4287, 3080, '<td valign="top">This looks like a tribute to baseball and it also looks like it''s in front of a baseball stadium.  I don''t know much about baseball, and in fact attended my very first baseball game ever, just last Thursday, so I''m not sure what the team is there at the head of the guitar.  I''m wondering how tall this is.  Lighting is good, angle is good.  I think you could have gotten in a bit more on the shot.  I like how it''s not centered perfectly.  Nice shot and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This looks like a tribute to baseball and it also looks like it''s in front of a baseball stadium.  I don''t know much about baseball, and in fact attended my very first baseball game ever, just last Thursday, so I''m not sure what the team is there at the head of the guitar.  I''m wondering how tall this is.  Lighting is good, angle is good.  I think you could have gotten in a bit more on the shot.  I like how it''s not centered perfectly.  Nice shot and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-18 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
