(102276, 4288, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this too, the wonder of a new toy (if that''s what you were thinking) is such a marvellous thrill - I haven''t grown out of it yet anyway! I think this would work better in portrait format.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'I like this too, the wonder of a new toy (if that''s what you were thinking) is such a marvellous thrill - I haven''t grown out of it yet anyway! I think this would work better in portrait format.6, Kavey', '2002-08-12 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
