(102278, 4288, 1005, '<td valign="top">It looks like a new dolly.  Well taken shot of this figurine.  Your title leaves me a little cold (I thought my title was short!)  In my opinion, Untitled or blank (if allowed) would have been better than none.  5 Swash</td>', 'It looks like a new dolly.  Well taken shot of this figurine.  Your title leaves me a little cold (I thought my title was short!)  In my opinion, Untitled or blank (if allowed) would have been better than none.  5 Swash', '2002-08-12 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
