(102281, 4288, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photograph The colours are remarkable, the background works superbly and the subject is exquisite.  The dark colours at the back really bring out the features  About the rule of thirds, I don''t think it counts with portraits.  Finally, I think this shot could win  I can''t fault it (10)</td>', 'This is a wonderful photograph The colours are remarkable, the background works superbly and the subject is exquisite.  The dark colours at the back really bring out the features  About the rule of thirds, I don''t think it counts with portraits.  Finally, I think this shot could win  I can''t fault it (10)', '2002-08-13 07:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102282, 4288, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - pretty good<br/>Technical Aspects - pretty good. <br/>Meets Challenge - beats me.<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  pretty good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - pretty goodTechnical Aspects - pretty good. Meets Challenge - beats me.Visual Impact / Originality  pretty goodJim msp', '2002-08-13 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102283, 4288, 3266, '<td valign="top">Stepford Wives.....</td>', 'Stepford Wives.....', '2002-08-14 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102284, 4288, 3080, '<td valign="top">The background you chose for this is interesting to me.  It doesn''t seem to go with the doll, her hair or her dress at all.  I can understand this, if you didn''t want her to blend in with the background, but maybe blue wasn''t the best choice.  Maybe a pink would match her lips.  Looks like she MAY have blue eyes, but too dark right there to really tell if they are blue or green.  I LOVE how the ear rings seem to glimmer.  I wish the necklace could do the same thing.  I''m not sure if a verticle crop would have been better.  I''d like to see more of the dress.  The hair definately enhances the fact that she is new.  (or at least very well taken care of).  You LOOK at a dolls hair wrong and it goes all frizzy.  Very pretty.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'The background you chose for this is interesting to me.  It doesn''t seem to go with the doll, her hair or her dress at all.  I can understand this, if you didn''t want her to blend in with the background, but maybe blue wasn''t the best choice.  Maybe a pink would match her lips.  Looks like she MAY have blue eyes, but too dark right there to really tell if they are blue or green.  I LOVE how the ear rings seem to glimmer.  I wish the necklace could do the same thing.  I''m not sure if a verticle crop would have been better.  I''d like to see more of the dress.  The hair definately enhances the fact that she is new.  (or at least very well taken care of).  You LOOK at a dolls hair wrong and it goes all frizzy.  Very pretty.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-15 04:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102285, 4288, 3112, '<td valign="top">Excellent technical photo.  Perhaps a vertical cropping, for my taste...  9</td>', 'Excellent technical photo.  Perhaps a vertical cropping, for my taste...  9', '2002-08-15 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102286, 4288, 1037, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this photo that I like. It''s kind of kitsch, and it''s a funny play on the genre of portrait photography (like an anti-cliche). Nice work :)</td>', 'There''s something about this photo that I like. It''s kind of kitsch, and it''s a funny play on the genre of portrait photography (like an anti-cliche). Nice work :)', '2002-08-16 03:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102287, 4288, 2221, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. I like how you portrayed the "kitsch". You chose your background well. I can''t say anything how this photo could be improved.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'Very nice photo. I like how you portrayed the "kitsch". You chose your background well. I can''t say anything how this photo could be improved.-stephan', '2002-08-17 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102288, 4288, 2815, '<td valign="top">Do you want to shag now or shag later!</td>', 'Do you want to shag now or shag later!', '2002-08-17 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102289, 4289, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept of the ''new'' coins in this photo.  I think that was an excellent choice for this challenge.  In this particular image, I think that color would have been a better choice than black and white, because black and white photos are not generally associated with anything ''new''.  B/W, in most cases, gives the photo more of a sense of old.  That, coupled with the darkness in this image, doesn''t really push the NEW coins into the spotlight :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'I really like the concept of the ''new'' coins in this photo.  I think that was an excellent choice for this challenge.  In this particular image, I think that color would have been a better choice than black and white, because black and white photos are not generally associated with anything ''new''.  B/W, in most cases, gives the photo more of a sense of old.  That, coupled with the darkness in this image, doesn''t really push the NEW coins into the spotlight :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-12 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102290, 4289, 1792, '<td valign="top">The colors of the coins might have been better showing the contrasts.  This way it is sort of "flat.".  The arrangement is good and the clarity of the focus.  Color would have made this sort of "jump" out.</td>', 'The colors of the coins might have been better showing the contrasts.  This way it is sort of "flat.".  The arrangement is good and the clarity of the focus.  Color would have made this sort of "jump" out.', '2002-08-12 04:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
