(102293, 4289, 1454, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you and many others think this actually fits the challenge, but I don''t think so.</td>', 'I''m sure you and many others think this actually fits the challenge, but I don''t think so.', '2002-08-12 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
