(102312, 4291, 2643, '<td valign="top">Brings back some very fond memories; I would say it is a 10, except that the black background doesn''t really fit.  My memories with crayons are not dark, they are just the opposite.  Also, I would have liked to see more of the crayon--a higher angles might have been better. --9</td>', 'Brings back some very fond memories; I would say it is a 10, except that the black background doesn''t really fit.  My memories with crayons are not dark, they are just the opposite.  Also, I would have liked to see more of the crayon--a higher angles might have been better. --9', '2002-08-13 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102313, 4291, 1792, '<td valign="top">Composition good.  It shows something new in an artistic way and with no major photographic flaws, in my opinion.</td>', 'Composition good.  It shows something new in an artistic way and with no major photographic flaws, in my opinion.', '2002-08-14 00:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
