(102317, 4291, 806, '<td valign="top">The shaft of the crayons seem in better focus than the tips. Also the glare of light in some places is distracting. Good choice of subject.</td>', 'The shaft of the crayons seem in better focus than the tips. Also the glare of light in some places is distracting. Good choice of subject.', '2002-08-15 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102318, 4291, 2881, '<td valign="top">I like this picture lots.  I love the perspective you have on the crayons.  I was surprised when a couple people did crayons... that one never even occured to me, although it brings back great memories of childhood, when you first opened that box of NEW crayons, all sharp and bright!  Nothing was more fun to color with than NEW crayons.</td>', 'I like this picture lots.  I love the perspective you have on the crayons.  I was surprised when a couple people did crayons... that one never even occured to me, although it brings back great memories of childhood, when you first opened that box of NEW crayons, all sharp and bright!  Nothing was more fun to color with than NEW crayons.', '2002-08-15 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
