(102325, 4291, 2011, '<td valign="top">I love the straight on angle this is shot. But I think the black background and the white surface are a little distracting.  I would have gone with one or the other.  But then thats just me.</td>', 'I love the straight on angle this is shot. But I think the black background and the white surface are a little distracting.  I would have gone with one or the other.  But then thats just me.', '2002-08-18 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102326, 4291, 3080, '<td valign="top">I appreciate everyone''s comments.  Sorry about the DOF, no control over that. (autofocus).  Also, this was a really hard photo to take because the crayola wrappers are so grainy to begin with, that trying to make them look not grainy was really hard, and I didn''t succeed very well.  I know now why the other crayon photo went with NON crayola and with a brand with smoothe wrappers.  Thanks a lot.  My first challenge, I''m very thankfull for all the great comments and actually honored to have placed in the 40''s.  Thank you so much for the oppertunity.<br/>~Heather~</td>', 'I appreciate everyone''s comments.  Sorry about the DOF, no control over that. (autofocus).  Also, this was a really hard photo to take because the crayola wrappers are so grainy to begin with, that trying to make them look not grainy was really hard, and I didn''t succeed very well.  I know now why the other crayon photo went with NON crayola and with a brand with smoothe wrappers.  Thanks a lot.  My first challenge, I''m very thankfull for all the great comments and actually honored to have placed in the 40''s.  Thank you so much for the oppertunity.~Heather~', '2002-08-19 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
