(102350, 4292, 1827, '<td valign="top">I knew in an instant what these were.  Fellow rat lover here, although currently we have none.  I like this phot a lot.  It''s hard for me to determine whether it''s for love of the subject matter or on it''s merit.  Good decision not to use Rats in the title.  People would have responded differently certainly.  What a shame.<br/>Dawn</td>', 'I knew in an instant what these were.  Fellow rat lover here, although currently we have none.  I like this phot a lot.  It''s hard for me to determine whether it''s for love of the subject matter or on it''s merit.  Good decision not to use Rats in the title.  People would have responded differently certainly.  What a shame.Dawn', '2002-08-19 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
