(102383, 4296, 3080, '<td valign="top">I really like him.  I am just very impressed that he''s standing there next to a shed skin.  The only way I could have pulled this off is to use one of the unfortunate ones that you find in the road that''s been hit by a car.  I can never seem to get pics of bugs cause they all fly away, so I have an appreciation for people who can get pics of them. Congrats and good luck.</td>', 'I really like him.  I am just very impressed that he''s standing there next to a shed skin.  The only way I could have pulled this off is to use one of the unfortunate ones that you find in the road that''s been hit by a car.  I can never seem to get pics of bugs cause they all fly away, so I have an appreciation for people who can get pics of them. Congrats and good luck.', '2002-08-13 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102384, 4296, 2798, '<td valign="top">Wow. What an amazing photo opportunity.</td>', 'Wow. What an amazing photo opportunity.', '2002-08-14 07:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102385, 4296, 1519, '<td valign="top">Holy moly! This is so disgusting! ;) I''m truthfully teasing because I hate insects, but this is just such an amazing shot that I give it a 10! Wow!  Awesome composition, awesome focus, amazing detail, fits the challenge perfectly! Gross! ;) Nice catch!</td>', 'Holy moly! This is so disgusting! ;) I''m truthfully teasing because I hate insects, but this is just such an amazing shot that I give it a 10! Wow!  Awesome composition, awesome focus, amazing detail, fits the challenge perfectly! Gross! ;) Nice catch!', '2002-08-14 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102386, 4296, 436, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful catch and a superb macro.  The cicada and its old skin are even on a marvelous textured backdrop.  crisa58</td>', 'What a wonderful catch and a superb macro.  The cicada and its old skin are even on a marvelous textured backdrop.  crisa58', '2002-08-14 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
