(102492, 4304, 1877, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot.. I''d put this on my wall. Why? Because the names of the crayons. Not only do you have very bright, wonderful colors.. but the fact that all the crayons are named simple names except for the tangerine one.. its "vivid tangerine"-- it draws you to it, it stands out. I like this photo a lot. New crayons are always fun to take pics of. Good job! 10</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot.. I''d put this on my wall. Why? Because the names of the crayons. Not only do you have very bright, wonderful colors.. but the fact that all the crayons are named simple names except for the tangerine one.. its "vivid tangerine"-- it draws you to it, it stands out. I like this photo a lot. New crayons are always fun to take pics of. Good job! 10', '2002-08-13 20:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102493, 4304, 3060, '<td valign="top">nice bright colours, and they defintely have that "new" look around them. i seem to do bad in challenges cos of lack of a solid colour background, but you have done nicely.</td>', 'nice bright colours, and they defintely have that "new" look around them. i seem to do bad in challenges cos of lack of a solid colour background, but you have done nicely.', '2002-08-14 04:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
