(102501, 4304, 2881, '<td valign="top">Memories of childhood... what fun to color with a brand new box of crayons... sharp and unblemished by the other crayons! I like the reflection of the colors on the white background.  I might have cropped differently, to include more of the box, and less white.</td>', 'Memories of childhood... what fun to color with a brand new box of crayons... sharp and unblemished by the other crayons! I like the reflection of the colors on the white background.  I might have cropped differently, to include more of the box, and less white.', '2002-08-15 20:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
