(102529, 4307, 2437, '<td valign="top">picture is a bit dark</td>', 'picture is a bit dark', '2002-08-14 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102530, 4307, 2932, '<td valign="top">funny as hell!  I have never seen one of those before.  a lot of distractions in the pic tho.</td>', 'funny as hell!  I have never seen one of those before.  a lot of distractions in the pic tho.', '2002-08-15 01:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102531, 4307, 3044, '<td valign="top">i applaud you for finding a sign that read "new". i looked all over and couldnt find one. my suggestions are based on how i would have shot this. to me the street and all the background stuff is kind of distracting. i would have done an up close shot filling the view finder with the stop sign an d the orange sign. maybe shoot up towards the sky. you could have some nice colors with the red, orange and the blue of the sky. just my opinion.</td>', 'i applaud you for finding a sign that read "new". i looked all over and couldnt find one. my suggestions are based on how i would have shot this. to me the street and all the background stuff is kind of distracting. i would have done an up close shot filling the view finder with the stop sign an d the orange sign. maybe shoot up towards the sky. you could have some nice colors with the red, orange and the blue of the sky. just my opinion.', '2002-08-15 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102532, 4307, 3112, '<td valign="top">Large view of what could be a very good subject.  Better framing necessary, more sign, less context.</td>', 'Large view of what could be a very good subject.  Better framing necessary, more sign, less context.', '2002-08-15 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102533, 4307, 3080, '<td valign="top">Kind of looks like you took this out your car window as you were stopped at the new stop sign.  I think it would have been a bit more visually appealing to take the photo head on, or from a bottom angle, looking up.  Maybe could have been taken when the sun was a bit brighter, however, that may have cast too much reflection onto the sign and that would have been distracting.  For being what looks like a spur of the moment photo, you caught the sign so it is almost exactly vertical.  Good eye for that.  If I would have taken it, we would have end up looking at it diagnally.  Photo kind of makes me laugh.  Definately depicts something new.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Kind of looks like you took this out your car window as you were stopped at the new stop sign.  I think it would have been a bit more visually appealing to take the photo head on, or from a bottom angle, looking up.  Maybe could have been taken when the sun was a bit brighter, however, that may have cast too much reflection onto the sign and that would have been distracting.  For being what looks like a spur of the moment photo, you caught the sign so it is almost exactly vertical.  Good eye for that.  If I would have taken it, we would have end up looking at it diagnally.  Photo kind of makes me laugh.  Definately depicts something new.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-17 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102534, 4307, 2204, '<td valign="top">power lines in a photo are always a detraction in my opinion.   The focus could be better also.  I''m not sure how this meets the challenge topic either.  Was this taken at dawn of a new day?  Is this a new stop sign? or is the focal point the NEW sign over the top of the stop sign?  I just don''t understand.......</td>', 'power lines in a photo are always a detraction in my opinion.   The focus could be better also.  I''m not sure how this meets the challenge topic either.  Was this taken at dawn of a new day?  Is this a new stop sign? or is the focal point the NEW sign over the top of the stop sign?  I just don''t understand.......', '2002-08-18 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102535, 4307, 2829, '<td valign="top">LOL<br/>I know you didn''t put that there....Definitely nice</td>', 'LOLI know you didn''t put that there....Definitely nice', '2002-08-19 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102536, 4308, 811, '<td valign="top">I lvoe the blue sky and how the cloud takes up the left side of the picture.  I can tell from the alignment on teh right that it is a true vertical, but it looks kinda leaning on the left side of the structure.   Maybe crop  a little off the top since it is empty. karmat</td>', 'I lvoe the blue sky and how the cloud takes up the left side of the picture.  I can tell from the alignment on teh right that it is a true vertical, but it looks kinda leaning on the left side of the structure.   Maybe crop  a little off the top since it is empty. karmat', '2002-08-12 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
