(102548, 4309, 1255, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot! I love the orange tones throughout the vase!</td>', 'Gorgeous shot! I love the orange tones throughout the vase!', '2002-08-12 09:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102549, 4309, 1779, '<td valign="top">cool!</td>', 'cool!', '2002-08-12 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102550, 4309, 3080, '<td valign="top">If I''m right, we have a photo of some glass blowing technique.  I really like this.  Definately unique.  Great idea.  I think people are going to say it''s a little dark, but with the subject matter, I don''t think you could have done much to prevent that.  Congrats and good luck.</td>', 'If I''m right, we have a photo of some glass blowing technique.  I really like this.  Definately unique.  Great idea.  I think people are going to say it''s a little dark, but with the subject matter, I don''t think you could have done much to prevent that.  Congrats and good luck.', '2002-08-12 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102551, 4309, 2256, '<td valign="top">GREAT picture!</td>', 'GREAT picture!', '2002-08-12 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102552, 4309, 205, '<td valign="top">blow me a bong</td>', 'blow me a bong', '2002-08-12 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102553, 4309, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great colours and not just flame but a flame which makes me feel the heat. I do like this. The balance isn''t tops for me, I know the vase is at the left but it doesn''t quite compensate for all the bright flame at the right. I can''t wait to see your outtakes, am wondering if there are any with the craftsman him/herself?<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Great colours and not just flame but a flame which makes me feel the heat. I do like this. The balance isn''t tops for me, I know the vase is at the left but it doesn''t quite compensate for all the bright flame at the right. I can''t wait to see your outtakes, am wondering if there are any with the craftsman him/herself?7, Kavey', '2002-08-12 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102554, 4309, 1005, '<td valign="top">I must say, WOW.!  This is great by any standard.  Don''t change a thing.  It''s a 10 all the way.  Swash</td>', 'I must say, WOW.!  This is great by any standard.  Don''t change a thing.  It''s a 10 all the way.  Swash', '2002-08-12 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102555, 4309, 2587, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Nicelly captured. The composition is a bit off (I would''ve liked to see the completed curve on the right) but I''m sure it would be hard to get the flames just where you want them. :-)</td>', 'Great idea. Nicelly captured. The composition is a bit off (I would''ve liked to see the completed curve on the right) but I''m sure it would be hard to get the flames just where you want them. :-)', '2002-08-12 21:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102556, 4309, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition8<br/>Technical Aspects8<br/>Appeal9<br/>Creativity10<br/>Rating9Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition8Technical Aspects8Appeal9Creativity10Rating9Autool', '2002-08-12 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102557, 4309, 1095, '<td valign="top">The bright color is great. The bright highlights really invoke the heat. Very nice!</td>', 'The bright color is great. The bright highlights really invoke the heat. Very nice!', '2002-08-13 01:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102558, 4309, 1037, '<td valign="top">Awesome! My favourite shot so far. I love the high contrast, I can almost feel the heat from the furnace. A 10 from me! - lisae</td>', 'Awesome! My favourite shot so far. I love the high contrast, I can almost feel the heat from the furnace. A 10 from me! - lisae', '2002-08-13 07:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102559, 4309, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Focus is good.  Lighting is good.  Subject is great.  Good composition of the photo.  8</td>', 'Very nice.  Focus is good.  Lighting is good.  Subject is great.  Good composition of the photo.  8', '2002-08-13 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102560, 4309, 671, '<td valign="top">great idea!</td>', 'great idea!', '2002-08-13 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102561, 4309, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - very good<br/>Technical Aspects - very good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  high<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - very goodTechnical Aspects - very goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  highJim msp', '2002-08-13 18:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102562, 4309, 3273, '<td valign="top">Like it.  Strong colors.</td>', 'Like it.  Strong colors.', '2002-08-14 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102563, 4309, 2173, '<td valign="top">really good!!!!</td>', 'really good!!!!', '2002-08-14 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102564, 4309, 573, '<td valign="top">Tel me that this was taken in manual mode and I will give you "Highest Technical Honors".  The only thing I can find that in my opinion could be improved is  framing/croping of the port to show just a sliver more to the right so that the full rim is in frame.  My ten this week.</td>', 'Tel me that this was taken in manual mode and I will give you "Highest Technical Honors".  The only thing I can find that in my opinion could be improved is  framing/croping of the port to show just a sliver more to the right so that the full rim is in frame.  My ten this week.', '2002-08-14 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102565, 4309, 527, '<td valign="top">Looks like you went a little crazy with the contrast and sharpening. Pretty cool picture, though.<br/><br/>8  -Tim J</td>', 'Looks like you went a little crazy with the contrast and sharpening. Pretty cool picture, though.8  -Tim J', '2002-08-14 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102566, 4309, 2752, '<td valign="top">great shot of the fire and glass..can feel the heat...good composition</td>', 'great shot of the fire and glass..can feel the heat...good composition', '2002-08-15 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102567, 4309, 2798, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of the flames and the light through the glass. Also good composition.</td>', 'Excellent capture of the flames and the light through the glass. Also good composition.', '2002-08-15 07:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102568, 4309, 2923, '<td valign="top">wow...  nice texture, nice lighting!</td>', 'wow...  nice texture, nice lighting!', '2002-08-16 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102569, 4309, 2204, '<td valign="top">If not for the title I would have interpreted this as burning something not new.  The color and texture are wonderful.  I can feel the heat of the fire right through my monitor.  I wish i could have seen the new without the title though.....sorry I''m not scoring this higher =7 syamjonimi</td>', 'If not for the title I would have interpreted this as burning something not new.  The color and texture are wonderful.  I can feel the heat of the fire right through my monitor.  I wish i could have seen the new without the title though.....sorry I''m not scoring this higher =7 syamjonimi', '2002-08-17 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102570, 4309, 772, '<td valign="top">can I just say ''wow'' and leave it at that?  :)  This is an incredibly high impact photo for the ''new'' challenge.  = 10 - jmsetzler</td>', 'can I just say ''wow'' and leave it at that?  :)  This is an incredibly high impact photo for the ''new'' challenge.  = 10 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-17 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
