(102640, 4311, 1644, '<td valign="top">I have lots of dogs, and I know from experience that it''s really hard not to get that glare in their eyes. A little more natural light and a better angle would have dimished that I think. If you use any type of flash you''ll usually get the glare. Seems a little fuzzy too.</td>', 'I have lots of dogs, and I know from experience that it''s really hard not to get that glare in their eyes. A little more natural light and a better angle would have dimished that I think. If you use any type of flash you''ll usually get the glare. Seems a little fuzzy too.', '2002-08-16 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102641, 4311, 3080, '<td valign="top">He doesn''t seem so new anymore.  However, he could be new to YOU, so who am I to judge??  Looks like he took over the bed.  We know who''s boss here. :)  I think he''s adorable.  He''s got a bit of alien eye syndrome.  I''m not sure yet how it works, but is this kind of the same thing as red eye?  Some cameras have a setting to reduce red eye.  Would it work with the "blue eye" thing happening here?  When voting is all said and done, could someone let me in on how the red eye, blue eye thing works, and how it can be fixed, if at all?  I think this is a great photo. Congrats and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'He doesn''t seem so new anymore.  However, he could be new to YOU, so who am I to judge??  Looks like he took over the bed.  We know who''s boss here. :)  I think he''s adorable.  He''s got a bit of alien eye syndrome.  I''m not sure yet how it works, but is this kind of the same thing as red eye?  Some cameras have a setting to reduce red eye.  Would it work with the "blue eye" thing happening here?  When voting is all said and done, could someone let me in on how the red eye, blue eye thing works, and how it can be fixed, if at all?  I think this is a great photo. Congrats and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-17 00:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102642, 4311, 1280, '<td valign="top">Awwwww what a sweet face!  I''d like to see this a little brighter to see a little more detail on her or his beautiful face.  I must say this seems to be a dog with a little age...expression in the eyes...but if it is new to you then it is new...:-)</td>', 'Awwwww what a sweet face!  I''d like to see this a little brighter to see a little more detail on her or his beautiful face.  I must say this seems to be a dog with a little age...expression in the eyes...but if it is new to you then it is new...:-)', '2002-08-18 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102643, 4311, 1042, '<td valign="top">These are your "insults"???? I''ve seen worse. You need to know that while criticism may be  hard to take, you should learn from it instead of be hurt by it.</td>', 'These are your "insults"???? I''ve seen worse. You need to know that while criticism may be  hard to take, you should learn from it instead of be hurt by it.', '2002-08-19 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
