(102651, 4312, 2928, '<td valign="top">Hey, I wondered how many babies I''d see.  Before I start - I''m scoring this 10.  I had decided before I stared voting that babies were too obvious, and that Id score them down because of a lack of invention.  But, boy, this is one fantastic picture.  The purity and innocence positively shine out of this shot.  It has it all, its technically well done, it captures the challenge and of course  it gets the ooooh vote I dont think luck comes into this, but good luck If it isnt in the top 5 Ill be surprised</td>', 'Hey, I wondered how many babies I''d see.  Before I start - I''m scoring this 10.  I had decided before I stared voting that babies were too obvious, and that Id score them down because of a lack of invention.  But, boy, this is one fantastic picture.  The purity and innocence positively shine out of this shot.  It has it all, its technically well done, it captures the challenge and of course  it gets the ooooh vote I dont think luck comes into this, but good luck If it isnt in the top 5 Ill be surprised', '2002-08-12 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102652, 4312, 2997, '<td valign="top">There were a few baby pictures submitted this time (like none of us expected it).  Yours was by far the best framed shot of a baby.</td>', 'There were a few baby pictures submitted this time (like none of us expected it).  Yours was by far the best framed shot of a baby.', '2002-08-12 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
