(102656, 4312, 715, '<td valign="top">Great detail and the way you cropped/framed the photo sets it apart from yet another baby-photo. Somehow I''d like to see everything shifted a little more towards the bottom though, thus showing a part of the other eye and removing the empty part below the chin. Good job and congratulations with the newborn!</td>', 'Great detail and the way you cropped/framed the photo sets it apart from yet another baby-photo. Somehow I''d like to see everything shifted a little more towards the bottom though, thus showing a part of the other eye and removing the empty part below the chin. Good job and congratulations with the newborn!', '2002-08-13 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
