(102664, 4312, 1280, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful...perfection! I love this and it''s one of my top 3 that I gave 10''s to. Grayce...aka...Gracious</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful...perfection! I love this and it''s one of my top 3 that I gave 10''s to. Grayce...aka...Gracious', '2002-08-16 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102665, 4312, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately very new.  It does''t get much newer than this.  I like how the baby is still all puffy. lol.  I''m really glad you submitted this in color.  The close up is great.  I was thinking I might have wanted to see a wider shot to see more of the baby''s face, but then thought that the close up showed his newness very well.  The photo was thought out, and creativly taken.  It''s not just a picture of a baby.  Great shot and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Definately very new.  It does''t get much newer than this.  I like how the baby is still all puffy. lol.  I''m really glad you submitted this in color.  The close up is great.  I was thinking I might have wanted to see a wider shot to see more of the baby''s face, but then thought that the close up showed his newness very well.  The photo was thought out, and creativly taken.  It''s not just a picture of a baby.  Great shot and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-17 13:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102666, 4312, 2834, '<td valign="top">Beautiful baby and nice cropping.</td>', 'Beautiful baby and nice cropping.', '2002-08-18 19:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
