(102668, 4312, 2997, '<td valign="top">I was very disappointed to see that your baby picture actually scored worse than a number of others.  I guess it just goes to show that we all view things differently.</td>', 'I was very disappointed to see that your baby picture actually scored worse than a number of others.  I guess it just goes to show that we all view things differently.', '2002-08-19 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
