(102673, 4313, 3018, '<td valign="top">Nice cropping of the picture, but the face is not in total focus. Congrats on your new baby!</td>', 'Nice cropping of the picture, but the face is not in total focus. Congrats on your new baby!', '2002-08-12 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102674, 4313, 3087, '<td valign="top">A really unusual shot of what is, perhaps, an obvious subject matter. This really is one of the best and most unusual baby photos I have seen for a long time. I love that you can see the downy skin in such detail and the lovely newborn shape to the closed eyes and the DOF is great. I really like this. <br/>One question, looking into the background, I can see the baby''s arm at the top left, but what is it at the top right?<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'A really unusual shot of what is, perhaps, an obvious subject matter. This really is one of the best and most unusual baby photos I have seen for a long time. I love that you can see the downy skin in such detail and the lovely newborn shape to the closed eyes and the DOF is great. I really like this. One question, looking into the background, I can see the baby''s arm at the top left, but what is it at the top right?9, Kavey', '2002-08-12 17:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102675, 4313, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition6<br/>Technical Aspects7<br/>Appeal6<br/>Creativity7<br/>Rating7Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition6Technical Aspects7Appeal6Creativity7Rating7Autool', '2002-08-12 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102676, 4313, 656, '<td valign="top">different angle makes a usually trite subject visually interesting</td>', 'different angle makes a usually trite subject visually interesting', '2002-08-12 23:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102677, 4313, 917, '<td valign="top">At last, someone has actually put some thought into a baby shot! Love the texture on the cheek. Could use a bit more depth to bring the nose into focus a bit more.</td>', 'At last, someone has actually put some thought into a baby shot! Love the texture on the cheek. Could use a bit more depth to bring the nose into focus a bit more.', '2002-08-13 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
