(102679, 4313, 3127, '<td valign="top">Great close-up.</td>', 'Great close-up.', '2002-08-13 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102680, 4313, 3126, '<td valign="top">I like how you eliminated all the unecessary detailsby shooting only the face.  However, in my very own humble opinion, i think this would have been more powerful as a black and white photo.  It would tend to soften the photo.</td>', 'I like how you eliminated all the unecessary detailsby shooting only the face.  However, in my very own humble opinion, i think this would have been more powerful as a black and white photo.  It would tend to soften the photo.', '2002-08-13 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102681, 4313, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - pretty good<br/>Technical Aspects - pretty good. <br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  pretty good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - pretty goodTechnical Aspects - pretty good. Meets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  pretty goodJim msp', '2002-08-13 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102682, 4313, 1175, '<td valign="top">This is a great image.  I would have prefered the DOF going from the eye to the nose and mouth.  Those are the interesting parts of your subject, they should be in focus.</td>', 'This is a great image.  I would have prefered the DOF going from the eye to the nose and mouth.  Those are the interesting parts of your subject, they should be in focus.', '2002-08-14 09:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102683, 4313, 1519, '<td valign="top">Well, this is just precious. Nice work. :)</td>', 'Well, this is just precious. Nice work. :)', '2002-08-14 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102684, 4313, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is almost a perfect shot.  You have captured the real essence of new innocence, wonder and beauty in the image.  The DOF has been used to great effect, the lighting is perfect and the feelings of serenity and contentment flood from the picture.  But, and it''s only a small but, the background is just not far enough out of focus to stop the eye being drawn away from all that foreground beauty This is only a personal opinion; good luck (8)</td>', 'This is almost a perfect shot.  You have captured the real essence of new innocence, wonder and beauty in the image.  The DOF has been used to great effect, the lighting is perfect and the feelings of serenity and contentment flood from the picture.  But, and it''s only a small but, the background is just not far enough out of focus to stop the eye being drawn away from all that foreground beauty This is only a personal opinion; good luck (8)', '2002-08-15 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102685, 4313, 327, '<td valign="top">Well done. Score-8 Kee</td>', 'Well done. Score-8 Kee', '2002-08-15 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102686, 4313, 715, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail and a well chosen angle. The DOF is working very good, drawing the viewers attention to the eye. I think  the background  behind the baby''s hand is disturbing though. Nevertheless congratulations with both the photo and the baby :)</td>', 'Very nice detail and a well chosen angle. The DOF is working very good, drawing the viewers attention to the eye. I think  the background  behind the baby''s hand is disturbing though. Nevertheless congratulations with both the photo and the baby :)', '2002-08-15 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102687, 4313, 3112, '<td valign="top">wow.  Not perfect, but awful close. just a tad more depth...</td>', 'wow.  Not perfect, but awful close. just a tad more depth...', '2002-08-15 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
