(102690, 4313, 3080, '<td valign="top">Your photo is nice and the lighting is great.  I wish the nose was as clear as the rest of the face.  Definately new.  Eyes still puffy and everything.  Great shot of a great event.  Congrats and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Your photo is nice and the lighting is great.  I wish the nose was as clear as the rest of the face.  Definately new.  Eyes still puffy and everything.  Great shot of a great event.  Congrats and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-17 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
