(102718, 4314, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite new flower photos this week.  I love the balence of colors with the yellow and red, to the green in the background.  I wonder if you did the exact shame shot and put a magnitying glass over your lens, if it would make it a bit more crisp.  Sometimes with digital cameras, a bit is lost when you use zooms, the mag. glass just helps to replace that.  Your lighting is supurb, couldn''t have been better.  I like the variety of shades of green in the background.  Very nice shot. Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This is one of my favorite new flower photos this week.  I love the balence of colors with the yellow and red, to the green in the background.  I wonder if you did the exact shame shot and put a magnitying glass over your lens, if it would make it a bit more crisp.  Sometimes with digital cameras, a bit is lost when you use zooms, the mag. glass just helps to replace that.  Your lighting is supurb, couldn''t have been better.  I like the variety of shades of green in the background.  Very nice shot. Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-18 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
