(102825, 4324, 3351, '<td valign="top">scary!!!<br/></td>', 'scary!!!', '2002-08-18 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102826, 4324, 3080, '<td valign="top">New baby, new teeth.  This one looks like she could tear a whopper apart even without the teeth. lol.  my son was the same way.  over 10lbs when he was born and still hasn''t slowed down a bit now that he''s 2.  The lighting is good.  no distracting shadows, however, the light glare on her face is ALMOST getting too bright.  you caught the teeth great.  nice job and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'New baby, new teeth.  This one looks like she could tear a whopper apart even without the teeth. lol.  my son was the same way.  over 10lbs when he was born and still hasn''t slowed down a bit now that he''s 2.  The lighting is good.  no distracting shadows, however, the light glare on her face is ALMOST getting too bright.  you caught the teeth great.  nice job and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-18 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102827, 4324, 975, '<td valign="top">She sure is cute!</td>', 'She sure is cute!', '2002-08-19 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102828, 4325, 2261, '<td valign="top">Its too dark and too green for me. I need a dash of colour to liven this up.</td>', 'Its too dark and too green for me. I need a dash of colour to liven this up.', '2002-08-12 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102829, 4325, 933, '<td valign="top">nice composition.  colors seem a bit muted.  very nice shot.  7 md</td>', 'nice composition.  colors seem a bit muted.  very nice shot.  7 md', '2002-08-12 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102830, 4325, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nice - has a very serene feel to it!</td>', 'Very nice - has a very serene feel to it!', '2002-08-12 19:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102831, 4325, 2170, '<td valign="top">Could be a bit brighter, but beautiful.</td>', 'Could be a bit brighter, but beautiful.', '2002-08-12 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102832, 4325, 616, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. Great focus and lighting. I like the background It''s not just a bunch of bushes, that distracts from the subject. The black background helps you focus on the buds.</td>', 'Nice macro. Great focus and lighting. I like the background It''s not just a bunch of bushes, that distracts from the subject. The black background helps you focus on the buds.', '2002-08-12 21:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102833, 4325, 2752, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition...like the green and dark interplay.</td>', 'Lovely composition...like the green and dark interplay.', '2002-08-12 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102834, 4325, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition6<br/>Technical Aspects6<br/>Appeal6<br/>Creativity5<br/>Rating6Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition6Technical Aspects6Appeal6Creativity5Rating6Autool', '2002-08-12 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102835, 4325, 3127, '<td valign="top">Really terrific shot. Great contrast of green with darkness beyond.</td>', 'Really terrific shot. Great contrast of green with darkness beyond.', '2002-08-13 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102836, 4325, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice, a little too dark and too monochromatic for me.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Nice, a little too dark and too monochromatic for me.5, Kavey', '2002-08-13 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102837, 4325, 2353, '<td valign="top">Beautifully shot...wonderful job!</td>', 'Beautifully shot...wonderful job!', '2002-08-13 22:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102838, 4325, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - pretty good<br/>Technical Aspects - pretty good. <br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  pretty good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - pretty goodTechnical Aspects - pretty good. Meets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  pretty goodJim msp', '2002-08-13 23:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102839, 4325, 3147, '<td valign="top">very beautiful.  i really like this photo!</td>', 'very beautiful.  i really like this photo!', '2002-08-14 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102840, 4325, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2002-08-16 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102841, 4325, 1891, '<td valign="top">Where''s the sunrise?</td>', 'Where''s the sunrise?', '2002-08-16 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102842, 4325, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot.  I like the shadows, but it does seem just a tad dark.  Very nice with the three stages of the flower''s blooming cycle.  In most cases, I do like having items blurred in the foreground, in this case, maybe it''s just a little too big of an area of blur.  Still this is wonderful and fully deserve at least a 9.  Swash</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot.  I like the shadows, but it does seem just a tad dark.  Very nice with the three stages of the flower''s blooming cycle.  In most cases, I do like having items blurred in the foreground, in this case, maybe it''s just a little too big of an area of blur.  Still this is wonderful and fully deserve at least a 9.  Swash', '2002-08-16 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102843, 4325, 2983, '<td valign="top">A very nice flower shot.  You''re trying to fit the challenge, so you usually don''t see shots like this.  Good job.</td>', 'A very nice flower shot.  You''re trying to fit the challenge, so you usually don''t see shots like this.  Good job.', '2002-08-18 02:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102844, 4325, 3080, '<td valign="top">It wasn''t until recently that my mother explained to me that hibiscus only open in the day time.  I think that''s neat.  this is a nice shot with the black background and the actual flower being the only thing in sharp focus.  lighting is great.  not much color though.  not your fault, but it''s a little too green for me to hang on my wall in the house.  doesn''t mean it''s not a good photo though.  definately depicts something new.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It wasn''t until recently that my mother explained to me that hibiscus only open in the day time.  I think that''s neat.  this is a nice shot with the black background and the actual flower being the only thing in sharp focus.  lighting is great.  not much color though.  not your fault, but it''s a little too green for me to hang on my wall in the house.  doesn''t mean it''s not a good photo though.  definately depicts something new.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-18 18:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102845, 4325, 2204, '<td valign="top">My initial impression was 7.  Now after viewing it again I think it is better.  The dark background combined with the intense blur of the leaves in the background and the focus directly on the Hibiscus bloom creates an impressive photo.  Thrule of thirds is interesting also.  When I first open the picture up my eye is drawn to the tip of the bud and then it travels to the lower left cross section.  Upon further examination I am giving this a 10.  syamjonimi</td>', 'My initial impression was 7.  Now after viewing it again I think it is better.  The dark background combined with the intense blur of the leaves in the background and the focus directly on the Hibiscus bloom creates an impressive photo.  Thrule of thirds is interesting also.  When I first open the picture up my eye is drawn to the tip of the bud and then it travels to the lower left cross section.  Upon further examination I am giving this a 10.  syamjonimi', '2002-08-18 21:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102846, 4326, 2223, '<td valign="top">i remeber seeing these somewhere....</td>', 'i remeber seeing these somewhere....', '2002-08-12 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102847, 4326, 2154, '<td valign="top">fine picture.  I do not "get" the "something new" here</td>', 'fine picture.  I do not "get" the "something new" here', '2002-08-13 04:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102848, 4326, 671, '<td valign="top">Nice composition!</td>', 'Nice composition!', '2002-08-13 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
