(102850, 4326, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - quitegood<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good. <br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  pretty good/ quite good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - quitegoodTechnical Aspects - quite good. Meets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  pretty good/ quite goodJim msp', '2002-08-13 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102851, 4326, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice, colourful photo. I would prefer it if you had framed it without the wheels there though. A closer crop on just a few suns would be great!</td>', 'Very nice, colourful photo. I would prefer it if you had framed it without the wheels there though. A closer crop on just a few suns would be great!', '2002-08-14 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102852, 4326, 2937, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but I don''t think it meets the challenge ;-)</td>', 'Nice picture, but I don''t think it meets the challenge ;-)', '2002-08-16 04:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102853, 4326, 3198, '<td valign="top">not a very nice shot. good title</td>', 'not a very nice shot. good title', '2002-08-16 05:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102854, 4326, 3080, '<td valign="top">This looks like a ride at a fair or carnival.  Not real sure that they LOOK like they are for sale, but rather just decoration.  That, however, is just an observation, an opinion.  It will not affect my rating of this photo.  I love the angle this was shot at.  Also, I like how the entire photo seems to be in great focus.  I have to admire this due to the fact that I only have auto-focus and have to do what my camera tells me to do. lol.  Lighting is great.  Wish there was less unidentified stuff in the background, but that''s not your fault.  I have to wonder how these were made.  Pretty cool.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This looks like a ride at a fair or carnival.  Not real sure that they LOOK like they are for sale, but rather just decoration.  That, however, is just an observation, an opinion.  It will not affect my rating of this photo.  I love the angle this was shot at.  Also, I like how the entire photo seems to be in great focus.  I have to admire this due to the fact that I only have auto-focus and have to do what my camera tells me to do. lol.  Lighting is great.  Wish there was less unidentified stuff in the background, but that''s not your fault.  I have to wonder how these were made.  Pretty cool.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-16 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102855, 4326, 772, '<td valign="top">I love the color and designs in this one... the only thing I don''t care for here is the busy background... it''s not a large part of the image, but it makes my eyes wonder around... - jmsetzler</td>', 'I love the color and designs in this one... the only thing I don''t care for here is the busy background... it''s not a large part of the image, but it makes my eyes wonder around... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-17 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
