(102866, 4327, 2818, '<td valign="top">Pretty flower, grama.  I didn''t see any of these when I was there this weekend.  Where were you hiding them?  LOL   Love you!!   Nic</td>', 'Pretty flower, grama.  I didn''t see any of these when I was there this weekend.  Where were you hiding them?  LOL   Love you!!   Nic', '2002-08-13 03:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
