(102868, 4327, 3087, '<td valign="top">I promised myself I''d comment on all photos which I scored &amp;gt;=5 but I am a little stuck on this one. I know I am definite about my rating of it - I rate photos to my own internal plan (1 means this, 2 means this) but also against each other. I just don''t know why I don''t like this more/ less than I do. I will come back to it and try and be more useful if I can. Apologies for my lack of anything useful (though for all I know all my comments are useless and no help at all!).<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'I promised myself I''d comment on all photos which I scored &gt;=5 but I am a little stuck on this one. I know I am definite about my rating of it - I rate photos to my own internal plan (1 means this, 2 means this) but also against each other. I just don''t know why I don''t like this more/ less than I do. I will come back to it and try and be more useful if I can. Apologies for my lack of anything useful (though for all I know all my comments are useless and no help at all!).5, Kavey', '2002-08-13 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102869, 4327, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - quite good, background "line" is slightly distracting<br/>Technical Aspects - very good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  quite good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - quite good, background "line" is slightly distractingTechnical Aspects - very goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  quite goodJim msp', '2002-08-13 19:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102870, 4327, 2764, '<td valign="top">aagh - straighten that horizon line...</td>', 'aagh - straighten that horizon line...', '2002-08-14 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102871, 4327, 2881, '<td valign="top">Nice study of a flower about to bloom. A beautiful but unusual choice of blossoms... I guess we all mostly work with what we have at hand. Taking the flower out if it''s "natural" state lets you focus absolutely on the color, texture, and overall beauty. The dark background works well, but I find the big blank area in the upper right a bit distracting.  I keep thinking something should be, but I don''t know how you would fill this and keep the pure and uncluttered look you achieved.  This is one to be proud of... not "just another flower picture"!</td>', 'Nice study of a flower about to bloom. A beautiful but unusual choice of blossoms... I guess we all mostly work with what we have at hand. Taking the flower out if it''s "natural" state lets you focus absolutely on the color, texture, and overall beauty. The dark background works well, but I find the big blank area in the upper right a bit distracting.  I keep thinking something should be, but I don''t know how you would fill this and keep the pure and uncluttered look you achieved.  This is one to be proud of... not "just another flower picture"!', '2002-08-15 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102872, 4327, 3080, '<td valign="top">this is really neat.  I like how it come into the photo, but doesn''t leave.  I''m thinking I see that rule of thirds applied here. (I''m fairly new to that concept, so I''ve been looking for what I think applies to the RO3''s)  This is very visually appealing.  I asked my mother (who knows a lot about flowers than me) and she said that she thought it was a hibiscus? which only opens in the day time.  That even adds another dimention of the something new concept.  Great shot and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'this is really neat.  I like how it come into the photo, but doesn''t leave.  I''m thinking I see that rule of thirds applied here. (I''m fairly new to that concept, so I''ve been looking for what I think applies to the RO3''s)  This is very visually appealing.  I asked my mother (who knows a lot about flowers than me) and she said that she thought it was a hibiscus? which only opens in the day time.  That even adds another dimention of the something new concept.  Great shot and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-16 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102873, 4327, 2923, '<td valign="top">nice composition, good macro shot</td>', 'nice composition, good macro shot', '2002-08-16 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
