(102894, 4328, 3084, '<td valign="top">I especially enjoyed this shot.  Very nice.  The isolation of the subject with the control of the depth of field makes it work for me.  Thank you for submitting it. 10 Morgan</td>', 'I especially enjoyed this shot.  Very nice.  The isolation of the subject with the control of the depth of field makes it work for me.  Thank you for submitting it. 10 Morgan', '2002-08-14 07:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
