(102901, 4328, 2158, '<td valign="top">I find the lighting much too harsh to do the flower justice - especially the black shadow at the top of the stem.</td>', 'I find the lighting much too harsh to do the flower justice - especially the black shadow at the top of the stem.', '2002-08-14 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
