(102903, 4328, 2370, '<td valign="top">whoa.. nice colours!!</td>', 'whoa.. nice colours!!', '2002-08-15 07:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102904, 4328, 2928, '<td valign="top">The colour is so rich it seems to be creating a smudged look. Perhaps a really sharp image with a little less contrast would have worked better...</td>', 'The colour is so rich it seems to be creating a smudged look. Perhaps a really sharp image with a little less contrast would have worked better...', '2002-08-15 10:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102905, 4328, 3105, '<td valign="top">I would think that most people would agree that this is way too oversaturated.  You''re losing a lot of detail in the petals by saturating the colors this much.  Plus, I would probably try to frame it differently.  The two leaves branching off to either side are a little distracting with the rose being framed so tightly.<br/>Score: 3<br/>Courtenay</td>', 'I would think that most people would agree that this is way too oversaturated.  You''re losing a lot of detail in the petals by saturating the colors this much.  Plus, I would probably try to frame it differently.  The two leaves branching off to either side are a little distracting with the rose being framed so tightly.Score: 3Courtenay', '2002-08-15 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102906, 4328, 806, '<td valign="top">The colors seem unreal in this photo, and the frontal light gives the bud a flat appearance.</td>', 'The colors seem unreal in this photo, and the frontal light gives the bud a flat appearance.', '2002-08-15 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102907, 4328, 3112, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Mapplethorpe in color.  just a little more depthe would have made this one ideal, but the focus goes soft just on the center leaf.  Also, I may have cropped to allow both the raised and lowered leaves to run off the corners this would have hidden the tiny diseased end on the left. Otherwise excellent marks -  9</td>', 'Reminds me of Mapplethorpe in color.  just a little more depthe would have made this one ideal, but the focus goes soft just on the center leaf.  Also, I may have cropped to allow both the raised and lowered leaves to run off the corners this would have hidden the tiny diseased end on the left. Otherwise excellent marks -  9', '2002-08-15 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102908, 4328, 3247, '<td valign="top">The red is washed out.  Where''s the texture?</td>', 'The red is washed out.  Where''s the texture?', '2002-08-15 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102909, 4328, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love the high contrast in this. The colours are beautiful and vibrant. There''s something about the composition that makes this rose seem as though it just "sproinged" out of the ground like that plant in the BC comics :). It has a kind of joyous look to it.</td>', 'I love the high contrast in this. The colours are beautiful and vibrant. There''s something about the composition that makes this rose seem as though it just "sproinged" out of the ground like that plant in the BC comics :). It has a kind of joyous look to it.', '2002-08-16 08:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102910, 4328, 1041, '<td valign="top">i love the shape of the rose with those leaves pointing up and down in opposite directions.  i would like to see more texture in the red of the rose. -- gr8photos (7)</td>', 'i love the shape of the rose with those leaves pointing up and down in opposite directions.  i would like to see more texture in the red of the rose. -- gr8photos (7)', '2002-08-16 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102911, 4328, 1891, '<td valign="top">It needs some dew.</td>', 'It needs some dew.', '2002-08-16 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102912, 4328, 2881, '<td valign="top">Too many "flower" shots in this challenge, but there are some good ones. I like the detail and focus on the rosebud, and the colors are great, but the blurry background is distracting... to me anyway.  I would have dropped it closer I guess.</td>', 'Too many "flower" shots in this challenge, but there are some good ones. I like the detail and focus on the rosebud, and the colors are great, but the blurry background is distracting... to me anyway.  I would have dropped it closer I guess.', '2002-08-16 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102913, 4328, 3080, '<td valign="top">You know, at first, the rose looked like it was cut and pasted onto the background.  The strange outline on the top of the bud made me think this.  However, As I was trying to shoot a photo for the pencil challenge, I came upon the same strange black outline in one of my photos  that I had taken too close to the computer screen.  I definately get the newness in the photo and it is a beautiful rose.  Looks like you played with the colors a bit.  The red looks unnaturally too red, however, the same thing creating the mystery black outline may be causing the redness to also be off.  I like the angle and closeness of the rose and I like how it''s lit and the background is far off.  Nice photo, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You know, at first, the rose looked like it was cut and pasted onto the background.  The strange outline on the top of the bud made me think this.  However, As I was trying to shoot a photo for the pencil challenge, I came upon the same strange black outline in one of my photos  that I had taken too close to the computer screen.  I definately get the newness in the photo and it is a beautiful rose.  Looks like you played with the colors a bit.  The red looks unnaturally too red, however, the same thing creating the mystery black outline may be causing the redness to also be off.  I like the angle and closeness of the rose and I like how it''s lit and the background is far off.  Nice photo, good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-17 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102914, 4328, 2011, '<td valign="top">This is getting the highest score of all the new flower pics from me.  Its a little too contrasty. but really good.</td>', 'This is getting the highest score of all the new flower pics from me.  Its a little too contrasty. but really good.', '2002-08-18 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102915, 4328, 616, '<td valign="top">For me, the red seems a bit overpowering.</td>', 'For me, the red seems a bit overpowering.', '2002-08-18 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
