(102927, 4329, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love this idea. Two things that niggle - the big black area at the top of the mirror reflection and the fact that the mirror top is only just cropped off. If it was cropped more it would be OK but it''s almost all visible but not quite! Lovely idea though and great poses.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'I love this idea. Two things that niggle - the big black area at the top of the mirror reflection and the fact that the mirror top is only just cropped off. If it was cropped more it would be OK but it''s almost all visible but not quite! Lovely idea though and great poses.5, Kavey', '2002-08-13 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102928, 4329, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - pretty good<br/>Technical Aspects - pretty good. <br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  pretty good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - pretty goodTechnical Aspects - pretty good. Meets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  pretty goodJim msp', '2002-08-13 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102929, 4329, 3185, '<td valign="top">I like the over all tone of this pic.</td>', 'I like the over all tone of this pic.', '2002-08-14 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102930, 4329, 1826, '<td valign="top">LOve the way you''ve used the mirror. :) 9</td>', 'LOve the way you''ve used the mirror. :) 9', '2002-08-14 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102931, 4329, 3105, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice photo.  Well balanced composition and colors.  Sharp focus.  The highlights from the above foreground light may be too strong off of the manequin''s heads and white in the dress.  Plus, there looks to be a yellow cast to the image (but that could be intentional to leave it).<br/>Score: 6<br/>Courtenay</td>', 'This is a really nice photo.  Well balanced composition and colors.  Sharp focus.  The highlights from the above foreground light may be too strong off of the manequin''s heads and white in the dress.  Plus, there looks to be a yellow cast to the image (but that could be intentional to leave it).Score: 6Courtenay', '2002-08-14 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102932, 4329, 3247, '<td valign="top">Composition of figures in the mirror is muddled.</td>', 'Composition of figures in the mirror is muddled.', '2002-08-15 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102933, 4329, 2881, '<td valign="top">This is kind of weird, very unique, and I like it a lot.  Love the detail, the focus on everything, especially the reflection.  The color though... don''t know. Maybe kind of bland... this didn''t catch my eye at all... at first.</td>', 'This is kind of weird, very unique, and I like it a lot.  Love the detail, the focus on everything, especially the reflection.  The color though... don''t know. Maybe kind of bland... this didn''t catch my eye at all... at first.', '2002-08-16 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102934, 4329, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting staging here. The manequins look like actors in a surreal play about tailors or something :). I like it.</td>', 'Interesting staging here. The manequins look like actors in a surreal play about tailors or something :). I like it.', '2002-08-17 07:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102935, 4329, 2815, '<td valign="top">i don''t know why I like this photo but I think it is great!!</td>', 'i don''t know why I like this photo but I think it is great!!', '2002-08-17 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102936, 4329, 3080, '<td valign="top">I was surprised to see 2 photos of manaquins in this challenge.  And equally as strange, I find that in both of them, the clothes seemed that they were from a different era.  I realized that I have no sense of fashion, so didn''t let that sway my votes at all, but still found it strange. It could also just be that cause I''m from a small town, we don''t see these kinds of clothes.  Who knows.  Anyway, about the photo.  I like the lighting and the reflection into the mirror.  I like how they are posed.  Although subtle, I did notice that the rear one is wearing a tape measure around her neck.  Great photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I was surprised to see 2 photos of manaquins in this challenge.  And equally as strange, I find that in both of them, the clothes seemed that they were from a different era.  I realized that I have no sense of fashion, so didn''t let that sway my votes at all, but still found it strange. It could also just be that cause I''m from a small town, we don''t see these kinds of clothes.  Who knows.  Anyway, about the photo.  I like the lighting and the reflection into the mirror.  I like how they are posed.  Although subtle, I did notice that the rear one is wearing a tape measure around her neck.  Great photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-17 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102937, 4329, 3351, '<td valign="top">creepy...but neat</td>', 'creepy...but neat', '2002-08-18 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102938, 4330, 3127, '<td valign="top">The background doesn''t provide enough contrast with the clothing. Everything seems to blend a little to well and nothing looks particularly sharp.</td>', 'The background doesn''t provide enough contrast with the clothing. Everything seems to blend a little to well and nothing looks particularly sharp.', '2002-08-12 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102939, 4330, 2123, '<td valign="top">Boy those are some scrawny mannequins! :-)</td>', 'Boy those are some scrawny mannequins! :-)', '2002-08-12 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102940, 4330, 117, '<td valign="top">at least these dummies have hair and there is no modeling fee</td>', 'at least these dummies have hair and there is no modeling fee', '2002-08-12 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102941, 4330, 1042, '<td valign="top">Ok...whoever is in charge of window displays, I really like the idea of the blackboard behind them with the sentences written over and over....great back to school/college advertising. As for the photo itself...I like the composition....the light on the face to the left is a little harsh but what can you do with those? I like the photo..bottom line. 8 kdjohnson</td>', 'Ok...whoever is in charge of window displays, I really like the idea of the blackboard behind them with the sentences written over and over....great back to school/college advertising. As for the photo itself...I like the composition....the light on the face to the left is a little harsh but what can you do with those? I like the photo..bottom line. 8 kdjohnson', '2002-08-12 22:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102942, 4330, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Light on mannekin "skin" a little harsh and some shadows a little dark but nice composition.</td>', 'Interesting. Light on mannekin "skin" a little harsh and some shadows a little dark but nice composition.', '2002-08-13 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
