(102944, 4330, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - pretty good<br/>Technical Aspects - pretty good. <br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  pretty good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - pretty goodTechnical Aspects - pretty good. Meets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  pretty goodJim msp', '2002-08-14 00:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102945, 4330, 2764, '<td valign="top">I suspect this is cheating - Did you photograph a store display??  None the less it makes a pretty good image even it half the work might have been done for you</td>', 'I suspect this is cheating - Did you photograph a store display??  None the less it makes a pretty good image even it half the work might have been done for you', '2002-08-14 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102946, 4330, 772, '<td valign="top">Phenomenal composition... I love the diagonals created by the mannequin legs in this photo... perfect 10 :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'Phenomenal composition... I love the diagonals created by the mannequin legs in this photo... perfect 10 :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-15 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102947, 4330, 2881, '<td valign="top">I think this is so interesting, and original.  Rates up there with some of the best ones of this week''s challenge.</td>', 'I think this is so interesting, and original.  Rates up there with some of the best ones of this week''s challenge.', '2002-08-15 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102948, 4330, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty neat shot.    I like how they are stanging the same and have the same hair.  I was surprised to see 2 shots of maniquins in this weeks challenge.  I think the clothes and shoes look like they are from a different era, but then again, I know nothing about style.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This is a pretty neat shot.    I like how they are stanging the same and have the same hair.  I was surprised to see 2 shots of maniquins in this weeks challenge.  I think the clothes and shoes look like they are from a different era, but then again, I know nothing about style.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-17 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102949, 4330, 2221, '<td valign="top">Very "stylish" ;-) Creative interpretation of "something new". I like this photo. The setup of the display dummies creates an interesting dynamic. Also the lighting is good.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'Very "stylish" ;-) Creative interpretation of "something new". I like this photo. The setup of the display dummies creates an interesting dynamic. Also the lighting is good.-stephan', '2002-08-18 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102950, 4330, 2560, '<td valign="top">This is the most underrated photo of the week.  I thought it would be in the top 3 for sure.  Grats on a great entry.<br/><br/>Tim</td>', 'This is the most underrated photo of the week.  I thought it would be in the top 3 for sure.  Grats on a great entry.Tim', '2002-08-19 01:55:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(102951, 4333, 2586, '<td valign="top">Am getting a little tired of the watch images at the challenges here. This, however, is a very clean, sharp shot. I like how you positioned the watch at an angle and the overall composition.</td>', 'Am getting a little tired of the watch images at the challenges here. This, however, is a very clean, sharp shot. I like how you positioned the watch at an angle and the overall composition.', '2002-08-12 04:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102952, 4333, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think this photo would have more of an impace if the time read midnight, but I like it a lot how it is. I''m going to give it a 9.</td>', 'I think this photo would have more of an impace if the time read midnight, but I like it a lot how it is. I''m going to give it a 9.', '2002-08-12 05:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102953, 4333, 3127, '<td valign="top">Good color and depth, but I don''t see how it relates to the challenge subject.</td>', 'Good color and depth, but I don''t see how it relates to the challenge subject.', '2002-08-12 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102954, 4333, 2553, '<td valign="top">The shot is wonderful, but I''m "iffy" on whether or not it meets the challenge.  It just doesn''t convey "Something New" to me. lhall</td>', 'The shot is wonderful, but I''m "iffy" on whether or not it meets the challenge.  It just doesn''t convey "Something New" to me. lhall', '2002-08-12 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102955, 4333, 3208, '<td valign="top">NIce photo.  Would a chronograph be a little more impressive?  I think I might trt it, but I must say that I like this photo.</td>', 'NIce photo.  Would a chronograph be a little more impressive?  I think I might trt it, but I must say that I like this photo.', '2002-08-12 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
