(102965, 4333, 2818, '<td valign="top">Did you notice how long your shutter was open?   Pretty cool!</td>', 'Did you notice how long your shutter was open?   Pretty cool!', '2002-08-13 02:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102966, 4333, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot and a great idea.  I really like the use of second hand to show time passing  none of us are getting any younger :-(   I can''t fault it technically; it''s a tough shot, a clever idea and you''ve done it well (10)</td>', 'This is a great shot and a great idea.  I really like the use of second hand to show time passing  none of us are getting any younger :-(   I can''t fault it technically; it''s a tough shot, a clever idea and you''ve done it well (10)', '2002-08-13 06:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102967, 4333, 671, '<td valign="top">good shot on the second hand!  great lighting, focus.</td>', 'good shot on the second hand!  great lighting, focus.', '2002-08-13 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102968, 4333, 2295, '<td valign="top">Nice, sharp image.  Too bad you can''t either shoot at a faster speed or stop the second hand.  7</td>', 'Nice, sharp image.  Too bad you can''t either shoot at a faster speed or stop the second hand.  7', '2002-08-13 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102969, 4333, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely taken photo, nice contrast and layout. Just doesn''t grab me visually as much as some others this week. Technically really like it though. Crisp and clean.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Nicely taken photo, nice contrast and layout. Just doesn''t grab me visually as much as some others this week. Technically really like it though. Crisp and clean.5, Kavey', '2002-08-13 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102970, 4333, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good. <br/>Meets Challenge - not obvious without title.<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  pretty good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - quite good. Meets Challenge - not obvious without title.Visual Impact / Originality  pretty goodJim msp', '2002-08-13 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102971, 4333, 3269, '<td valign="top">The motion of the second hand is good. Lighting and color are fine. I''d like a tiughter crop.</td>', 'The motion of the second hand is good. Lighting and color are fine. I''d like a tiughter crop.', '2002-08-14 03:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102972, 4333, 436, '<td valign="top">wicked second hand! Nice absence of reflection.  well done.</td>', 'wicked second hand! Nice absence of reflection.  well done.', '2002-08-14 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102973, 4333, 1826, '<td valign="top">Clever concept.</td>', 'Clever concept.', '2002-08-14 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102974, 4333, 3185, '<td valign="top">I liked this pic.  It almost seems like time can exist all at the same time - like there is no past present or future.  Something to ponder on the new day.</td>', 'I liked this pic.  It almost seems like time can exist all at the same time - like there is no past present or future.  Something to ponder on the new day.', '2002-08-14 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102975, 4333, 772, '<td valign="top">nice!  The sharpness looks a tiny bit flat, but this is a nicely composed photo... good work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'nice!  The sharpness looks a tiny bit flat, but this is a nicely composed photo... good work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-15 07:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102976, 4333, 2829, '<td valign="top">I love the concept. And the photo is very well executed. No harsh shadows or bright spots. There is a nice obscure reference to the something new challenge which can easily be deduced by looking at the picture for longer than a few seconds. One rant thought...what an odd choice of time....14 minutes? This might have confused a few people as I would have probably gone for 12:00 with the seconds hand going from 12 to 4 seconds.....I understand it''s hard to capture but it''s certainly doable...</td>', 'I love the concept. And the photo is very well executed. No harsh shadows or bright spots. There is a nice obscure reference to the something new challenge which can easily be deduced by looking at the picture for longer than a few seconds. One rant thought...what an odd choice of time....14 minutes? This might have confused a few people as I would have probably gone for 12:00 with the seconds hand going from 12 to 4 seconds.....I understand it''s hard to capture but it''s certainly doable...', '2002-08-15 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102977, 4333, 3080, '<td valign="top">I have to just wonder, if the same person did this one as did the last one in the transitions challenge.  I like how the second hand rests right on the the marks.  I like the texture in the wrist band.  There is a small yellow something to the right of the watch.  Good job capturing this one, and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I have to just wonder, if the same person did this one as did the last one in the transitions challenge.  I like how the second hand rests right on the the marks.  I like the texture in the wrist band.  There is a small yellow something to the right of the watch.  Good job capturing this one, and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-15 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102978, 4333, 1005, '<td valign="top">Actually, 13 min. 51 to 54 sec, but that''s picking nit.  Nice shot.  The only thing I don''t really like is how the outer ring came out.  The 20 is almost missing and the 10 and 30 are hard to see, the rest are better....8 Swash</td>', 'Actually, 13 min. 51 to 54 sec, but that''s picking nit.  Nice shot.  The only thing I don''t really like is how the outer ring came out.  The 20 is almost missing and the 10 and 30 are hard to see, the rest are better....8 Swash', '2002-08-16 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102979, 4333, 2815, '<td valign="top">I hate to say it but JohnS did a photo allot like this a few months ago.  It is a good photo so I will give it a (6)</td>', 'I hate to say it but JohnS did a photo allot like this a few months ago.  It is a good photo so I will give it a (6)', '2002-08-17 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102980, 4335, 693, '<td valign="top">This building looks like it''s about to topple over.  Was it this crooked when you took the photo?</td>', 'This building looks like it''s about to topple over.  Was it this crooked when you took the photo?', '2002-08-12 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102981, 4335, 3031, '<td valign="top">I know it is probably an optical illusion, but its to much tilted to the left.</td>', 'I know it is probably an optical illusion, but its to much tilted to the left.', '2002-08-12 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102982, 4335, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition5<br/>Technical Aspects4<br/>Appeal5<br/>Creativity5<br/>Rating5Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition5Technical Aspects4Appeal5Creativity5Rating5Autool', '2002-08-12 22:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102983, 4335, 2295, '<td valign="top">Good building shot.  Subject matter is appropriate.  The shot is a bit crooked (unless the building has a lean to it.)  Focus looks OK, lighting is OK.  6</td>', 'Good building shot.  Subject matter is appropriate.  The shot is a bit crooked (unless the building has a lean to it.)  Focus looks OK, lighting is OK.  6', '2002-08-13 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102984, 4335, 2928, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  It meets the challenge, it''s ok technically, but, personally, I think it''s just a little cluttered and lacks a central theme...</td>', 'Interesting.  It meets the challenge, it''s ok technically, but, personally, I think it''s just a little cluttered and lacks a central theme...', '2002-08-13 19:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102985, 4335, 3080, '<td valign="top">That is some serious scaffolding!  I love the patterns.  I know at least one person is going to comment on it being "crooked"  If it were possible, maybe you could try to straighten it up a bit, but being a tall subject and at the angle the photo was taken it may not be able to be straightened.  We all know that the farther away something gets, the smaller it looks, so visually, the building doesn''t look the same size all the way up to the top, so the crookedness may not be able to be avoided because of perspective.  Great job in capturing this photo.  Keep this for years to come and when the building is done and been there awile, the people who forgot what it looked like "before" will be in awe of it.  Good job and good luck!!</td>', 'That is some serious scaffolding!  I love the patterns.  I know at least one person is going to comment on it being "crooked"  If it were possible, maybe you could try to straighten it up a bit, but being a tall subject and at the angle the photo was taken it may not be able to be straightened.  We all know that the farther away something gets, the smaller it looks, so visually, the building doesn''t look the same size all the way up to the top, so the crookedness may not be able to be avoided because of perspective.  Great job in capturing this photo.  Keep this for years to come and when the building is done and been there awile, the people who forgot what it looked like "before" will be in awe of it.  Good job and good luck!!', '2002-08-13 22:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102986, 4335, 1, '<td valign="top">The tilt doesn''t work well for composure, I''d try a different angle or align it up vertically.</td>', 'The tilt doesn''t work well for composure, I''d try a different angle or align it up vertically.', '2002-08-14 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102987, 4335, 2003, '<td valign="top">6 - you''d get 7 if it was straight</td>', '6 - you''d get 7 if it was straight', '2002-08-16 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102988, 4335, 661, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture.  Though the slight angle makes it look like it''s all about ready to fall over.</td>', 'Interesting picture.  Though the slight angle makes it look like it''s all about ready to fall over.', '2002-08-17 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102989, 4335, 2983, '<td valign="top">Very detailed and texutred image.</td>', 'Very detailed and texutred image.', '2002-08-18 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(102990, 4336, 1882, '<td valign="top">I give you points for being able to get the shot at all.</td>', 'I give you points for being able to get the shot at all.', '2002-08-12 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
