(103002, 4336, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a very good photo in very bad lighting, I honestly congratulate you.  Parts of me wants to think the shadow on the left is a person in front of you, but it also could be part of the exhibit.  My biggest problem/issue with zoo shots are the cages.  I don''t want to show/see them, but they are everywhere.  You did well to show as little as you did.  I will let others give you composition/cropping issues, but as a "photo of limited opportunity", I still say you did well.  8 Swash</td>', 'This is a very good photo in very bad lighting, I honestly congratulate you.  Parts of me wants to think the shadow on the left is a person in front of you, but it also could be part of the exhibit.  My biggest problem/issue with zoo shots are the cages.  I don''t want to show/see them, but they are everywhere.  You did well to show as little as you did.  I will let others give you composition/cropping issues, but as a "photo of limited opportunity", I still say you did well.  8 Swash', '2002-08-15 19:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103003, 4336, 1280, '<td valign="top">Sweet little ''roo! I like this, but would like to see less shadow in the foreground. Probably out of your control when shooting it, but perhaps cropping afterwards.  I still like it though.  Just some ideas.</td>', 'Sweet little ''roo! I like this, but would like to see less shadow in the foreground. Probably out of your control when shooting it, but perhaps cropping afterwards.  I still like it though.  Just some ideas.', '2002-08-16 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103004, 4336, 2881, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is real different. Very unique.  The darkness at the edges really kind of bothers me though. The central  point of the photo has such good focus, I might have tried cropping more of the dark out.</td>', 'Wow, this is real different. Very unique.  The darkness at the edges really kind of bothers me though. The central  point of the photo has such good focus, I might have tried cropping more of the dark out.', '2002-08-16 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
