(103047, 4340, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very interesting effect, and without PhotoShop! This is one of my favorites for this challenge. I find it original and very well done. The colors are very saturated, but that seems to add to the almost surreal look of the photo. The background is great, I would like to know how you achieved it. The composition is just right, almost too tight, but I like that it brings the viewer close in, which is especially important when dealing with the small format required by the challenge. Very good job (10)</td>', 'Very interesting effect, and without PhotoShop! This is one of my favorites for this challenge. I find it original and very well done. The colors are very saturated, but that seems to add to the almost surreal look of the photo. The background is great, I would like to know how you achieved it. The composition is just right, almost too tight, but I like that it brings the viewer close in, which is especially important when dealing with the small format required by the challenge. Very good job (10)', '2002-08-13 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
