(103073, 4341, 3080, '<td valign="top">I love the color in this.  I like the title, but think that it would have more impact if the baby didn''t appear to be looking away from the Dad (due to the fact that it looks like we can see both ears.  I could be wrong, it could be a nose and a tuft of hair in the back, but I''m pretty sure it''s ears)  Also, I think it would be really cool if you could have gotten the entire picture in silouette.  Inability to do that though is understandable with lack of time due to the sun going down and Daddy''s arms getting tired of holding that baby over his head. :)  Maybe long pants and dark socks would have helped a bit.  Also, children can be uncooperative at times.<br/>Anyway, I really love this photo, and I think you have the right idea.  Wish we had sunsets like that here.  Congrats on the great photo and good luck.<br/>~Heather~<br/></td>', 'I love the color in this.  I like the title, but think that it would have more impact if the baby didn''t appear to be looking away from the Dad (due to the fact that it looks like we can see both ears.  I could be wrong, it could be a nose and a tuft of hair in the back, but I''m pretty sure it''s ears)  Also, I think it would be really cool if you could have gotten the entire picture in silouette.  Inability to do that though is understandable with lack of time due to the sun going down and Daddy''s arms getting tired of holding that baby over his head. :)  Maybe long pants and dark socks would have helped a bit.  Also, children can be uncooperative at times.Anyway, I really love this photo, and I think you have the right idea.  Wish we had sunsets like that here.  Congrats on the great photo and good luck.~Heather~', '2002-08-12 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
