(103090, 4341, 1875, '<td valign="top">Using a baby for "something new" is not very original, but this is creative, I like the shot, and the lighting. It would''ve been a little better to have had the baby looking at the man instead of the camera. 8</td>', 'Using a baby for "something new" is not very original, but this is creative, I like the shot, and the lighting. It would''ve been a little better to have had the baby looking at the man instead of the camera. 8', '2002-08-14 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103091, 4341, 2867, '<td valign="top">Each contest i only give out one 10, to my absolute favorite, and this contest you''re it! I just love something about this photo.  The background is stunning, it screams new, and i like how the baby is looking at the camera.  Great job!</td>', 'Each contest i only give out one 10, to my absolute favorite, and this contest you''re it! I just love something about this photo.  The background is stunning, it screams new, and i like how the baby is looking at the camera.  Great job!', '2002-08-14 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103092, 4341, 2928, '<td valign="top">Wonderful I love it.  The colour in the sky is breathtaking.  For me, the pose says it all; I didn''t need to look at the title, the picture just leapt out without trying.  It''s a great idea and meets the challenge with ease.  The use of a foreground silhouette rather than battling with fill flash is a stroke of genius and makes this picture original and spontaneous and gives it a stand out from the rest quality Really great picture (10++ and possible winner?)  Good luck</td>', 'Wonderful I love it.  The colour in the sky is breathtaking.  For me, the pose says it all; I didn''t need to look at the title, the picture just leapt out without trying.  It''s a great idea and meets the challenge with ease.  The use of a foreground silhouette rather than battling with fill flash is a stroke of genius and makes this picture original and spontaneous and gives it a stand out from the rest quality Really great picture (10++ and possible winner?)  Good luck', '2002-08-15 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
