(103097, 4341, 1280, '<td valign="top">I love it...one of my few 10''s....After reviewing all the submissions I''ve concluded that this is my favorite.  Even in the silhouette it is evident that this Daddy is smiling at his new child.  The choice of silhouette is perfect, and this is a very strong image.  The coloring is fantastic too.  My # 1 choice...I hope you win.  Grayce...aka...gracious</td>', 'I love it...one of my few 10''s....After reviewing all the submissions I''ve concluded that this is my favorite.  Even in the silhouette it is evident that this Daddy is smiling at his new child.  The choice of silhouette is perfect, and this is a very strong image.  The coloring is fantastic too.  My # 1 choice...I hope you win.  Grayce...aka...gracious', '2002-08-16 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
