(103102, 4341, 2247, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!  Great silhouette of a family moment.  Your silhouette has a nice balance of light to accent the dark.  Give you a 10.</td>', 'Beautiful shot!  Great silhouette of a family moment.  Your silhouette has a nice balance of light to accent the dark.  Give you a 10.', '2002-08-18 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103103, 4341, 2221, '<td valign="top">First I thought "Oh no, not another baby photo" but then I saw that it''s the whole scene and the gesture of the father you wanted to portray. The sunset and the frotal lighting are beautiful and it really adds to the photo. The photo transports a warm and good mood. It wouldn''t be necessary to have such an almost over-explaining title. The photo works on it''s own.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'First I thought "Oh no, not another baby photo" but then I saw that it''s the whole scene and the gesture of the father you wanted to portray. The sunset and the frotal lighting are beautiful and it really adds to the photo. The photo transports a warm and good mood. It wouldn''t be necessary to have such an almost over-explaining title. The photo works on it''s own.-stephan', '2002-08-18 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
