(103145, 4344, 1037, '<td valign="top">So adorable! The hand puts the puppy in scale and sets up an emotional relationship with it for the viewer. Much better than just photographing the puppy on its own. Lovely depth of field to throw the focus on the eyes, and great colours. I''m giving this 10. Maybe you''ll win :) - lisae</td>', 'So adorable! The hand puts the puppy in scale and sets up an emotional relationship with it for the viewer. Much better than just photographing the puppy on its own. Lovely depth of field to throw the focus on the eyes, and great colours. I''m giving this 10. Maybe you''ll win :) - lisae', '2002-08-16 07:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
