(103152, 4344, 312, '<td valign="top">great depth of field on this. i really like this soft focus effect you''ve got going. my only nitpick would be the existance of the thumb in the photo, but i know it''s probably pretty hard to hold a puppy any other way. great colors here, too. good work. one of my top 4.</td>', 'great depth of field on this. i really like this soft focus effect you''ve got going. my only nitpick would be the existance of the thumb in the photo, but i know it''s probably pretty hard to hold a puppy any other way. great colors here, too. good work. one of my top 4.', '2002-08-18 04:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103153, 4344, 326, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!! A job well done.</td>', 'Beautiful!! A job well done.', '2002-08-18 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103154, 4344, 2983, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  The soft focus works well, it adds warmth.  You should frame this one.</td>', 'Very cute.  The soft focus works well, it adds warmth.  You should frame this one.', '2002-08-19 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103155, 4344, 2, '<td valign="top">This really is an amazing photograph.  Sad to see it come in so low.</td>', 'This really is an amazing photograph.  Sad to see it come in so low.', '2002-08-19 12:03:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(103156, 4346, 1792, '<td valign="top">The idea is good here.  It might have been more effective to be a little closer to better show the difference in texture between the old and the new metal.  Shooting more from the corner, using more of the fence---it has nice lines perpendicular to the building siding and less of the grass might enhance the effort.</td>', 'The idea is good here.  It might have been more effective to be a little closer to better show the difference in texture between the old and the new metal.  Shooting more from the corner, using more of the fence---it has nice lines perpendicular to the building siding and less of the grass might enhance the effort.', '2002-08-12 03:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103157, 4346, 3127, '<td valign="top">This was the sort of picture that I imagined might be original for this challenge. The contrast of the old and new materials along with the golden sunlight is powerful.</td>', 'This was the sort of picture that I imagined might be original for this challenge. The contrast of the old and new materials along with the golden sunlight is powerful.', '2002-08-12 10:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103158, 4346, 1779, '<td valign="top">this was for last week... sorry.</td>', 'this was for last week... sorry.', '2002-08-12 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103159, 4346, 2909, '<td valign="top">I love this!  It captures the subject of the challenge perfectly!</td>', 'I love this!  It captures the subject of the challenge perfectly!', '2002-08-12 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103160, 4346, 811, '<td valign="top">i must admit, my first thought, was, "how in the heck does that have to do with new."  It took me a minute, maybe because such scenes are so familiar to me, that i don''t even notice the new sheets anymore!   I like how there are three bands of horizontal color, and that you are close enough to see detail, but still include a broader context.  I like this picture, but i imagine you will catch grief this week.  karmat</td>', 'i must admit, my first thought, was, "how in the heck does that have to do with new."  It took me a minute, maybe because such scenes are so familiar to me, that i don''t even notice the new sheets anymore!   I like how there are three bands of horizontal color, and that you are close enough to see detail, but still include a broader context.  I like this picture, but i imagine you will catch grief this week.  karmat', '2002-08-13 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103161, 4346, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition7<br/>Technical Aspects6<br/>Appeal4<br/>Creativity5<br/>Rating6Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition7Technical Aspects6Appeal4Creativity5Rating6Autool', '2002-08-13 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103162, 4346, 2353, '<td valign="top">Good choice...very original.</td>', 'Good choice...very original.', '2002-08-13 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103163, 4346, 1005, '<td valign="top">I "get" your new, but parts of it don''t look very new, maybe newer would have been a more appriate title.  The new panel is rusted, but not as bad.  The shaded area behind the barn is very dark, so is the grass.  6 Swash</td>', 'I "get" your new, but parts of it don''t look very new, maybe newer would have been a more appriate title.  The new panel is rusted, but not as bad.  The shaded area behind the barn is very dark, so is the grass.  6 Swash', '2002-08-14 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103164, 4346, 327, '<td valign="top">I love rust, love the old feel of this shack. Maybe a tad bit dark at the bottom and the right. Also the sky is a bit blah. Over all I like it and your on target for the subject. Score-7 Kee</td>', 'I love rust, love the old feel of this shack. Maybe a tad bit dark at the bottom and the right. Also the sky is a bit blah. Over all I like it and your on target for the subject. Score-7 Kee', '2002-08-15 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103165, 4346, 3080, '<td valign="top">Peek a boo! I think I see you!  Is that your shadow down there coming out of the left corner?  Ah, who cares.  This photo cracked me up anyway.  Reminds me of my house.  We have all this old siding and then last winter, a really bad storm damaged one of the siding pieces and it was replaced with an uncolored (ready to paint) piece. So our house is a 15 year old tan color and has this ONE gray stripe. lol.  I absolutely love this picture.  Great eye for the something new.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Peek a boo! I think I see you!  Is that your shadow down there coming out of the left corner?  Ah, who cares.  This photo cracked me up anyway.  Reminds me of my house.  We have all this old siding and then last winter, a really bad storm damaged one of the siding pieces and it was replaced with an uncolored (ready to paint) piece. So our house is a 15 year old tan color and has this ONE gray stripe. lol.  I absolutely love this picture.  Great eye for the something new.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-16 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103166, 4346, 3112, '<td valign="top">Excellent thematic contrast.  Overall lighting is a little low.  I might have cropped down to just tin.</td>', 'Excellent thematic contrast.  Overall lighting is a little low.  I might have cropped down to just tin.', '2002-08-17 13:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103167, 4346, 2009, '<td valign="top">Do appreciate that newness is relative to it''s context.</td>', 'Do appreciate that newness is relative to it''s context.', '2002-08-17 22:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103168, 4346, 2983, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but your composition doesn''t excite me.</td>', 'Good idea, but your composition doesn''t excite me.', '2002-08-18 04:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103169, 4346, 2867, '<td valign="top">this photo probably would''ve done better in the something old challange</td>', 'this photo probably would''ve done better in the something old challange', '2002-08-19 00:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103170, 4347, 2553, '<td valign="top">I had an almost identical shot - glad I didn''t use it! I like the angles and the areas of light and dark.  Your shot is definitely better than mine. lhall</td>', 'I had an almost identical shot - glad I didn''t use it! I like the angles and the areas of light and dark.  Your shot is definitely better than mine. lhall', '2002-08-12 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103171, 4347, 3127, '<td valign="top">Golden colors and shapes are great.</td>', 'Golden colors and shapes are great.', '2002-08-12 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103172, 4347, 2909, '<td valign="top">Imaginative and fresh</td>', 'Imaginative and fresh', '2002-08-12 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103173, 4347, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition5<br/>Technical Aspects4<br/>Appeal5<br/>Creativity5<br/>Rating5Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition5Technical Aspects4Appeal5Creativity5Rating5Autool', '2002-08-12 22:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103174, 4347, 2295, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  Focus looks good.  DOF is good.  Lighting is ok.  Subject matter is acceptable with good presentation.</td>', 'Good shot.  Focus looks good.  DOF is good.  Lighting is ok.  Subject matter is acceptable with good presentation.', '2002-08-13 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103175, 4347, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - pretty good<br/>Technical Aspects - pretty good. <br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  pretty good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - pretty goodTechnical Aspects - pretty good. Meets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  pretty goodJim msp', '2002-08-13 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103176, 4347, 2798, '<td valign="top">Good texture and colour.</td>', 'Good texture and colour.', '2002-08-14 07:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103177, 4347, 3080, '<td valign="top">I worked in a lumber yard and this picture smells really really good to me.  I think it could have been better if the boards were all the same width, better visual impact expecially since the 2X2''s (which aren''t technically 2X2) are pretty much the same size and create an even vertical spacing.  However, I know that has absolutely nothing to do with you, or the quality of your photo, which is very nice.  It if were physically possible, you could try to crop the bottom dark boards off and show only the new ones.  It kind of gets a blurred look to the bottom left.  Smell definately portrays new very nicely and although I can''t physically smell your photo, it''s still stuck in my nose.  Great idea!  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I worked in a lumber yard and this picture smells really really good to me.  I think it could have been better if the boards were all the same width, better visual impact expecially since the 2X2''s (which aren''t technically 2X2) are pretty much the same size and create an even vertical spacing.  However, I know that has absolutely nothing to do with you, or the quality of your photo, which is very nice.  It if were physically possible, you could try to crop the bottom dark boards off and show only the new ones.  It kind of gets a blurred look to the bottom left.  Smell definately portrays new very nicely and although I can''t physically smell your photo, it''s still stuck in my nose.  Great idea!  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-15 03:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103178, 4347, 3280, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites and yet I couldn''t help but feel that something was missing.  I''m not sure what and yet I think with a small addition, it could have been an award winner.</td>', 'One of my favorites and yet I couldn''t help but feel that something was missing.  I''m not sure what and yet I think with a small addition, it could have been an award winner.', '2002-08-16 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103179, 4347, 2881, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like to see the challenge name (new) used as part of the title... too cliche, or something... unimaginative!  Get out your thesaurus!  Detail on the lumber is good, focus and clarity is good, but new lumber is just kind of... bland, maybe? Needs something to break it up, to add interest.</td>', 'I really don''t like to see the challenge name (new) used as part of the title... too cliche, or something... unimaginative!  Get out your thesaurus!  Detail on the lumber is good, focus and clarity is good, but new lumber is just kind of... bland, maybe? Needs something to break it up, to add interest.', '2002-08-16 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103180, 4347, 3320, '<td valign="top">I would have cut the bottom of the picture to keep only the pieces of wood, I like the wood textures</td>', 'I would have cut the bottom of the picture to keep only the pieces of wood, I like the wood textures', '2002-08-17 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103181, 4347, 2204, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and good subject.  There should be no comments this week about your entry not fitting the challenge.  It''s obviously exactly what your title suggests.  =7 syamjonimi</td>', 'Nice shot and good subject.  There should be no comments this week about your entry not fitting the challenge.  It''s obviously exactly what your title suggests.  =7 syamjonimi', '2002-08-18 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103182, 4347, 2829, '<td valign="top">nice novel idea</td>', 'nice novel idea', '2002-08-19 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103183, 4350, 3080, '<td valign="top">Catchy title.  This is a really neat photo.  Not only is it a new web, it''s a new house, and new dining room table, and a new fridge.  Congrats and good luck.</td>', 'Catchy title.  This is a really neat photo.  Not only is it a new web, it''s a new house, and new dining room table, and a new fridge.  Congrats and good luck.', '2002-08-12 02:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103184, 4350, 616, '<td valign="top">Great idea, the spider just seems to be out of focus</td>', 'Great idea, the spider just seems to be out of focus', '2002-08-12 08:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103185, 4350, 1, '<td valign="top">This had SUCH potential, but due to blue/focus problems, I can''t give it a high score.</td>', 'This had SUCH potential, but due to blue/focus problems, I can''t give it a high score.', '2002-08-12 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103186, 4350, 1519, '<td valign="top">Great title!  Nice composition.  If the spider were more in focus, this would have been awesome! Otherwise, great idea and good job!</td>', 'Great title!  Nice composition.  If the spider were more in focus, this would have been awesome! Otherwise, great idea and good job!', '2002-08-12 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103187, 4350, 1779, '<td valign="top">?</td>', '?', '2002-08-12 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103188, 4350, 2256, '<td valign="top">they make it looks so easy...and to think I went to SCHOOL for web design.....hmmm..</td>', 'they make it looks so easy...and to think I went to SCHOOL for web design.....hmmm..', '2002-08-12 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103189, 4350, 3031, '<td valign="top">Try a little more aperature the next time. You''ll get some more sharpness. In that way not only the web is sharp, but also the spider.</td>', 'Try a little more aperature the next time. You''ll get some more sharpness. In that way not only the web is sharp, but also the spider.', '2002-08-12 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103190, 4350, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition7<br/>Technical Aspects4<br/>Appeal7<br/>Creativity7<br/>Rating6Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition7Technical Aspects4Appeal7Creativity7Rating6Autool', '2002-08-12 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103191, 4350, 1891, '<td valign="top">Bad focus.</td>', 'Bad focus.', '2002-08-13 09:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103192, 4350, 2587, '<td valign="top">I can''t stand spiders but this is one of my favorite pics so far. Perfectly fits the challenge and I love your composition.</td>', 'I can''t stand spiders but this is one of my favorite pics so far. Perfectly fits the challenge and I love your composition.', '2002-08-13 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(103193, 4350, 3127, '<td valign="top">The bluriness of the photo is distracting. The lower portion of the web is in focus, but the upper portion is blurry.</td>', 'The bluriness of the photo is distracting. The lower portion of the web is in focus, but the upper portion is blurry.', '2002-08-13 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103194, 4350, 2928, '<td valign="top">Gets a :) on the wit front and the web has great texture...</td>', 'Gets a :) on the wit front and the web has great texture...', '2002-08-13 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103195, 4350, 2111, '<td valign="top">excellent 7</td>', 'excellent 7', '2002-08-13 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103196, 4350, 2798, '<td valign="top">Great opportuinity for a shot and very well framed. Slight fuzzyness around the spider but nothing worth fretting about.</td>', 'Great opportuinity for a shot and very well framed. Slight fuzzyness around the spider but nothing worth fretting about.', '2002-08-14 07:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103197, 4350, 917, '<td valign="top">Try this on a cold day, as they slow down and help you freeze the motion a bit better.</td>', 'Try this on a cold day, as they slow down and help you freeze the motion a bit better.', '2002-08-14 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103198, 4350, 2932, '<td valign="top">I seem to get new web designers as fast as I can shake a stick at them.  Definitely new</td>', 'I seem to get new web designers as fast as I can shake a stick at them.  Definitely new', '2002-08-15 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103199, 4350, 3105, '<td valign="top">I wanted so badly to score this higher than I did because I really like the composition.  I had to take off points mainly because of the focus not being on the spider as the subject.  The color of the background is good and compliments well with the color of the spider.  The bright spot of the web center in the upper left is a little bit distracting too but may be less so if in focus.  Was this shot in your camera''s macro mode or not?  I kind of get the feeling it wasn''t or if it was you may have been out of it''s effective macro focus range.<br/>Score: 5<br/>Courtenay</td>', 'I wanted so badly to score this higher than I did because I really like the composition.  I had to take off points mainly because of the focus not being on the spider as the subject.  The color of the background is good and compliments well with the color of the spider.  The bright spot of the web center in the upper left is a little bit distracting too but may be less so if in focus.  Was this shot in your camera''s macro mode or not?  I kind of get the feeling it wasn''t or if it was you may have been out of it''s effective macro focus range.Score: 5Courtenay', '2002-08-15 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103200, 4350, 3044, '<td valign="top">very cool composition. little soft though.</td>', 'very cool composition. little soft though.', '2002-08-15 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103201, 4350, 641, '<td valign="top">The composition is great... if the focus were a little better this would be perfect.</td>', 'The composition is great... if the focus were a little better this would be perfect.', '2002-08-15 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103202, 4350, 2247, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Cool idea of "web" designer!  I give you a 7.</td>', 'LOL!  Cool idea of "web" designer!  I give you a 7.', '2002-08-15 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103203, 4350, 3198, '<td valign="top">nice title</td>', 'nice title', '2002-08-16 06:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103204, 4350, 1280, '<td valign="top">Captured the web beautifully, but the spider is blurred. Composition is good.  Meets challenge?  Vaguely.</td>', 'Captured the web beautifully, but the spider is blurred. Composition is good.  Meets challenge?  Vaguely.', '2002-08-16 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103205, 4350, 1005, '<td valign="top">A little fuzzy on the spider, but a wonderful catch.  I don''t know how close your cam can go, but it would have been interesting to see the web spinning more closely.  Challenge well met.  This is a 9.  Swash</td>', 'A little fuzzy on the spider, but a wonderful catch.  I don''t know how close your cam can go, but it would have been interesting to see the web spinning more closely.  Challenge well met.  This is a 9.  Swash', '2002-08-16 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103206, 4350, 2923, '<td valign="top">too bad it wasn''t in focus, but still a good composition.</td>', 'too bad it wasn''t in focus, but still a good composition.', '2002-08-16 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103207, 4350, 2881, '<td valign="top">I love pictures of spiders, and although I know the focus is on the "new" web, I think the spider needs to be more in focus.  And maybe cropped more closely to the focal point.</td>', 'I love pictures of spiders, and although I know the focus is on the "new" web, I think the spider needs to be more in focus.  And maybe cropped more closely to the focal point.', '2002-08-16 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103208, 4350, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice framing, and I love the title :)</td>', 'Very nice framing, and I love the title :)', '2002-08-17 07:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103209, 4350, 2221, '<td valign="top">Very funny :-) Creative title! It also fits to the challenge very good. The focus is a bit strange. I understand the the spider is blurred and that''s actually a nice hint that she is busy with her work. But parts of the web (lower left side) have a good focus while other parts like the center of the web or the lower right side are blurred. I would have liked ot much more when the whole web was in fucus. A smaller aperture could have helped. The lighting is very good.<br/>-stephan<br/><br/>-stephan</td>', 'Very funny :-) Creative title! It also fits to the challenge very good. The focus is a bit strange. I understand the the spider is blurred and that''s actually a nice hint that she is busy with her work. But parts of the web (lower left side) have a good focus while other parts like the center of the web or the lower right side are blurred. I would have liked ot much more when the whole web was in fucus. A smaller aperture could have helped. The lighting is very good.-stephan-stephan', '2002-08-17 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103210, 4350, 2815, '<td valign="top">Good shot,  the spider seems a little out of focus,  i give it a (7)</td>', 'Good shot,  the spider seems a little out of focus,  i give it a (7)', '2002-08-17 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103211, 4350, 2829, '<td valign="top">Not bad...Try a faster shutter speed however...Looks a bit fuzzy</td>', 'Not bad...Try a faster shutter speed however...Looks a bit fuzzy', '2002-08-19 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103212, 4352, 1779, '<td valign="top">very nice. love the composition.</td>', 'very nice. love the composition.', '2002-08-12 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103213, 4352, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, but I can''t quite figure out what it is.  Is it a lawn ornament?  Whatever the case, I can''t help but like it!</td>', 'I like this a lot, but I can''t quite figure out what it is.  Is it a lawn ornament?  Whatever the case, I can''t help but like it!', '2002-08-12 19:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103214, 4352, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition8<br/>Technical Aspects7<br/>Appeal6<br/>Creativity6<br/>Rating7Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition8Technical Aspects7Appeal6Creativity6Rating7Autool', '2002-08-13 00:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103215, 4352, 2997, '<td valign="top">There is something very striking about this photo, but I can''t put my finger on it.  Is that the sun reflecting off the bottom of the (whatever it is)?  If so, (and this is just intended as constructive critique) if it was possible to catch the rising sun in the distant horizon, the impact would have been grand!<br/></td>', 'There is something very striking about this photo, but I can''t put my finger on it.  Is that the sun reflecting off the bottom of the (whatever it is)?  If so, (and this is just intended as constructive critique) if it was possible to catch the rising sun in the distant horizon, the impact would have been grand!', '2002-08-13 00:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103216, 4352, 2422, '<td valign="top">Is it me or is the torch at an angle?</td>', 'Is it me or is the torch at an angle?', '2002-08-13 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103217, 4352, 2140, '<td valign="top">mine is also titled new day and are similar, but i like yours better.<br/>well done</td>', 'mine is also titled new day and are similar, but i like yours better.well done', '2002-08-13 04:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103218, 4352, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo compositionally.  It just doesn''t say ''new'' to me.  The title suggests a ''new'' day and I just don''t see it.  Maybe this object in the photo has some sort of ''new day'' symbolism that I''m not familiar with... - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an interesting photo compositionally.  It just doesn''t say ''new'' to me.  The title suggests a ''new'' day and I just don''t see it.  Maybe this object in the photo has some sort of ''new day'' symbolism that I''m not familiar with... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-13 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103219, 4352, 3087, '<td valign="top">Atmospheric. <br/>What is it?<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Atmospheric. What is it?6, Kavey', '2002-08-13 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103220, 4352, 3127, '<td valign="top">I like the sky color on this, but it''s almost too dark (or not dark enough) to help the image jump out.</td>', 'I like the sky color on this, but it''s almost too dark (or not dark enough) to help the image jump out.', '2002-08-13 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103221, 4352, 3126, '<td valign="top">At first this photo did not catch my eye, but as the week goes on I am finding this photo more and more attracting.  I think I have upgraded it twice already....Sometimes these are my favorite shots because they dont let you forget them.</td>', 'At first this photo did not catch my eye, but as the week goes on I am finding this photo more and more attracting.  I think I have upgraded it twice already....Sometimes these are my favorite shots because they dont let you forget them.', '2002-08-13 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
