(103223, 4352, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - pretty good<br/>Technical Aspects - pretty good. <br/>Meets Challenge - yes, title helps a lot<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  pretty good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - pretty goodTechnical Aspects - pretty good. Meets Challenge - yes, title helps a lotVisual Impact / Originality  pretty goodJim msp', '2002-08-14 00:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
