(103280, 4358, 3080, '<td valign="top">I love the clarity in the photo, and how it captured the fuzzy stems.  I think I have a thing for fuzzy stems or something.  However, they aren''t really pretty.  I think maybe if you could have waited one more day for them to open up just a bit more, there would have been a little more color in contrast to all the green.  I like how they are in focus and the background isnt.  Your lighting is just fine and I like where they are positioned in the photo.  Nice shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love the clarity in the photo, and how it captured the fuzzy stems.  I think I have a thing for fuzzy stems or something.  However, they aren''t really pretty.  I think maybe if you could have waited one more day for them to open up just a bit more, there would have been a little more color in contrast to all the green.  I like how they are in focus and the background isnt.  Your lighting is just fine and I like where they are positioned in the photo.  Nice shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-18 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103281, 4358, 637, '<td valign="top">For me, a flower picture has to have some really beautiful flowers to be effective... i''m sorry this one doesn''t strike me much.  meets the challenge; good dof 4 sjgleah</td>', 'For me, a flower picture has to have some really beautiful flowers to be effective... i''m sorry this one doesn''t strike me much.  meets the challenge; good dof 4 sjgleah', '2002-08-18 05:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
