(103288, 4360, 2932, '<td valign="top">nice try at an interesting crop.  somehow tho, it feels off.  Perhaps it''s the way a sliver too much is missing from the right.  Or perhaps it''s the head-on but off-center approach.  I suspect a shot looking up and to the right would have been much more interesting.</td>', 'nice try at an interesting crop.  somehow tho, it feels off.  Perhaps it''s the way a sliver too much is missing from the right.  Or perhaps it''s the head-on but off-center approach.  I suspect a shot looking up and to the right would have been much more interesting.', '2002-08-14 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103289, 4360, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this idea but the composition could of been a little better IMHO. It is a good clean, clear, sharp shot. Score -6 Kee</td>', 'I like this idea but the composition could of been a little better IMHO. It is a good clean, clear, sharp shot. Score -6 Kee', '2002-08-15 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103290, 4360, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty neat angle.  Quite a few new cars in this challenge, but I think I might like the angle of this one the best.  There is a skin colored reflection in the front in numerous place.  There is one other photo that i rated and commented on this same thing.  I myself hadn''t even thought about it until then, but when dealing with something reflective, it may be a good idea to wear clothing that matches the color of the subject you are shooting.  Unless, of course, you were trying to show this in the "shining" car.  This photo score high with me.  Great job and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This is a pretty neat angle.  Quite a few new cars in this challenge, but I think I might like the angle of this one the best.  There is a skin colored reflection in the front in numerous place.  There is one other photo that i rated and commented on this same thing.  I myself hadn''t even thought about it until then, but when dealing with something reflective, it may be a good idea to wear clothing that matches the color of the subject you are shooting.  Unless, of course, you were trying to show this in the "shining" car.  This photo score high with me.  Great job and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-16 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103291, 4360, 2158, '<td valign="top">The fence top right is a bit distracting.</td>', 'The fence top right is a bit distracting.', '2002-08-16 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103292, 4360, 3351, '<td valign="top">could have been better</td>', 'could have been better', '2002-08-18 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103293, 4360, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good subject!  I would like to have seen the edge NOT cut off though (on the right) so I''d see the curves and shapliness of the car.  Just a thought. You captured some nice color in the reflection.</td>', 'Good subject!  I would like to have seen the edge NOT cut off though (on the right) so I''d see the curves and shapliness of the car.  Just a thought. You captured some nice color in the reflection.', '2002-08-18 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103294, 4360, 2983, '<td valign="top">It seems tilted a bit to the right.  A head on shot like this is unforgiving in that respect.  Fence in background (upper right) is distracting.</td>', 'It seems tilted a bit to the right.  A head on shot like this is unforgiving in that respect.  Fence in background (upper right) is distracting.', '2002-08-19 00:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
