(103324, 4363, 772, '<td valign="top">Good job on making me hungry :)  Rosemary is one of the herbs that I grow since it''s hard to kill :)  I like your twist on the ''new'' topic... I think that was a nice creative twist.  I tried a creative twist this week and it''s killing me :))  I''m giving this photo a 7 this week.  I little more depth of field in the foreground would be a nice improvement :)  Good work.... - jmsetzler</td>', 'Good job on making me hungry :)  Rosemary is one of the herbs that I grow since it''s hard to kill :)  I like your twist on the ''new'' topic... I think that was a nice creative twist.  I tried a creative twist this week and it''s killing me :))  I''m giving this photo a 7 this week.  I little more depth of field in the foreground would be a nice improvement :)  Good work.... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-12 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
