(103341, 4363, 1005, '<td valign="top">Since we''ve already been through my justificaton/reasons for giving you a 7 for this photo, I will just remind you that the whole world votes on these photos.   Try to think about is this a somewhat localized idiom, or would the whole world call these little guys as the type called New?  Everyone knows French Fries are not really from France, but they know what French Fries are.  Would everyone know julien or au graten?  Smiles!  Swash  (I am not a potato expert/freak/geek, really!)</td>', 'Since we''ve already been through my justificaton/reasons for giving you a 7 for this photo, I will just remind you that the whole world votes on these photos.   Try to think about is this a somewhat localized idiom, or would the whole world call these little guys as the type called New?  Everyone knows French Fries are not really from France, but they know what French Fries are.  Would everyone know julien or au graten?  Smiles!  Swash  (I am not a potato expert/freak/geek, really!)', '2002-08-14 19:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103342, 4363, 2932, '<td valign="top">Please post the recipe!!!  Also a very creative inclusion of the theme.  I hope most people understand that small potatoes are called new potatoes.  It''s hard to tell how small they really are in this closeup</td>', 'Please post the recipe!!!  Also a very creative inclusion of the theme.  I hope most people understand that small potatoes are called new potatoes.  It''s hard to tell how small they really are in this closeup', '2002-08-14 22:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103343, 4363, 3016, '<td valign="top">a little blurry, are you only interested on focusing on the top right potatos?<br/></td>', 'a little blurry, are you only interested on focusing on the top right potatos?', '2002-08-14 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103344, 4363, 3105, '<td valign="top">Ha!  When I saw the new topic on Sunday, new potatoes was actually the first thing that came to my mind.  :)  I like the idea of course and the colors.  The composition is nice but I''m wondering if you tried others that showed more of the potatoes in frame from that same angle of view.  I would also probably like to see more of the potatoes in focus.  Looks good enough to eat, though!<br/>Score: 5<br/>Courtenay</td>', 'Ha!  When I saw the new topic on Sunday, new potatoes was actually the first thing that came to my mind.  :)  I like the idea of course and the colors.  The composition is nice but I''m wondering if you tried others that showed more of the potatoes in frame from that same angle of view.  I would also probably like to see more of the potatoes in focus.  Looks good enough to eat, though!Score: 5Courtenay', '2002-08-15 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103345, 4363, 3044, '<td valign="top">makes me hungry. would have like to see all the potatoes in focus.</td>', 'makes me hungry. would have like to see all the potatoes in focus.', '2002-08-15 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
