(103355, 4363, 637, '<td valign="top">Your dof choices (blurred in the front, in focus in the back) don''t thrill me, but I like the image.  To me, its a stretch to think of new potatoes as "new", per this challenge, but I''m willing to give you the benefit of the doubt.  6 sjgleah</td>', 'Your dof choices (blurred in the front, in focus in the back) don''t thrill me, but I like the image.  To me, its a stretch to think of new potatoes as "new", per this challenge, but I''m willing to give you the benefit of the doubt.  6 sjgleah', '2002-08-18 05:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103356, 4363, 2011, '<td valign="top">Yummy!</td>', 'Yummy!', '2002-08-18 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103357, 4363, 2170, '<td valign="top">Well, I was trying some experimentation on DOF and I guess it kind of backfired.  That combined with the fact that "new potatoes" is not a common term to many people probably killed me this week.  Oh well....live and learn.  LOL.<br/><br/>ps -- the Potatoes were delicious.  All of the ingredients (save the potatoes and olive oil) were from my garden.  Yum.</td>', 'Well, I was trying some experimentation on DOF and I guess it kind of backfired.  That combined with the fact that "new potatoes" is not a common term to many people probably killed me this week.  Oh well....live and learn.  LOL.ps -- the Potatoes were delicious.  All of the ingredients (save the potatoes and olive oil) were from my garden.  Yum.', '2002-08-19 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(103358, 4363, 2798, '<td valign="top">Surely that just leaves the rosemary?<br/><br/>Great shot though - I loved it.</td>', 'Surely that just leaves the rosemary?Great shot though - I loved it.', '2002-08-19 07:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(103359, 4363, 2170, '<td valign="top">rosemary, thyme, basil, and garlic, actually.  but thanks!</td>', 'rosemary, thyme, basil, and garlic, actually.  but thanks!', '2002-08-19 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(103360, 4364, 1792, '<td valign="top">The idea and lighting are great, however the other objects seem to distract rather than enhance.  Different cropping, showing more of the objects, might have been better---or leaving them out and letting the book stand alone.</td>', 'The idea and lighting are great, however the other objects seem to distract rather than enhance.  Different cropping, showing more of the objects, might have been better---or leaving them out and letting the book stand alone.', '2002-08-12 04:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103361, 4364, 2596, '<td valign="top">Too much brightness  on the left end what is that on top of the Testament, it look´s like you left your´re food on top. I put a 3 on it:)</td>', 'Too much brightness  on the left end what is that on top of the Testament, it look´s like you left your´re food on top. I put a 3 on it:)', '2002-08-12 06:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103362, 4364, 2256, '<td valign="top">REALLY nice! Nice effect, great subject....my favorite so far!</td>', 'REALLY nice! Nice effect, great subject....my favorite so far!', '2002-08-12 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103363, 4364, 2353, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and good original idea...I think that you should maybe try it again minus the candles...they kind of distract from the bible.  I love how the light brought out the cracks in the leather of the binding...very visual!  Good job! -8</td>', 'Good lighting and good original idea...I think that you should maybe try it again minus the candles...they kind of distract from the bible.  I love how the light brought out the cracks in the leather of the binding...very visual!  Good job! -8', '2002-08-12 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103364, 4364, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this is just too red and too dark.  (I can sort of come up with a reason for red, but it''s a stretch, but dark?  I reserve that for setting a mood)  The necklace is very, very hard to see, esp. the cropped part.  The candles...cropped and questionable, too.  (You''ve heard this book isn''t all that new, haven''t you? joke)  5 Swash<br/>Addendum:  Darkness  -  orange gold tablecloth, binding and candles are well lit.  Book cover w/necklace chain (disappearing in the distance) seem to dark to capture the details of the chain.  Cross cropped and out of focus.</td>', 'Sorry, but this is just too red and too dark.  (I can sort of come up with a reason for red, but it''s a stretch, but dark?  I reserve that for setting a mood)  The necklace is very, very hard to see, esp. the cropped part.  The candles...cropped and questionable, too.  (You''ve heard this book isn''t all that new, haven''t you? joke)  5 SwashAddendum:  Darkness  -  orange gold tablecloth, binding and candles are well lit.  Book cover w/necklace chain (disappearing in the distance) seem to dark to capture the details of the chain.  Cross cropped and out of focus.', '2002-08-12 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103365, 4364, 2817, '<td valign="top">A beautiful picture of the Bible! I love it. Bless you.</td>', 'A beautiful picture of the Bible! I love it. Bless you.', '2002-08-12 21:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103366, 4364, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition6<br/>Technical Aspects5<br/>Appeal5<br/>Creativity6<br/>Rating6Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition6Technical Aspects5Appeal5Creativity6Rating6Autool', '2002-08-12 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103367, 4364, 671, '<td valign="top">very nice framing, composition.  The lighting and sepia tones work well with this.</td>', 'very nice framing, composition.  The lighting and sepia tones work well with this.', '2002-08-12 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103368, 4364, 2997, '<td valign="top">The tonal mood in this picture is very good.<br/><br/>Please don''t take this as a criticism, it is just an observation: I can''t tell what the chain is and I''m not sure how the candles fit into the overall message.  (My pictures aren''t scoring too well either, so take this with a grain of salt.)</td>', 'The tonal mood in this picture is very good.Please don''t take this as a criticism, it is just an observation: I can''t tell what the chain is and I''m not sure how the candles fit into the overall message.  (My pictures aren''t scoring too well either, so take this with a grain of salt.)', '2002-08-13 00:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103369, 4364, 2780, '<td valign="top">i think u got the mood well captured here. its dimly lit but still well visable. nice one</td>', 'i think u got the mood well captured here. its dimly lit but still well visable. nice one', '2002-08-13 08:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
