(103372, 4364, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - quite good, items upper right distract me, though.<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  quite good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - quite good, items upper right distract me, though.Technical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  quite goodJim msp', '2002-08-13 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103373, 4364, 2764, '<td valign="top">The candles look like dead fingers!  The two texures don''t complement well.  But the Bilbe part works,  Unfortunately a photo is only as good as it''s WORST component.  Every detail should add, if not it detracts,</td>', 'The candles look like dead fingers!  The two texures don''t complement well.  But the Bilbe part works,  Unfortunately a photo is only as good as it''s WORST component.  Every detail should add, if not it detracts,', '2002-08-14 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103374, 4364, 2337, '<td valign="top">Great combination of old and new!  The sepia works great as does the shallow dof... A photo worthy of the author... 10</td>', 'Great combination of old and new!  The sepia works great as does the shallow dof... A photo worthy of the author... 10', '2002-08-14 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103375, 4364, 3016, '<td valign="top">the lighting is gorgeous</td>', 'the lighting is gorgeous', '2002-08-14 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103376, 4364, 2928, '<td valign="top">It''s a great shot. Lighting is dramatic and it fits the challenge.</td>', 'It''s a great shot. Lighting is dramatic and it fits the challenge.', '2002-08-15 06:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103377, 4364, 3044, '<td valign="top">nice set up. good angle.</td>', 'nice set up. good angle.', '2002-08-15 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103378, 4364, 806, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m daft, but I don''t know what those things on the top of the bible are. Even so, they don''t add to the photo. What are they?</td>', 'Maybe I''m daft, but I don''t know what those things on the top of the bible are. Even so, they don''t add to the photo. What are they?', '2002-08-15 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103379, 4364, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good use of shallowfield, with the exception that part of the necklace is in focus and part out, which is a tad distracting. Good subject.</td>', 'Good use of shallowfield, with the exception that part of the necklace is in focus and part out, which is a tad distracting. Good subject.', '2002-08-15 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103380, 4364, 2881, '<td valign="top">An interesting representation on "new"... I''m not sure what the items on the bible at the top right are. The fuzziness of the top left is a bit distracting, but overall, I liked it.</td>', 'An interesting representation on "new"... I''m not sure what the items on the bible at the top right are. The fuzziness of the top left is a bit distracting, but overall, I liked it.', '2002-08-15 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103381, 4364, 2700, '<td valign="top">I can hear Carmina Burana chanting in the background... 8</td>', 'I can hear Carmina Burana chanting in the background... 8', '2002-08-16 00:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103382, 4364, 3198, '<td valign="top">too yellow. what are those vegetables on the book? oh! it''s candles? they look like sausages of some kind. nice idea though because it''s something very old that''s still called ''new''</td>', 'too yellow. what are those vegetables on the book? oh! it''s candles? they look like sausages of some kind. nice idea though because it''s something very old that''s still called ''new''', '2002-08-16 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103383, 4364, 1280, '<td valign="top">YES!  This represents a lot to me.  New LIFE above all.  I love the idea here.  Now on to the criticism....what is the chain all about?  I can''t really make out the (cross?)  Knowing the subject of the NT I''d guess it''s a cross but that should be clearer. I have no idea at all what that other thing on the NT is.  Plastic carrots??  Oh wait...hubby came in and said they are candles...probably.  LOL...Whatever it is, it adds no virtue to this picture and should have been removed.  I do like the lighting of your image. My suggestions would be: 1-remove the candles, and 2-put the cross in a position where it can be clearly recognized, so it will strongly support the concept.</td>', 'YES!  This represents a lot to me.  New LIFE above all.  I love the idea here.  Now on to the criticism....what is the chain all about?  I can''t really make out the (cross?)  Knowing the subject of the NT I''d guess it''s a cross but that should be clearer. I have no idea at all what that other thing on the NT is.  Plastic carrots??  Oh wait...hubby came in and said they are candles...probably.  LOL...Whatever it is, it adds no virtue to this picture and should have been removed.  I do like the lighting of your image. My suggestions would be: 1-remove the candles, and 2-put the cross in a position where it can be clearly recognized, so it will strongly support the concept.', '2002-08-16 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103384, 4364, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the "New" category.</td>', 'Nice take on the "New" category.', '2002-08-16 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103385, 4364, 1891, '<td valign="top">Interesting focus but the lighting (perhaps candle) is too dark.</td>', 'Interesting focus but the lighting (perhaps candle) is too dark.', '2002-08-16 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103386, 4364, 2923, '<td valign="top">ok, it''s a book called the New Testament but doesn''t make me feel new</td>', 'ok, it''s a book called the New Testament but doesn''t make me feel new', '2002-08-16 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103387, 4364, 2815, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot of the New Testament.  I love it  (8)</td>', 'This is a great shot of the New Testament.  I love it  (8)', '2002-08-17 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103388, 4364, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not having a particular religious preference, I wasn''t aware what the things on top of the testament were.  I thought they were carrots, or strange roots.  It wasn''t until after I asked someone that they told me they were candles.  I wish we could see the entire charm on the end of the chain.  The lighting is very good.  The reference to something new is clear (however the testament it''s self is really old)  I do like the angle, but think it should be a little wider to show more detail.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Not having a particular religious preference, I wasn''t aware what the things on top of the testament were.  I thought they were carrots, or strange roots.  It wasn''t until after I asked someone that they told me they were candles.  I wish we could see the entire charm on the end of the chain.  The lighting is very good.  The reference to something new is clear (however the testament it''s self is really old)  I do like the angle, but think it should be a little wider to show more detail.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-18 23:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103389, 4364, 2983, '<td valign="top">The shallow DOF, focusing on the binding lettering, is appropriate here.  But what the heck are those things on the top right?</td>', 'The shallow DOF, focusing on the binding lettering, is appropriate here.  But what the heck are those things on the top right?', '2002-08-19 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103390, 4364, 2609, '<td valign="top">Psyche, normally I wouldn''t take the time to comment after the fact, but since I didn''t bother to vote on this particular challenge I wanted to tell you that for once I actually found your photo to really out do most of the photos above yours, not to mention it fully outdid at least 2 of the 3 winners.  <br/>Among the obvious technical wonderments of this photo lies pure emotion and meaning. Something people often lack, something many of the photos here lack.<br/>I commend you, but most of all I commend you for having the guts to upload a meaningful photo among the new crayons and pencils.  <br/><br/>Jessica (flummox)</td>', 'Psyche, normally I wouldn''t take the time to comment after the fact, but since I didn''t bother to vote on this particular challenge I wanted to tell you that for once I actually found your photo to really out do most of the photos above yours, not to mention it fully outdid at least 2 of the 3 winners.  Among the obvious technical wonderments of this photo lies pure emotion and meaning. Something people often lack, something many of the photos here lack.I commend you, but most of all I commend you for having the guts to upload a meaningful photo among the new crayons and pencils.  Jessica (flummox)', '2002-08-21 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(103391, 4365, 2204, '<td valign="top">Nice title selection</td>', 'Nice title selection', '2002-08-12 03:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103392, 4365, 1792, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Focus seems a bit fuzzy on central subject.  Shiny metal and stones like this are very hard to photograph.  A darker background might have been effective.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Focus seems a bit fuzzy on central subject.  Shiny metal and stones like this are very hard to photograph.  A darker background might have been effective.', '2002-08-12 04:08:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(103393, 4365, 2781, '<td valign="top">shouldn''t that ring be on the "ring finger"?</td>', 'shouldn''t that ring be on the "ring finger"?', '2002-08-12 04:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103394, 4365, 1360, '<td valign="top">Thre seems to be a lot of ccd noise in this shot.  You might want to try manually setting your camera to its lowest ISO setting next time.</td>', 'Thre seems to be a lot of ccd noise in this shot.  You might want to try manually setting your camera to its lowest ISO setting next time.', '2002-08-12 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103395, 4365, 2754, '<td valign="top">I think a real hand would have been better</td>', 'I think a real hand would have been better', '2002-08-12 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103396, 4365, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition6<br/>Technical Aspects6<br/>Appeal5<br/>Creativity5<br/>Rating6Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition6Technical Aspects6Appeal5Creativity5Rating6Autool', '2002-08-13 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103397, 4365, 2353, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  Unfortunately its a little grainy...</td>', 'Very interesting.  Unfortunately its a little grainy...', '2002-08-13 22:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103398, 4365, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting photo. Nice work, especially on the composition and lighting.</td>', 'This is a really interesting photo. Nice work, especially on the composition and lighting.', '2002-08-14 04:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103399, 4365, 806, '<td valign="top">Something is odd here: focus? sharpness? levels? curves?</td>', 'Something is odd here: focus? sharpness? levels? curves?', '2002-08-15 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103400, 4365, 3044, '<td valign="top">ring looks somewhat distorted, like the image was stretched. the color is wierd too. looks kind of like a dark image lightened too much with levels. nice idea.</td>', 'ring looks somewhat distorted, like the image was stretched. the color is wierd too. looks kind of like a dark image lightened too much with levels. nice idea.', '2002-08-15 18:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103401, 4365, 2881, '<td valign="top">One of the more creative photos of the challenge. I love the lines of the hand and the feel of the photo, but needs a richer background and maybe a little sharper focus.</td>', 'One of the more creative photos of the challenge. I love the lines of the hand and the feel of the photo, but needs a richer background and maybe a little sharper focus.', '2002-08-15 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103402, 4365, 2700, '<td valign="top">Its seems as if you way oversharpend or compressed your image too much...</td>', 'Its seems as if you way oversharpend or compressed your image too much...', '2002-08-16 00:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103403, 4365, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice still life, interesting curves on the dummy hand.  A black background would make the ring stand out better, rather than the hand stand out, since it is presumably the ring that is new.  I still like it.</td>', 'Nice still life, interesting curves on the dummy hand.  A black background would make the ring stand out better, rather than the hand stand out, since it is presumably the ring that is new.  I still like it.', '2002-08-16 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103404, 4365, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think a darker background may have added something to this photo.  The ring sort of blends in with the white background, making the ring not stand out as much as I think it should.  I like the way you displayed it.  it makes it original that way.  The focus is good and lighting is also good.  It''s only the background that makes it appear a bit bright.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I think a darker background may have added something to this photo.  The ring sort of blends in with the white background, making the ring not stand out as much as I think it should.  I like the way you displayed it.  it makes it original that way.  The focus is good and lighting is also good.  It''s only the background that makes it appear a bit bright.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-18 02:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103405, 4365, 2437, '<td valign="top">details of picture is washed out</td>', 'details of picture is washed out', '2002-08-18 07:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103406, 4365, 2204, '<td valign="top">Not a bad score for your first time out......I scored you higher and still feel  it deserved better.  But, then again, I would have been tickled with this score 2 weeks ago.</td>', 'Not a bad score for your first time out......I scored you higher and still feel  it deserved better.  But, then again, I would have been tickled with this score 2 weeks ago.', '2002-08-19 02:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(103407, 4369, 1856, '<td valign="top">great action!  i think a bigger dough ball might be more dramatic...possible frame so the edge of the counter isn''t visible.  good idea 7 Lisa</td>', 'great action!  i think a bigger dough ball might be more dramatic...possible frame so the edge of the counter isn''t visible.  good idea 7 Lisa', '2002-08-12 02:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103408, 4369, 3018, '<td valign="top">Nice movement capture.</td>', 'Nice movement capture.', '2002-08-12 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103409, 4369, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oh the movement in this shot is great! I can FEEL the pounding and hear that dough thudding against the surface. <br/>I don''t like the wooden table edge - would be nice if the dark table top bled into the darkness behind. I''d also like to see a little little bit higher - could maybe move the camera viewpoint to the left just a little too. <br/>Fab!<br/>Can I have some of the bread?<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Oh the movement in this shot is great! I can FEEL the pounding and hear that dough thudding against the surface. I don''t like the wooden table edge - would be nice if the dark table top bled into the darkness behind. I''d also like to see a little little bit higher - could maybe move the camera viewpoint to the left just a little too. Fab!Can I have some of the bread?7, Kavey', '2002-08-12 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103410, 4369, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the motion... and I''d love to sample the final product!</td>', 'I like the motion... and I''d love to sample the final product!', '2002-08-12 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103411, 4369, 2170, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t mind the action being blurred, but it seems like the whole picture is kind of fuzzy.  Nice concept, though.</td>', 'I wouldn''t mind the action being blurred, but it seems like the whole picture is kind of fuzzy.  Nice concept, though.', '2002-08-12 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103412, 4369, 3016, '<td valign="top">a little sharper and a little up more - otherwise, i love this picture</td>', 'a little sharper and a little up more - otherwise, i love this picture', '2002-08-12 19:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103413, 4369, 2567, '<td valign="top">Like the blur effect.  Spiller</td>', 'Like the blur effect.  Spiller', '2002-08-12 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103414, 4369, 2223, '<td valign="top">i like the action in this...nice shot.</td>', 'i like the action in this...nice shot.', '2002-08-12 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103415, 4369, 1748, '<td valign="top">nice study</td>', 'nice study', '2002-08-12 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103416, 4369, 2752, '<td valign="top">great idea..good action and composition</td>', 'great idea..good action and composition', '2002-08-13 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103417, 4369, 671, '<td valign="top">I like the blur to show forceful motion.</td>', 'I like the blur to show forceful motion.', '2002-08-13 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103418, 4369, 3127, '<td valign="top">The blurred movement is distracting. The color contrasts and the concept are good.</td>', 'The blurred movement is distracting. The color contrasts and the concept are good.', '2002-08-13 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103419, 4369, 2295, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  I think I would have liked it a bit more at a faster shutter speed (or a slower cook).</td>', 'Interesting photo.  I think I would have liked it a bit more at a faster shutter speed (or a slower cook).', '2002-08-13 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103420, 4369, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition6<br/>Technical Aspects5<br/>Appeal4<br/>Creativity4<br/>Rating5Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition6Technical Aspects5Appeal4Creativity4Rating5Autool', '2002-08-13 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103421, 4369, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - pretty good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good. <br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  pretty good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - pretty goodTechnical Aspects - quite good. Meets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  pretty goodJim msp', '2002-08-14 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103422, 4369, 1875, '<td valign="top">the blurred arms take away from the photo, I think.</td>', 'the blurred arms take away from the photo, I think.', '2002-08-14 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103423, 4369, 1826, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. You can just feel the strength in those hands.</td>', 'Nice capture. You can just feel the strength in those hands.', '2002-08-14 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103424, 4369, 616, '<td valign="top">Great idea and composition. It would have been nicer if the hands were still other than in motion.</td>', 'Great idea and composition. It would have been nicer if the hands were still other than in motion.', '2002-08-14 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103425, 4369, 2829, '<td valign="top">mmmm....new pizza...Can you have it delivered to my house too? :)<br/>Artistically this is good, it meets the challenge and is original. One complaint is that it has slight motion blur. I''m not sure if you meant to blur it and I''m not sure if i would have liked a perfectly in focus shot better but it''s certainly something to take a look at.</td>', 'mmmm....new pizza...Can you have it delivered to my house too? :)Artistically this is good, it meets the challenge and is original. One complaint is that it has slight motion blur. I''m not sure if you meant to blur it and I''m not sure if i would have liked a perfectly in focus shot better but it''s certainly something to take a look at.', '2002-08-15 09:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103426, 4369, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo... the ''chaotic'' sense given by the motion blur and the flour on the table surface shows nice action in this photo.  good work :) = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a great photo... the ''chaotic'' sense given by the motion blur and the flour on the table surface shows nice action in this photo.  good work :) = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-15 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103427, 4369, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good subject. Focus is a bit soft on the non-moving parts of the field.</td>', 'Good subject. Focus is a bit soft on the non-moving parts of the field.', '2002-08-17 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103428, 4369, 2997, '<td valign="top">Last day of the judging &amp; I finally get around to making a comment.  The action in this picture is very powerful.</td>', 'Last day of the judging & I finally get around to making a comment.  The action in this picture is very powerful.', '2002-08-17 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103429, 4369, 3080, '<td valign="top">I love the "splat" effect.  This is a very creative idea.  I wish we could see a bit more of the actual dough, but I''m not sure if that might take away from something, so I would have to see the 2 different shots before I could really judge that for sure.  Lighting and angle are good.  There are a few slightly out of focus spots, but I think that only contributes to the "splat-ness"  More like motion blur instead of just plain ol blur, so it works.  Great job and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I love the "splat" effect.  This is a very creative idea.  I wish we could see a bit more of the actual dough, but I''m not sure if that might take away from something, so I would have to see the 2 different shots before I could really judge that for sure.  Lighting and angle are good.  There are a few slightly out of focus spots, but I think that only contributes to the "splat-ness"  More like motion blur instead of just plain ol blur, so it works.  Great job and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-18 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103430, 4369, 749, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, more so than many this week! The motion blur works well, just a shame we can''t see a bit more of the dough... and those hairy arms look familiar ;o) Gets a 9 from me<br/>- Manic -</td>', 'Creative idea, more so than many this week! The motion blur works well, just a shame we can''t see a bit more of the dough... and those hairy arms look familiar ;o) Gets a 9 from me- Manic -', '2002-08-18 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103431, 4369, 1143, '<td valign="top">I thought this would rank higher. I like the idea. Maybe a different angle would have worked better. The edge of the counter bothered me. Trying an angle from above could have prevented that or taking a shot from the front with a white apron in the background might have worked. Nice job.</td>', 'I thought this would rank higher. I like the idea. Maybe a different angle would have worked better. The edge of the counter bothered me. Trying an angle from above could have prevented that or taking a shot from the front with a white apron in the background might have worked. Nice job.', '2002-08-19 03:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(103432, 4369, 1827, '<td valign="top">This was in my top ten for the week.  I am surprised it didn''t place higher.  The motion is great, as are the colors.  The texture the flour creates is terrific.  This is a photo you can feel.  Job well done.</td>', 'This was in my top ten for the week.  I am surprised it didn''t place higher.  The motion is great, as are the colors.  The texture the flour creates is terrific.  This is a photo you can feel.  Job well done.', '2002-08-19 05:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(103433, 4369, 1037, '<td valign="top">I''ve been a bit busy, so I didn''t see these new comments until now. I''m glad a lot of people liked this. I took a lot of photos as my boyfriend kneaded the dough (yeah, he''s in every second one of my photos, I know :/). I tried lots of different angles, I got him to make fists, to pick up the dough and slap it down, etc. In the end this shot had the least amount of problems while still having some nice motion blur, which I intentionally wanted to capture. I don''t like the edge of the bench either, but it was difficult to get nice photos from other angles, since there wasn''t much space to set up the lights. I also wished there was more dough showing in this shot, but it''s all about compromise.</td>', 'I''ve been a bit busy, so I didn''t see these new comments until now. I''m glad a lot of people liked this. I took a lot of photos as my boyfriend kneaded the dough (yeah, he''s in every second one of my photos, I know :/). I tried lots of different angles, I got him to make fists, to pick up the dough and slap it down, etc. In the end this shot had the least amount of problems while still having some nice motion blur, which I intentionally wanted to capture. I don''t like the edge of the bench either, but it was difficult to get nice photos from other angles, since there wasn''t much space to set up the lights. I also wished there was more dough showing in this shot, but it''s all about compromise.', '2002-08-20 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(103434, 4370, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, beautiful color. lhall</td>', 'Nice shot, beautiful color. lhall', '2002-08-12 01:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103435, 4370, 1330, '<td valign="top">excellent</td>', 'excellent', '2002-08-12 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103436, 4370, 2437, '<td valign="top">clear and sharp shot</td>', 'clear and sharp shot', '2002-08-12 05:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103437, 4370, 117, '<td valign="top">deer picture, deer stands out well</td>', 'deer picture, deer stands out well', '2002-08-12 06:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103438, 4370, 3198, '<td valign="top">nice shot, stange thing happening with the leg. but what is new?</td>', 'nice shot, stange thing happening with the leg. but what is new?', '2002-08-12 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103439, 4370, 1, '<td valign="top">Wow, the fawn really stands out.  I wish the tree wasn''t on the right, it''s a bit distracting.  Otherwise great composure and focus.</td>', 'Wow, the fawn really stands out.  I wish the tree wasn''t on the right, it''s a bit distracting.  Otherwise great composure and focus.', '2002-08-12 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103440, 4370, 2123, '<td valign="top">Lovely and crisp :-)</td>', 'Lovely and crisp :-)', '2002-08-12 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103441, 4370, 2716, '<td valign="top">Hey mom, it''s Bambi!.  But seriously, love this one.  Excellent detail (9)</td>', 'Hey mom, it''s Bambi!.  But seriously, love this one.  Excellent detail (9)', '2002-08-12 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103442, 4370, 1922, '<td valign="top">what a shot,wonderful</td>', 'what a shot,wonderful', '2002-08-12 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103443, 4370, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, and Wow and more Wow!  Very impressive.  I like everything about this shot.  The fawn almost screams off the page.  I love baby deer pics, but this is maybe the best I have ever seen.  Well deserved 10, if I could go higher, I would!  Swash</td>', 'Wow, and Wow and more Wow!  Very impressive.  I like everything about this shot.  The fawn almost screams off the page.  I love baby deer pics, but this is maybe the best I have ever seen.  Well deserved 10, if I could go higher, I would!  Swash', '2002-08-12 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
