(103451, 4370, 2337, '<td valign="top">Excellent catch!  It would have been a 10 if that dang tree in the front didn''t cover the rear leg, but that couldn''t be helped I''m sure.  Congrats on a great shot!</td>', 'Excellent catch!  It would have been a 10 if that dang tree in the front didn''t cover the rear leg, but that couldn''t be helped I''m sure.  Congrats on a great shot!', '2002-08-14 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103452, 4370, 3080, '<td valign="top">This little guy is adorable.  The photo was taken very nicely and is of great quality.  Can actually almost see the individual hairs on his belly.  Portrays "new" very well.  Only thing that would have been nice is if the tree wasn''t in front of his back leg.  Of course, I know how cooperative those baby deer can be, so I wont go so far as to be that picky.  You did a wonderful job of getting the deer in the photo to begin with.  You''re doing 100% times better than me on that one.  I can''t even get a good photo of a giraffe practically licking me on the nose!  I don''t think animals like me much, never seem to stand still at all.  Great job on the shot, and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This little guy is adorable.  The photo was taken very nicely and is of great quality.  Can actually almost see the individual hairs on his belly.  Portrays "new" very well.  Only thing that would have been nice is if the tree wasn''t in front of his back leg.  Of course, I know how cooperative those baby deer can be, so I wont go so far as to be that picky.  You did a wonderful job of getting the deer in the photo to begin with.  You''re doing 100% times better than me on that one.  I can''t even get a good photo of a giraffe practically licking me on the nose!  I don''t think animals like me much, never seem to stand still at all.  Great job on the shot, and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-15 02:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103453, 4370, 3105, '<td valign="top">I know that photographing any kind of wildlife can be very difficult and a lot of times is dependent upon luck.  I like this shot but the deer could be a little more in focus, especially its face.  Also the background is too busy and the tree in the foreground blocking the left rear leg detracts from the subject a little.  Again, I know that you probably couldn''t really control these things and that getting the deer that close and still was lucky enough.<br/>Score: 5<br/>Courtenay</td>', 'I know that photographing any kind of wildlife can be very difficult and a lot of times is dependent upon luck.  I like this shot but the deer could be a little more in focus, especially its face.  Also the background is too busy and the tree in the foreground blocking the left rear leg detracts from the subject a little.  Again, I know that you probably couldn''t really control these things and that getting the deer that close and still was lucky enough.Score: 5Courtenay', '2002-08-15 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103454, 4370, 3044, '<td valign="top">nice color and good detail. the branch in the foreground bothers me a bit. i know how hard it is though to catch the right moment when photographing wildlife. nice job.</td>', 'nice color and good detail. the branch in the foreground bothers me a bit. i know how hard it is though to catch the right moment when photographing wildlife. nice job.', '2002-08-15 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
