(103466, 4370, 2353, '<td valign="top">Hi everyone I just wanted to say thanks for all of the great comments!  This was my first entry to dpchallenge and I am glad that it has been a positive experience.  I initially wasn''t going to enter the "something new" competition because I couldn''t think of any ideas.  But last Saturday I was driving around photographing barns and I saw Noahs Ark, a wildlife reserve and rescue.  They had several acres of protected habitat for all types of wildlife including deer.  Well of course I had to stop and see what pictures I could get!  I spent about 3 or so hours stalking some doe (which luckily werent too skittish ) when I saw this little guy.  Well I knew right then and there that I had my something new. Thanks again!</td>', 'Hi everyone I just wanted to say thanks for all of the great comments!  This was my first entry to dpchallenge and I am glad that it has been a positive experience.  I initially wasn''t going to enter the "something new" competition because I couldn''t think of any ideas.  But last Saturday I was driving around photographing barns and I saw Noahs Ark, a wildlife reserve and rescue.  They had several acres of protected habitat for all types of wildlife including deer.  Well of course I had to stop and see what pictures I could get!  I spent about 3 or so hours stalking some doe (which luckily werent too skittish ) when I saw this little guy.  Well I knew right then and there that I had my something new. Thanks again!', '2002-08-19 08:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
