(103520, 4374, 1037, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this is a serious entry or not... I guess thinking it might be a joke would be insulting if it''s really serious :). I just don''t see anything in here that would fit the theme, and it has every flaw anyone ever identifies on DPC - pixelated, unfocussed, fill flash (in a night scene!).... if it''s a parody it''s very funny :) Well done if that was your intention, and if it wasn''t then I think you will get some very upsetting comments. <br/><br/>Nice sunset though.</td>', 'I don''t know if this is a serious entry or not... I guess thinking it might be a joke would be insulting if it''s really serious :). I just don''t see anything in here that would fit the theme, and it has every flaw anyone ever identifies on DPC - pixelated, unfocussed, fill flash (in a night scene!).... if it''s a parody it''s very funny :) Well done if that was your intention, and if it wasn''t then I think you will get some very upsetting comments. Nice sunset though.', '2002-08-13 04:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103521, 4374, 2829, '<td valign="top">I do not see how this relates to the challenge. Even the title left me in the dark (no pun inteded). Aside from that, technical aspects of this picture leave a lot to be desired.</td>', 'I do not see how this relates to the challenge. Even the title left me in the dark (no pun inteded). Aside from that, technical aspects of this picture leave a lot to be desired.', '2002-08-13 09:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103522, 4374, 3127, '<td valign="top">Too blurry and the flash takes over the lower portion of the picture</td>', 'Too blurry and the flash takes over the lower portion of the picture', '2002-08-13 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103523, 4374, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - fair<br/>Technical Aspects - fair. Bottle looks out of focus<br/>Meets Challenge - not sure what''s new here<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  ok<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - fairTechnical Aspects - fair. Bottle looks out of focusMeets Challenge - not sure what''s new hereVisual Impact / Originality  okJim msp', '2002-08-13 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103524, 4374, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition4<br/>Technical Aspects3<br/>Appeal3<br/>Creativity3<br/>Rating3Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition4Technical Aspects3Appeal3Creativity3Rating3Autool', '2002-08-13 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103525, 4374, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is great example of how to use fill flash, but you''ve lost the focus on the bottle; that spoils it quite a lot for me.  Having said that, on the positive side, it''s dramatic, interesting and full of colour A sharp image here would have been superb Challenge link (I think) is very weak Sorry for being negative</td>', 'This is great example of how to use fill flash, but you''ve lost the focus on the bottle; that spoils it quite a lot for me.  Having said that, on the positive side, it''s dramatic, interesting and full of colour A sharp image here would have been superb Challenge link (I think) is very weak Sorry for being negative', '2002-08-15 10:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103526, 4374, 640, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting.</td>', 'Interesting lighting.', '2002-08-15 14:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103527, 4374, 2247, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but very the bottum half is very blury.  The tree above is blurry also, but not as bad.  Your point of your pic is the bottle (judging by your title); however, the bottle is not the focus but the tree above is getting all the attention in your pic.  Next time try to focus in on your sublect you want us to see and let the other stuff (tree above, trees in background, darkness, light, etc) *support* your subject rather than be a "slave" to it.  I give your pic a 2.  Keep trying.  All of us have to start somewhere, so don''t get discouraged.</td>', 'Sorry, but very the bottum half is very blury.  The tree above is blurry also, but not as bad.  Your point of your pic is the bottle (judging by your title); however, the bottle is not the focus but the tree above is getting all the attention in your pic.  Next time try to focus in on your sublect you want us to see and let the other stuff (tree above, trees in background, darkness, light, etc) *support* your subject rather than be a "slave" to it.  I give your pic a 2.  Keep trying.  All of us have to start somewhere, so don''t get discouraged.', '2002-08-15 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103528, 4374, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like the colors of this shot.  I wish I could say I understood what you were going for.  The title baffles me, I think I see a bottle at the bottom of the frame, it''s kinda hard to tell. 5 Swash</td>', 'I like the colors of this shot.  I wish I could say I understood what you were going for.  The title baffles me, I think I see a bottle at the bottom of the frame, it''s kinda hard to tell. 5 Swash', '2002-08-16 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103529, 4374, 3080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sun set, but I think I''m failing to see the something new.  I can''t tell what the bottle is, or what the red thing right next to the bottle is.  The lighting could be either brighter so we can make out the objects in the back, or darker so we don''t see them at all.  There is something yellow hanging from the tree, but can''t make out what that is either.  I don''t get it, but then again, I wasn''t there.  Maybe the bottle is full of something new, but I don''t think we can see that from the picture.  I think a close up of the bottle would be good (if that''s the center of focus), or you could give up the bottle completely and go for that gorgous horizon!  Good luck.</td>', 'Beautiful sun set, but I think I''m failing to see the something new.  I can''t tell what the bottle is, or what the red thing right next to the bottle is.  The lighting could be either brighter so we can make out the objects in the back, or darker so we don''t see them at all.  There is something yellow hanging from the tree, but can''t make out what that is either.  I don''t get it, but then again, I wasn''t there.  Maybe the bottle is full of something new, but I don''t think we can see that from the picture.  I think a close up of the bottle would be good (if that''s the center of focus), or you could give up the bottle completely and go for that gorgous horizon!  Good luck.', '2002-08-16 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103530, 4374, 509, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I don''t really get the connection to the challenge with this one, The tree seems like it has a soft focus on it, but that could be your camera.  I think this could have been improved by having the camera on a tripod and turning off the flash to get rid of the white spots, with maybe some other form of lighting on the bottle.  A flash light oculd be used sort of like a spotlight maybe.  Finally, The focus is split between the bottle and the tree.  Did you consider cropping out the tree?</td>', 'I''m sorry, I don''t really get the connection to the challenge with this one, The tree seems like it has a soft focus on it, but that could be your camera.  I think this could have been improved by having the camera on a tripod and turning off the flash to get rid of the white spots, with maybe some other form of lighting on the bottle.  A flash light oculd be used sort of like a spotlight maybe.  Finally, The focus is split between the bottle and the tree.  Did you consider cropping out the tree?', '2002-08-17 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103531, 4374, 312, '<td valign="top">is there a subject to this photograph? you might want to find one, and kill the flash. it creates a really harsh sphere of light that really detracts from the dark sky/sunset. also, there is massive jpeg compression in this photo that i don''t think was caused by a low end camera, but rather by a lack of knowledge of post processing software. also, i don''t see how this fits the challenge, but i won''t take off any points for that.</td>', 'is there a subject to this photograph? you might want to find one, and kill the flash. it creates a really harsh sphere of light that really detracts from the dark sky/sunset. also, there is massive jpeg compression in this photo that i don''t think was caused by a low end camera, but rather by a lack of knowledge of post processing software. also, i don''t see how this fits the challenge, but i won''t take off any points for that.', '2002-08-18 04:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103532, 4374, 3351, '<td valign="top">harsh contrast. bad focus</td>', 'harsh contrast. bad focus', '2002-08-18 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103533, 4374, 1280, '<td valign="top">That sky is brilliant!  Would like to have seen more of it.</td>', 'That sky is brilliant!  Would like to have seen more of it.', '2002-08-18 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103534, 4375, 2867, '<td valign="top">i did the other house being built but yours definetly has a better composition than mind.  good job!</td>', 'i did the other house being built but yours definetly has a better composition than mind.  good job!', '2002-08-12 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103535, 4375, 2752, '<td valign="top">very strong composition..like the play of lines and angles against the foliage in the foreground.</td>', 'very strong composition..like the play of lines and angles against the foliage in the foreground.', '2002-08-12 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103536, 4375, 2754, '<td valign="top">The title really does it for me</td>', 'The title really does it for me', '2002-08-12 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103537, 4375, 2717, '<td valign="top">I don''t think so.  Much too much work to move in next month.</td>', 'I don''t think so.  Much too much work to move in next month.', '2002-08-12 20:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103538, 4375, 714, '<td valign="top">Love the title.  It is great to have neighbors that you can share with.  I always seem to run out of eggs.  I like the way you have the tree on the side of the photo.</td>', 'Love the title.  It is great to have neighbors that you can share with.  I always seem to run out of eggs.  I like the way you have the tree on the side of the photo.', '2002-08-12 22:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
