(103540, 4375, 2643, '<td valign="top">If I didn''t live in a place with so much construction going on, I''d like it.  But I''m guessing that this picture is not showing something that is quite new, but something that is going to be new...although that is just a techicality.  How does the bush on the side add to the "new" theme?  Maybe you should have taken the picture with a construction worker in it...otherwise it seems kinda like it''s not getting done very quickly.</td>', 'If I didn''t live in a place with so much construction going on, I''d like it.  But I''m guessing that this picture is not showing something that is quite new, but something that is going to be new...although that is just a techicality.  How does the bush on the side add to the "new" theme?  Maybe you should have taken the picture with a construction worker in it...otherwise it seems kinda like it''s not getting done very quickly.', '2002-08-13 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103541, 4375, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - pretty good<br/>Technical Aspects - pretty good. <br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  pretty good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - pretty goodTechnical Aspects - pretty good. Meets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  pretty goodJim msp', '2002-08-14 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103542, 4375, 2928, '<td valign="top">This does look really new, great picture.</td>', 'This does look really new, great picture.', '2002-08-14 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103543, 4375, 1, '<td valign="top">Decent composure, I think the branches on the left don''t help.  The lighting during sunset or sunrise would''ve been better for this I think.</td>', 'Decent composure, I think the branches on the left don''t help.  The lighting during sunset or sunrise would''ve been better for this I think.', '2002-08-14 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103544, 4375, 2247, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image.  Good for you, esp outdoors pics where the weather is so unpredictalbe.</td>', 'Nice sharp image.  Good for you, esp outdoors pics where the weather is so unpredictalbe.', '2002-08-15 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103545, 4375, 554, '<td valign="top">Picture perfect--angle,color,crop and title. One of the few this week that un-deniably met the challenge. Great job. top 4</td>', 'Picture perfect--angle,color,crop and title. One of the few this week that un-deniably met the challenge. Great job. top 4', '2002-08-16 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103546, 4375, 3080, '<td valign="top">Great angle.  You didn''t get too much "other" stuff in your photo. The subject is very clear.   I like how the plants are over there on the left.  This is definately new.  doesn''t get much newer than that.  Crappy looking sky though, looks like it''s going to rain.  I know that''s not your fault though, If we could control the sky and the weather, we would.  I know I''d change something about today, for sure.  Great shot and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Great angle.  You didn''t get too much "other" stuff in your photo. The subject is very clear.   I like how the plants are over there on the left.  This is definately new.  doesn''t get much newer than that.  Crappy looking sky though, looks like it''s going to rain.  I know that''s not your fault though, If we could control the sky and the weather, we would.  I know I''d change something about today, for sure.  Great shot and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-17 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103547, 4375, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great shot, great title.</td>', 'Great shot, great title.', '2002-08-18 15:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103548, 4376, 2204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful but it looks more like sunset than sunrise.However, even if it is sunset it could be the new sunset of the day.</td>', 'Beautiful but it looks more like sunset than sunrise.However, even if it is sunset it could be the new sunset of the day.', '2002-08-12 03:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103549, 4376, 1792, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunrise.</td>', 'Beautiful sunrise.', '2002-08-12 04:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103550, 4376, 117, '<td valign="top">i love the colors no leaves i hope your in the southern hemisphere regardless 10</td>', 'i love the colors no leaves i hope your in the southern hemisphere regardless 10', '2002-08-12 06:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103551, 4376, 1779, '<td valign="top">cool and beautiful...</td>', 'cool and beautiful...', '2002-08-12 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
