(103569, 4376, 1031, '<td valign="top">I love taking photos like this too! Well done, especially to get up for a sunrise..with my schedule I have to specialize in sunsets.</td>', 'I love taking photos like this too! Well done, especially to get up for a sunrise..with my schedule I have to specialize in sunsets.', '2002-08-13 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
