(103582, 4376, 3018, '<td valign="top">I love the colors that you captured on this picture. I like looking at it.  You should be on the top 5.</td>', 'I love the colors that you captured on this picture. I like looking at it.  You should be on the top 5.', '2002-08-15 12:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103583, 4376, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, and clear shot. IMHO more of the landscape and less of the darkest sky at the tip top. Still nice catch here, good work. Score -6 Kee</td>', 'Lovely colors, and clear shot. IMHO more of the landscape and less of the darkest sky at the tip top. Still nice catch here, good work. Score -6 Kee', '2002-08-15 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103584, 4376, 2881, '<td valign="top">I don''t like to see the name of the challenge (new) used in the title... too cliche or something. There are lots of other, more creative ways to express it. Actually looks more like a sunset to me, but I know sometimes you get real red skies in the morning too. Good photo but too many "sunrise" type photo''s in this challenge.</td>', 'I don''t like to see the name of the challenge (new) used in the title... too cliche or something. There are lots of other, more creative ways to express it. Actually looks more like a sunset to me, but I know sometimes you get real red skies in the morning too. Good photo but too many "sunrise" type photo''s in this challenge.', '2002-08-15 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103585, 4376, 3247, '<td valign="top">Wonderful contrast. I angle of view was slightly to the right so as to frame the shot with just two trees</td>', 'Wonderful contrast. I angle of view was slightly to the right so as to frame the shot with just two trees', '2002-08-15 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
