(103607, 4377, 2798, '<td valign="top">Nice white background and lovely sort shadows. I think some light to put highlights on the win rack would have helped it a little but I wouldn''t want to do that at the expense of losing those nice soft shadows.</td>', 'Nice white background and lovely sort shadows. I think some light to put highlights on the win rack would have helped it a little but I wouldn''t want to do that at the expense of losing those nice soft shadows.', '2002-08-13 06:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
