(103612, 4377, 3080, '<td valign="top">The lighting is good, setup is good, and focus is good.  I am not sure if maybe it would be a little better if you hadn''t cut off the rack to the left.  I''d have to see the 2 pics side by side to determine which i liked better.  No annoying shadows of bright spots.  Very nicely done. Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'The lighting is good, setup is good, and focus is good.  I am not sure if maybe it would be a little better if you hadn''t cut off the rack to the left.  I''d have to see the 2 pics side by side to determine which i liked better.  No annoying shadows of bright spots.  Very nicely done. Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-18 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
