(103631, 4378, 1280, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge: Without title how would I know it''s new?  I guess compared to older cameras.<br/>Technical aspects: Pretty clear, although some lost detail.  <br/>Artistic Merit: good background for contrast, but uninspiring. <br/>Suggestions: Taken outdoors maybe in an attractive setting, and perhaps showing a scene or subject for the camera to photograph would add more interest.</td>', 'Meets challenge: Without title how would I know it''s new?  I guess compared to older cameras.Technical aspects: Pretty clear, although some lost detail.  Artistic Merit: good background for contrast, but uninspiring. Suggestions: Taken outdoors maybe in an attractive setting, and perhaps showing a scene or subject for the camera to photograph would add more interest.', '2002-08-16 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103632, 4378, 2011, '<td valign="top">Wish I had a new toy.........</td>', 'Wish I had a new toy.........', '2002-08-16 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
