(103634, 4378, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately something new.  But how new is it REALLY??  I bet you''ve already taken hundreds of photos with it and it''s probably only a few hours old. LOL.  I''m just playing.  It''s late and I just realized I missed 6 photos for commenting on.  The lighting is great and the angle is very nice.  You have different colors in your lens. Naturally, I''m impressed seeing as that I have a HP 315. LOL. and can barely SEE my lens let alone have different colors in it.  Great depiction of something new.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Definately something new.  But how new is it REALLY??  I bet you''ve already taken hundreds of photos with it and it''s probably only a few hours old. LOL.  I''m just playing.  It''s late and I just realized I missed 6 photos for commenting on.  The lighting is great and the angle is very nice.  You have different colors in your lens. Naturally, I''m impressed seeing as that I have a HP 315. LOL. and can barely SEE my lens let alone have different colors in it.  Great depiction of something new.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-19 00:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103635, 4378, 2829, '<td valign="top">Would be nice, if the box was in the photo and maybe a birthday card...</td>', 'Would be nice, if the box was in the photo and maybe a birthday card...', '2002-08-19 00:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103636, 4379, 2781, '<td valign="top">What a cute baby!</td>', 'What a cute baby!', '2002-08-12 04:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
