(103639, 4379, 2928, '<td valign="top">Gets my oooh vote :-)  Good shot too...</td>', 'Gets my oooh vote :-)  Good shot too...', '2002-08-12 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103640, 4379, 3102, '<td valign="top">Cool!  Just one anal-retentive comment.  It looks to me like the large elephant is in sharp focus, while the baby is ever-so-slightly blurred.  Given that the subject of the challenge is "new," I would have tried to capture the baby more in focus.</td>', 'Cool!  Just one anal-retentive comment.  It looks to me like the large elephant is in sharp focus, while the baby is ever-so-slightly blurred.  Given that the subject of the challenge is "new," I would have tried to capture the baby more in focus.', '2002-08-12 19:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103641, 4379, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition7<br/>Technical Aspects6<br/>Appeal6<br/>Creativity5<br/>Rating6Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition7Technical Aspects6Appeal6Creativity5Rating6Autool', '2002-08-13 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103642, 4379, 2829, '<td valign="top">Adorable little elephant. It''s cliché but not so cliché since it''s not a human. Good take on the obvious.</td>', 'Adorable little elephant. It''s cliché but not so cliché since it''s not a human. Good take on the obvious.', '2002-08-13 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103643, 4379, 3080, '<td valign="top">oh my.  The thumbnail of this photo looked fine, but when it was blown up to the big picture, I can barely tell they are elephants.  I have tried for the last 2 days, thinking it may be a server problem, and I tried refreshing it over and over, thinking that maybe the file was just freaking out, but I''m still having the same results on the large version of this one, so I''m going to judge the thumbnail.  I can''t see in great detail, however the photo looks good.  Would have been really cool if you could have gotten them in a location where you couldn''t really tell they were in a zoo. (I know, elephants don''t cooperate with strangers very well :).  anyway, it''s a very nice photo.  wish I could have gotten a clear large version.  I''ll keep trying.</td>', 'oh my.  The thumbnail of this photo looked fine, but when it was blown up to the big picture, I can barely tell they are elephants.  I have tried for the last 2 days, thinking it may be a server problem, and I tried refreshing it over and over, thinking that maybe the file was just freaking out, but I''m still having the same results on the large version of this one, so I''m going to judge the thumbnail.  I can''t see in great detail, however the photo looks good.  Would have been really cool if you could have gotten them in a location where you couldn''t really tell they were in a zoo. (I know, elephants don''t cooperate with strangers very well :).  anyway, it''s a very nice photo.  wish I could have gotten a clear large version.  I''ll keep trying.', '2002-08-13 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103644, 4379, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  quite good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - quite goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  quite goodJim msp', '2002-08-13 19:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103645, 4379, 2295, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  The lighting and focus are great.  Your layout is nice.  7</td>', 'Great shot.  The lighting and focus are great.  Your layout is nice.  7', '2002-08-14 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103646, 4379, 1280, '<td valign="top">sweet...I love animal pics and that gains points in my book. One little thing I would have tried to do differently is get rid of the wall in the upper right by slightly changing the perspective.  The trees in the back make a nice backdrop. Still very nice!  If you like zoos check out this website  www.wcs.org  Nice work, good luck.  Grayce...aka...Gracious</td>', 'sweet...I love animal pics and that gains points in my book. One little thing I would have tried to do differently is get rid of the wall in the upper right by slightly changing the perspective.  The trees in the back make a nice backdrop. Still very nice!  If you like zoos check out this website  www.wcs.org  Nice work, good luck.  Grayce...aka...Gracious', '2002-08-16 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103647, 4379, 2881, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is cute! Although I really don''t like to see the challenge name (new) used as part of the title. Be creative, get out your thesaurus! I do like the picture though, I like everything about it. Good detail, color, balance, etc.</td>', 'Oh, this is cute! Although I really don''t like to see the challenge name (new) used as part of the title. Be creative, get out your thesaurus! I do like the picture though, I like everything about it. Good detail, color, balance, etc.', '2002-08-16 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103648, 4379, 637, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, although the image is a bit pedestrian... 5 sjgleah... guess what i don''t like is the trite composition.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, although the image is a bit pedestrian... 5 sjgleah... guess what i don''t like is the trite composition.', '2002-08-18 05:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103649, 4379, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot... This works nicely for the ''new'' challenge.. I love the detail in this shot... great work :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'excellent shot... This works nicely for the ''new'' challenge.. I love the detail in this shot... great work :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-18 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103650, 4379, 2247, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  You had a good vantage point to take this.  I know because I was at my local zoo and trying to get a good shot is difficult due to the distance away from you and the animal subject.  Not to mention the pillars, barricades, etc, etc.  that will mess up a good pic.</td>', 'Good composition.  You had a good vantage point to take this.  I know because I was at my local zoo and trying to get a good shot is difficult due to the distance away from you and the animal subject.  Not to mention the pillars, barricades, etc, etc.  that will mess up a good pic.', '2002-08-18 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103651, 4379, 3112, '<td valign="top">Slightly overdriven, but excellent theme.</td>', 'Slightly overdriven, but excellent theme.', '2002-08-18 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103652, 4379, 2256, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of the comments - both good and....not so good. ha<br/>But to Rocco22, I had a couple with the baby alone, but I liked the contrast in size to the mother in this shot so I went with this one.<br/>Thanks again everyone!</td>', 'Thanks for all of the comments - both good and....not so good. haBut to Rocco22, I had a couple with the baby alone, but I liked the contrast in size to the mother in this shot so I went with this one.Thanks again everyone!', '2002-08-19 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(103653, 4379, 2256, '<td valign="top">to tee tah who commented "...I really don''t like to see the challenge name (new) used as part of the title. Be creative, get out your thesaurus!"<br/>I used it because it rhymed and I thought it was cute.  If I was going to simply use the challenge name I would have called it "Something New" at the Zoo.</td>', 'to tee tah who commented "...I really don''t like to see the challenge name (new) used as part of the title. Be creative, get out your thesaurus!"I used it because it rhymed and I thought it was cute.  If I was going to simply use the challenge name I would have called it "Something New" at the Zoo.', '2002-08-19 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(103654, 4385, 2553, '<td valign="top">Unbelievable shot! Love the colors. lhall</td>', 'Unbelievable shot! Love the colors. lhall', '2002-08-12 02:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103655, 4385, 2781, '<td valign="top">is that real?  or plastic?</td>', 'is that real?  or plastic?', '2002-08-12 04:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103656, 4385, 3018, '<td valign="top">Needs a little more focus.  Nice subject.</td>', 'Needs a little more focus.  Nice subject.', '2002-08-12 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103657, 4385, 3087, '<td valign="top">WOW!<br/>This is mucho cool and great colour. <br/>What are the two white circles at the top and one at the side? My score would be higher without them.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'WOW!This is mucho cool and great colour. What are the two white circles at the top and one at the side? My score would be higher without them.7, Kavey', '2002-08-12 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
