(103664, 4385, 2295, '<td valign="top">Interesting Photo.  I don''t know much about sea horses, but it looks "new" to me.  Lightig is good.  Focus is kind of interesting.  Overall, a good shot.</td>', 'Interesting Photo.  I don''t know much about sea horses, but it looks "new" to me.  Lightig is good.  Focus is kind of interesting.  Overall, a good shot.', '2002-08-14 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103665, 4385, 2881, '<td valign="top">I love sea life, and this shows nice detail and good clarity, especially since it was probably taken through aquarium glass.  I like the balance of color.  I might have cropped it differently for balance, but of course I don''t know what you had to work with for the original.  I''ve had photos that could have been so much better if only I''d been able to crop just a little differently...</td>', 'I love sea life, and this shows nice detail and good clarity, especially since it was probably taken through aquarium glass.  I like the balance of color.  I might have cropped it differently for balance, but of course I don''t know what you had to work with for the original.  I''ve had photos that could have been so much better if only I''d been able to crop just a little differently...', '2002-08-15 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103666, 4385, 327, '<td valign="top">Dern good shot through the glass and he''s looking right at the camera! Very good catch. Score -6 Kee</td>', 'Dern good shot through the glass and he''s looking right at the camera! Very good catch. Score -6 Kee', '2002-08-15 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103667, 4385, 1005, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo!  I know you couldn''t control the scratches (or whatever) in the glass, but it is sooo distracting.  The little buddy is about as clear as I have ever seen.  There are a number of light reflections, as well.  A couple could have been cropped out as they were near the edges, but you would still have several that couldn''t be cut.  (no down grade at all, this is more than hard to do.)  9 Swash</td>', 'I really like this photo!  I know you couldn''t control the scratches (or whatever) in the glass, but it is sooo distracting.  The little buddy is about as clear as I have ever seen.  There are a number of light reflections, as well.  A couple could have been cropped out as they were near the edges, but you would still have several that couldn''t be cut.  (no down grade at all, this is more than hard to do.)  9 Swash', '2002-08-16 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103668, 4385, 2815, '<td valign="top">that is a scary little thing</td>', 'that is a scary little thing', '2002-08-17 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103669, 4385, 3112, '<td valign="top">Could be beautiful.  Colors are right. DOF is right. Exposure seems right.  ocus just a tad soft.  Unfortunate glass scratches distract, however.</td>', 'Could be beautiful.  Colors are right. DOF is right. Exposure seems right.  ocus just a tad soft.  Unfortunate glass scratches distract, however.', '2002-08-17 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103670, 4385, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not knowing what a new "sea foal" looks like, I''m going to have to take your word on this.  You did a fine job of getting him centered into the photo.  The lighting is good, however the background is kind of bland.  I understand that you couldn''t just say "hey little sea foal, could you please come over here to this more pleasing background and hang out awhile?"  So I wont let it bother me too much.  However, I do have one question.  What the heck is all that stuff floating around?  It''s kind of icky looking.  Thanks for the opportunity to view the sea foal.  He''s a cutie. Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Not knowing what a new "sea foal" looks like, I''m going to have to take your word on this.  You did a fine job of getting him centered into the photo.  The lighting is good, however the background is kind of bland.  I understand that you couldn''t just say "hey little sea foal, could you please come over here to this more pleasing background and hang out awhile?"  So I wont let it bother me too much.  However, I do have one question.  What the heck is all that stuff floating around?  It''s kind of icky looking.  Thanks for the opportunity to view the sea foal.  He''s a cutie. Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-18 02:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103671, 4385, 2798, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful opportunity for a photo! And good work getting it so close and so colourful. This chap must be tiny!</td>', 'What a wonderful opportunity for a photo! And good work getting it so close and so colourful. This chap must be tiny!', '2002-08-18 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
