(103685, 4388, 3080, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out if this is a photo of a wedding or a communion.  I''m not familiar with communions, but she seems young, so that cast my doubt as to if this was a wedding photo. (then again, I looked like I was about 14 when I got married, so that really has no bearing on anything.) Either way, she is definately entering a new phase in her life and she looks very happy.  Good shot!  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I can''t figure out if this is a photo of a wedding or a communion.  I''m not familiar with communions, but she seems young, so that cast my doubt as to if this was a wedding photo. (then again, I looked like I was about 14 when I got married, so that really has no bearing on anything.) Either way, she is definately entering a new phase in her life and she looks very happy.  Good shot!  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-16 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
