(103774, 4395, 1280, '<td valign="top">Though handsome I don''t readily see new...but after reading your title I understand he is someone you just met at sunrise..which is also new....a new day. Nice that he let you take his picture.  I like this picture...I would like to have seen his hair NOT cropped out of the picture...so if you had just lifted the camera a little it would have fit into the frame.  Nice portrait anyway.  Good luck!</td>', 'Though handsome I don''t readily see new...but after reading your title I understand he is someone you just met at sunrise..which is also new....a new day. Nice that he let you take his picture.  I like this picture...I would like to have seen his hair NOT cropped out of the picture...so if you had just lifted the camera a little it would have fit into the frame.  Nice portrait anyway.  Good luck!', '2002-08-18 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
