(103853, 4398, 3044, '<td valign="top">very cool compostion. i love all the geometric lines and shapes going on. if you could pull some of the cyan or blue out of the walls and bring to a more pure white and then saturate those red bricks this could have much more impact. good eye. keep it up.</td>', 'very cool compostion. i love all the geometric lines and shapes going on. if you could pull some of the cyan or blue out of the walls and bring to a more pure white and then saturate those red bricks this could have much more impact. good eye. keep it up.', '2002-08-15 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103854, 4398, 3080, '<td valign="top">To me, this is visually unapealing.  with all the flat white, the focus seems to be the dark part of the building. that''s where my eyes are drawn, to the dark part of the building, and that part looks very old.  however, in comparison, the dark part makes the white part look new, which is what I think was the message you were trying to come across with.  however, being as that my eyes are firstly drawn to the old part of the building, that''s what I see first and the image I get is old, not new.</td>', 'To me, this is visually unapealing.  with all the flat white, the focus seems to be the dark part of the building. that''s where my eyes are drawn, to the dark part of the building, and that part looks very old.  however, in comparison, the dark part makes the white part look new, which is what I think was the message you were trying to come across with.  however, being as that my eyes are firstly drawn to the old part of the building, that''s what I see first and the image I get is old, not new.', '2002-08-15 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103855, 4398, 327, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit OOF to my eye, but I really like this. All these lines, angles. Nice work.<br/>Score-6 Kee</td>', 'Looks a bit OOF to my eye, but I really like this. All these lines, angles. Nice work.Score-6 Kee', '2002-08-15 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103856, 4398, 3112, '<td valign="top">There is something missing here.  Perhaps contrast.  I like the subject VERY much, though.  Good geometry, and thematic contrast.</td>', 'There is something missing here.  Perhaps contrast.  I like the subject VERY much, though.  Good geometry, and thematic contrast.', '2002-08-15 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
