(103861, 4400, 1037, '<td valign="top">Every week I pick a photo from the thumbnails that stands out to me, and start voting by giving it 10, and this is it :).  I love the mood in this photo, the textures of the new walls, the way the boots are positioned, and the soft lighting from the window. Very cool! - lisae</td>', 'Every week I pick a photo from the thumbnails that stands out to me, and start voting by giving it 10, and this is it :).  I love the mood in this photo, the textures of the new walls, the way the boots are positioned, and the soft lighting from the window. Very cool! - lisae', '2002-08-12 05:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
