(103871, 4400, 1856, '<td valign="top">this is an incredible photo.  i love the black and white...the light...the composition...the textures...this is art.  I couldn''t really figure out the new in this one...had to dock a couple of points...put this in another contest...it''ll do very well!  8 Lisa</td>', 'this is an incredible photo.  i love the black and white...the light...the composition...the textures...this is art.  I couldn''t really figure out the new in this one...had to dock a couple of points...put this in another contest...it''ll do very well!  8 Lisa', '2002-08-12 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
