(103882, 4400, 2937, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice picture. I like very mutch the composition and the B&amp;W. The contrast of old and new and the boots gives an astonishing contrast. Well done :-)</td>', 'This is a very nice picture. I like very mutch the composition and the B&W. The contrast of old and new and the boots gives an astonishing contrast. Well done :-)', '2002-08-16 04:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103883, 4400, 3080, '<td valign="top">You have a great idea here.  I am a really huge fan of black and white, but I think I might have needed some color here.  I can''t tell if I''m looking at rough plaster, or concrete.  My eyes are automatically drawn to the right wall because of the way the boots are facing, so that''s why that stands out at me.  To me, the window doesn''t seem to be the kind of window that would be installed into a new hosue, but I''ve been wrong before.  It doesn''t seem like a window that would keep the cold out in the winter.  My reasoning behind this is probably only influenced by my location which is known for it''s really cold winters.  Just as if I were to see a house with a flat roof instead of a peak.  I like the photo and think that the idea behind it gets the point across.  Congrats and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You have a great idea here.  I am a really huge fan of black and white, but I think I might have needed some color here.  I can''t tell if I''m looking at rough plaster, or concrete.  My eyes are automatically drawn to the right wall because of the way the boots are facing, so that''s why that stands out at me.  To me, the window doesn''t seem to be the kind of window that would be installed into a new hosue, but I''ve been wrong before.  It doesn''t seem like a window that would keep the cold out in the winter.  My reasoning behind this is probably only influenced by my location which is known for it''s really cold winters.  Just as if I were to see a house with a flat roof instead of a peak.  I like the photo and think that the idea behind it gets the point across.  Congrats and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-16 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103884, 4400, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lovely stark feeling about this shot. The light and framing are excellent and you''ve captured the mood of a moment very well.</td>', 'Lovely stark feeling about this shot. The light and framing are excellent and you''ve captured the mood of a moment very well.', '2002-08-18 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
