(103901, 4401, 2881, '<td valign="top">This made me smile, although I don''t like to see the name of the challenge (new) used in the title... too cliche. The title would be effective just by dropping the word new.  Unless the "forms" were in fact creamy colored, I think the photo could be lightened up some... on my computer anyway, it shows quite dark. Very original, though, and I like pictures with a sense of humor.</td>', 'This made me smile, although I don''t like to see the name of the challenge (new) used in the title... too cliche. The title would be effective just by dropping the word new.  Unless the "forms" were in fact creamy colored, I think the photo could be lightened up some... on my computer anyway, it shows quite dark. Very original, though, and I like pictures with a sense of humor.', '2002-08-15 20:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
