(103907, 4402, 3002, '<td valign="top">While I think this is a pretty good photo of an ape (except for the glare to the left of his right eye), I''m sorry, but it has nothing to do with "something new", and putting the word ''new'' in the title doesn''t change that fact.  With all due respects to the photographer, you should have saved this photo for a different challenge.</td>', 'While I think this is a pretty good photo of an ape (except for the glare to the left of his right eye), I''m sorry, but it has nothing to do with "something new", and putting the word ''new'' in the title doesn''t change that fact.  With all due respects to the photographer, you should have saved this photo for a different challenge.', '2002-08-12 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
