(103921, 4402, 3080, '<td valign="top">I understand the title...but the gorilla isn''t new, nor does the photo contain anything new.  Only the suggestion that he WANTS something new.  The feeling here is sadness, or sleepiness, not newness.  Setting that aside, it looks like the photo was taken through glass.  It is a nice photo of a gorilla, and think that it should be tried for a different challenge, but it''s a stretch on weather or not it meets "something new" .</td>', 'I understand the title...but the gorilla isn''t new, nor does the photo contain anything new.  Only the suggestion that he WANTS something new.  The feeling here is sadness, or sleepiness, not newness.  Setting that aside, it looks like the photo was taken through glass.  It is a nice photo of a gorilla, and think that it should be tried for a different challenge, but it''s a stretch on weather or not it meets "something new" .', '2002-08-15 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103922, 4402, 806, '<td valign="top">What a great shot!!! A bit of atretch for the challenge, but funny enough (and probably true enough!) to be reachable. Usually I think a photo should stand on it''s own without the title, but I like this.</td>', 'What a great shot!!! A bit of atretch for the challenge, but funny enough (and probably true enough!) to be reachable. Usually I think a photo should stand on it''s own without the title, but I like this.', '2002-08-15 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103923, 4402, 2427, '<td valign="top">I like the rich texture.  Tough to make the connection w/o the title</td>', 'I like the rich texture.  Tough to make the connection w/o the title', '2002-08-15 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103924, 4402, 2204, '<td valign="top">Photo is quite well done....Maybe a bit over sharpened....However, I wouldn''t have known why this was being submitted for something new without the title.  Therefore, I don''t really feel it fits the challenge.  :&amp;gt;(</td>', 'Photo is quite well done....Maybe a bit over sharpened....However, I wouldn''t have known why this was being submitted for something new without the title.  Therefore, I don''t really feel it fits the challenge.  :&gt;(', '2002-08-16 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103925, 4402, 2221, '<td valign="top">This photo emotionally touches me. The gorilla looks very sad. I interpret the title as a statement that you don''t like that the gorilla is caged. Personally, until now I avoided going to the zoo, because I somehow feel that I would support the imprisonment of the animals. And despite there are people who care about them, I think they suffer. Just as an explanation why I am very touched by this photo.<br/>Technically the photo is also above average. The composition is very good. The tight cropping creates a very intimate feeling. Focus and lighting arte also good. Only distracting thing is the glare on the glass between you and the gorilla.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'This photo emotionally touches me. The gorilla looks very sad. I interpret the title as a statement that you don''t like that the gorilla is caged. Personally, until now I avoided going to the zoo, because I somehow feel that I would support the imprisonment of the animals. And despite there are people who care about them, I think they suffer. Just as an explanation why I am very touched by this photo.Technically the photo is also above average. The composition is very good. The tight cropping creates a very intimate feeling. Focus and lighting arte also good. Only distracting thing is the glare on the glass between you and the gorilla.-stephan', '2002-08-17 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103926, 4402, 2997, '<td valign="top">First of all, very nice picture.  I like it.  I like the expression.  I like the hand.  It is a very well-taken and well composed picture.  Congrats.<br/>However, the project was to take a picture of something new.  There is nothing new in the picture.  You have a clever title, but that was not part of the challenge.</td>', 'First of all, very nice picture.  I like it.  I like the expression.  I like the hand.  It is a very well-taken and well composed picture.  Congrats.However, the project was to take a picture of something new.  There is nothing new in the picture.  You have a clever title, but that was not part of the challenge.', '2002-08-18 03:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103927, 4403, 2361, '<td valign="top">I guess the consumerism aspect pushes the "new" theme.  Not that clear, though.</td>', 'I guess the consumerism aspect pushes the "new" theme.  Not that clear, though.', '2002-08-12 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103928, 4403, 92, '<td valign="top">Seems he has his eye on something new.  The clarity and color are perfect. I like how you thought this out and met the challenge in a unique way = 9</td>', 'Seems he has his eye on something new.  The clarity and color are perfect. I like how you thought this out and met the challenge in a unique way = 9', '2002-08-12 02:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
