(103931, 4403, 2256, '<td valign="top">I can relate to this kid! ha</td>', 'I can relate to this kid! ha', '2002-08-12 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103932, 4403, 811, '<td valign="top">Great focus, great colors.  Hmmm, best buy.  There''s something (actually a lot of somethings) in there that I really really want!  Great composition! karmat</td>', 'Great focus, great colors.  Hmmm, best buy.  There''s something (actually a lot of somethings) in there that I really really want!  Great composition! karmat', '2002-08-12 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103933, 4403, 2353, '<td valign="top">Great pic!  Very original and creative idea and also well shot!  I''m sure it was hard to get the angle just right so that the camera wasn''t also reflected in the glasses.  The sly grin makes the pic!</td>', 'Great pic!  Very original and creative idea and also well shot!  I''m sure it was hard to get the angle just right so that the camera wasn''t also reflected in the glasses.  The sly grin makes the pic!', '2002-08-12 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103934, 4403, 1360, '<td valign="top">Great shot...  The "YUB TSEB" is somewhat destracting to me though...<br/>I wonder how it''d look "reversed"...<br/>Granted, it''d be really fake, but i think it might look better.  I''m sure you''d get dinged either way though :)</td>', 'Great shot...  The "YUB TSEB" is somewhat destracting to me though...I wonder how it''d look "reversed"...Granted, it''d be really fake, but i think it might look better.  I''m sure you''d get dinged either way though :)', '2002-08-12 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103935, 4403, 933, '<td valign="top">I like this chot.  nice color &amp; contrast, composition is ok.  but it doesn''t scream ''new'' to me.  6 md</td>', 'I like this chot.  nice color & contrast, composition is ok.  but it doesn''t scream ''new'' to me.  6 md', '2002-08-12 17:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103936, 4403, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this most of all for the originality. It''s great to see so much blue at the top, which I might not normally like, but in this case it really makes me think about him making use of his new gear and looking right up to the sun. I like that his mouth is only just in shot. <br/>8, Kavey<br/><br/>PS Just noticed the Best Buys reflection in his sunglasses, can''t believe I missed that after looking at this photo about 10 times already. That''s superb positioning and adds an extra 1.<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'I like this most of all for the originality. It''s great to see so much blue at the top, which I might not normally like, but in this case it really makes me think about him making use of his new gear and looking right up to the sun. I like that his mouth is only just in shot. 8, KaveyPS Just noticed the Best Buys reflection in his sunglasses, can''t believe I missed that after looking at this photo about 10 times already. That''s superb positioning and adds an extra 1.9, Kavey', '2002-08-12 18:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103937, 4403, 656, '<td valign="top">clever.  Maybe could have been cropped tighter, to just have the eyes/ hair/ sky ?</td>', 'clever.  Maybe could have been cropped tighter, to just have the eyes/ hair/ sky ?', '2002-08-12 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103938, 4403, 1042, '<td valign="top">For 10 bucks spent...you get a 10. :) I think this is a great idea and well..it''s just excellent, what else could anyone say? kdjohnson</td>', 'For 10 bucks spent...you get a 10. :) I think this is a great idea and well..it''s just excellent, what else could anyone say? kdjohnson', '2002-08-12 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103939, 4403, 1280, '<td valign="top">If one were to look only at the thumbnail, the meaning of this would be lost.  Once I opened the image though, I didn''t have to look too deeply to see what''s putting a smile on this kid''s face.....NEW STUFF!  Kewl! Exposure is excellent,  very good crop and I like the upward angle.  One other thing is that I haven''t seen too many images on here with blue sky.  Nice to see.  Good job!</td>', 'If one were to look only at the thumbnail, the meaning of this would be lost.  Once I opened the image though, I didn''t have to look too deeply to see what''s putting a smile on this kid''s face.....NEW STUFF!  Kewl! Exposure is excellent,  very good crop and I like the upward angle.  One other thing is that I haven''t seen too many images on here with blue sky.  Nice to see.  Good job!', '2002-08-13 01:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103940, 4403, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is such a clever photo.  Cropping and DOF are both perfect.  BAMartin</td>', 'This is such a clever photo.  Cropping and DOF are both perfect.  BAMartin', '2002-08-13 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103941, 4403, 1877, '<td valign="top">Although this is a wonderful shot, with very vibrant colors... I fail to see the "new" part of this photo. New sunglasses? New store? Sorry, 6 for trying!</td>', 'Although this is a wonderful shot, with very vibrant colors... I fail to see the "new" part of this photo. New sunglasses? New store? Sorry, 6 for trying!', '2002-08-13 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
