(103967, 4404, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo... I like the lighting and overall appearance.  The title says it''s new, but the image itself doesn''t really do a great job of relaying the ''new'' theme :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a nice photo... I like the lighting and overall appearance.  The title says it''s new, but the image itself doesn''t really do a great job of relaying the ''new'' theme :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-14 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103968, 4404, 2829, '<td valign="top">hmmm...It''s a nice photo...I''d probably score it high if it was a clock challenge...but this clock doesn''t scream "Something new" after looking at it for a good 5 minutes I still don''t get the "wow" factor.</td>', 'hmmm...It''s a nice photo...I''d probably score it high if it was a clock challenge...but this clock doesn''t scream "Something new" after looking at it for a good 5 minutes I still don''t get the "wow" factor.', '2002-08-14 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103969, 4404, 1003, '<td valign="top">cool clock....</td>', 'cool clock....', '2002-08-14 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103970, 4404, 3247, '<td valign="top">You are reaching</td>', 'You are reaching', '2002-08-15 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103971, 4404, 3198, '<td valign="top">5 past seven? Doc''s? I don''t understand this image. If i wuold buy new socks and take a picture of them I would call iit ''New socks''</td>', '5 past seven? Doc''s? I don''t understand this image. If i wuold buy new socks and take a picture of them I would call iit ''New socks''', '2002-08-16 05:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103972, 4404, 2204, '<td valign="top">I''m having a l;ove/hate relationship with this photograph.  Ordinarily I wouldn''t like the white reflection around the edges and the centering of the clock in the rectangle seems a bit boring.  It''s a great photo of a neon clock and unless I''m mistaken it''s difficult to photograph neon and get everything else in focus at the same time.  =9 syamjonimi   You did an incredible job for me to vote this high on something I really don''t like that much.   Keep up the good work.</td>', 'I''m having a l;ove/hate relationship with this photograph.  Ordinarily I wouldn''t like the white reflection around the edges and the centering of the clock in the rectangle seems a bit boring.  It''s a great photo of a neon clock and unless I''m mistaken it''s difficult to photograph neon and get everything else in focus at the same time.  =9 syamjonimi   You did an incredible job for me to vote this high on something I really don''t like that much.   Keep up the good work.', '2002-08-17 00:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103973, 4404, 1280, '<td valign="top">Bright colors...clear shot.  Every minute is new...every second is in fact new.  You captured that.</td>', 'Bright colors...clear shot.  Every minute is new...every second is in fact new.  You captured that.', '2002-08-18 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103974, 4404, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like your new clock.  The lighting on it is really cool and you were able to capture it nicely.  Looks like an ad for the company. I think it would have a higher visual impact if it were either centered exactly (movied to the right a slight bit) or if it were all the way to one side or the other.  Over all very nice photo.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I like your new clock.  The lighting on it is really cool and you were able to capture it nicely.  Looks like an ad for the company. I think it would have a higher visual impact if it were either centered exactly (movied to the right a slight bit) or if it were all the way to one side or the other.  Over all very nice photo.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-18 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103975, 4404, 1330, '<td valign="top">No one knew, plasma clock. Couldn''t lighten the yellow without having the blue wash out.</td>', 'No one knew, plasma clock. Couldn''t lighten the yellow without having the blue wash out.', '2002-08-19 02:37:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(103976, 4405, 1330, '<td valign="top">Just a little bright for me.</td>', 'Just a little bright for me.', '2002-08-12 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103977, 4405, 117, '<td valign="top">i had to send one of those back once</td>', 'i had to send one of those back once', '2002-08-12 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103978, 4405, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition4<br/>Technical Aspects4<br/>Appeal5<br/>Creativity5<br/>Rating5Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition4Technical Aspects4Appeal5Creativity5Rating5Autool', '2002-08-12 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103979, 4405, 2295, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a bit over processed.</td>', 'Seems to be a bit over processed.', '2002-08-13 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103980, 4405, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice attempt at a ''product'' type photo... I do like the concept of the brightness and I can see where you were going with it.  I would have preferred a little lower angle to give the box some added dimension, rather than being a flat, face on view....  The post processing here has taken a toll on the image as well.  Whatever you have done to it has made a lot of visible jagged edges... possibly the sharpen filter... it has this effect when over used... :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a nice attempt at a ''product'' type photo... I do like the concept of the brightness and I can see where you were going with it.  I would have preferred a little lower angle to give the box some added dimension, rather than being a flat, face on view....  The post processing here has taken a toll on the image as well.  Whatever you have done to it has made a lot of visible jagged edges... possibly the sharpen filter... it has this effect when over used... :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-13 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103981, 4405, 3127, '<td valign="top">Too bright and not particularly original</td>', 'Too bright and not particularly original', '2002-08-13 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103982, 4405, 280, '<td valign="top">I dont like the washed out area at the top  of the box   tomlewis</td>', 'I dont like the washed out area at the top  of the box   tomlewis', '2002-08-13 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103983, 4405, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - good<br/>Technical Aspects - fair. Too bright, esp at top<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  fair<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - goodTechnical Aspects - fair. Too bright, esp at topMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  fairJim msp', '2002-08-13 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103984, 4405, 3185, '<td valign="top">I have been down that road before!  I liked the idea, but the top of the box seems to blend in the the white background.</td>', 'I have been down that road before!  I liked the idea, but the top of the box seems to blend in the the white background.', '2002-08-14 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103985, 4405, 1826, '<td valign="top">New hard drive! Everyone''s nightmare! Very clever.</td>', 'New hard drive! Everyone''s nightmare! Very clever.', '2002-08-14 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103986, 4405, 1005, '<td valign="top">If you have a really low end camera, please ignore the rest of my comments and you have my sympathies......  Very grainy image with no appearant "reason" for it.  A lack of details in the smaller writing on the packaging emphasizes this.  The white of the box disappears into your background, I would politely suggest using a different background.  5 Swash</td>', 'If you have a really low end camera, please ignore the rest of my comments and you have my sympathies......  Very grainy image with no appearant "reason" for it.  A lack of details in the smaller writing on the packaging emphasizes this.  The white of the box disappears into your background, I would politely suggest using a different background.  5 Swash', '2002-08-14 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103987, 4405, 2932, '<td valign="top">I get it, it''s a new harddrive to fix your computer problems.  Good luck, hope you didn''t lose any photos.  How about a new CD burner in that picture too?</td>', 'I get it, it''s a new harddrive to fix your computer problems.  Good luck, hope you didn''t lose any photos.  How about a new CD burner in that picture too?', '2002-08-15 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103988, 4405, 2829, '<td valign="top">Ummm...Ok, the box is new but seriously...This photo is below average. I don''t think you put enough effort into this submission.</td>', 'Ummm...Ok, the box is new but seriously...This photo is below average. I don''t think you put enough effort into this submission.', '2002-08-15 13:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103989, 4405, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good color.  I may have been tempted to take the photo *directly* overhead so as to eliminate the bottom of the box.</td>', 'Good color.  I may have been tempted to take the photo *directly* overhead so as to eliminate the bottom of the box.', '2002-08-15 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103990, 4405, 3050, '<td valign="top">I feel your pain.  Just lost two Hard Drives on my server.  Had to start from scratch.  What good is redundency when failure is too?  Nice shot.  Perhaps could have been better beside the chassis of the machine as you make the switch, but I tend to like more dynamic photos from a subjective perspective.</td>', 'I feel your pain.  Just lost two Hard Drives on my server.  Had to start from scratch.  What good is redundency when failure is too?  Nice shot.  Perhaps could have been better beside the chassis of the machine as you make the switch, but I tend to like more dynamic photos from a subjective perspective.', '2002-08-15 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103991, 4405, 3198, '<td valign="top">is this box scanned on a flatbed scanner? why is the image this harsh?</td>', 'is this box scanned on a flatbed scanner? why is the image this harsh?', '2002-08-16 06:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103992, 4405, 1891, '<td valign="top">Come on man.</td>', 'Come on man.', '2002-08-16 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(103993, 4405, 3080, '<td valign="top">I can see the newness.  It''s definately new.  Did you chose that lighting on purpose?  Looks over brightened and looks like the color has been altered dramatically.  However, I don''t know what the original box looks like, so I guess it''s not fair of me to just assume that.  Maybe a better background might make this a bit more exciting.  You kind of lose the top of the box into the background.    The clarity is good, I like how you can read all the words.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I can see the newness.  It''s definately new.  Did you chose that lighting on purpose?  Looks over brightened and looks like the color has been altered dramatically.  However, I don''t know what the original box looks like, so I guess it''s not fair of me to just assume that.  Maybe a better background might make this a bit more exciting.  You kind of lose the top of the box into the background.    The clarity is good, I like how you can read all the words.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-18 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103994, 4406, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea! Nice composition.</td>', 'Very creative idea! Nice composition.', '2002-08-12 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103995, 4406, 2204, '<td valign="top">Very very good =9 syamjonimi</td>', 'Very very good =9 syamjonimi', '2002-08-12 03:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103996, 4406, 2586, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool idea, a great title, and a pleasant image. Like the DOF but would have cropped out some of the top, a little boring as is but I know, I know required submission dimensions!</td>', 'That''s a cool idea, a great title, and a pleasant image. Like the DOF but would have cropped out some of the top, a little boring as is but I know, I know required submission dimensions!', '2002-08-12 04:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103997, 4406, 2781, '<td valign="top">That is cool!</td>', 'That is cool!', '2002-08-12 04:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(103998, 4406, 2857, '<td valign="top">very little shop of horrors. cool shot!</td>', 'very little shop of horrors. cool shot!', '2002-08-12 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
