(104000, 4406, 724, '<td valign="top">I didn''t see this one last night and was wondering what happened to you.  Totally fantastic top 3 for sure, go for the blue this time!  JJ</td>', 'I didn''t see this one last night and was wondering what happened to you.  Totally fantastic top 3 for sure, go for the blue this time!  JJ', '2002-08-12 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
