(104013, 4406, 280, '<td valign="top">Good shot!<br/>tomlewis1980</td>', 'Good shot!tomlewis1980', '2002-08-13 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104014, 4406, 2295, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  Subject is good and well presented.  Focus and lighting are both good.  My only issue is that the background seems a bit busy.  I don''t think that there''s much you could do about it though.  7</td>', 'Good photo.  Subject is good and well presented.  Focus and lighting are both good.  My only issue is that the background seems a bit busy.  I don''t think that there''s much you could do about it though.  7', '2002-08-13 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104015, 4406, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - very good<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  quite good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - very goodMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  quite goodJim msp', '2002-08-13 19:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104016, 4406, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a really great shot.  It looks like it''s walking around on its roots.  Well lit, sharp with great DOF... (8)</td>', 'This is a really great shot.  It looks like it''s walking around on its roots.  Well lit, sharp with great DOF... (8)', '2002-08-13 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104017, 4406, 3080, '<td valign="top">I really like this due to the fact that I can''t figure out if it was staged to look that way, or if for some freak of nature, it ended up growing that way, and how did you find it if it naturally grew that way.  Very clever and a great depiction of something new.  Excelent job!  Congrats and good luck.</td>', 'I really like this due to the fact that I can''t figure out if it was staged to look that way, or if for some freak of nature, it ended up growing that way, and how did you find it if it naturally grew that way.  Very clever and a great depiction of something new.  Excelent job!  Congrats and good luck.', '2002-08-13 23:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104018, 4406, 3147, '<td valign="top">i really like this one!  great idea and great job capturing the moment!</td>', 'i really like this one!  great idea and great job capturing the moment!', '2002-08-13 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104019, 4406, 1826, '<td valign="top">Great job-  Also could have named it, "Ahead of it''s time". :) Unique idea!</td>', 'Great job-  Also could have named it, "Ahead of it''s time". :) Unique idea!', '2002-08-14 07:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104020, 4406, 436, '<td valign="top">great texture, wonderfu idea.  well shot.  I''d be interested in seeing the saturation brought up. crisa58 7</td>', 'great texture, wonderfu idea.  well shot.  I''d be interested in seeing the saturation brought up. crisa58 7', '2002-08-14 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104021, 4406, 3185, '<td valign="top">I thought this was pretty cool.</td>', 'I thought this was pretty cool.', '2002-08-14 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104022, 4406, 3266, '<td valign="top">I love this....emerging life.</td>', 'I love this....emerging life.', '2002-08-14 23:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104023, 4406, 2798, '<td valign="top">Triffid! Great subject and background. Works well.</td>', 'Triffid! Great subject and background. Works well.', '2002-08-15 07:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104024, 4406, 616, '<td valign="top">Great Idea. Very nice composition. I like the background, its not busy, so it grabs your eyes to the focal point of the photo.</td>', 'Great Idea. Very nice composition. I like the background, its not busy, so it grabs your eyes to the focal point of the photo.', '2002-08-15 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104025, 4406, 2881, '<td valign="top">Great minds think alike? This was the very picture I had in mind to do, but I was away traveling all week and simply didn''t have time. Only I wanted to use the more distinctly "Anasazi" beans.  Traditional pintos were my second choice. The detail and texture of individual beans is great. no distracting shadows, and even the background is pretty clear. I might have cropped a bit differently to get the sprout a little lower, but I don''t know what you had to work with in the original. I don''t claim to be an expert, but I like this lots and don''t think I could have done better, probably not even as well.  This would be a good advertisement for a seed company.</td>', 'Great minds think alike? This was the very picture I had in mind to do, but I was away traveling all week and simply didn''t have time. Only I wanted to use the more distinctly "Anasazi" beans.  Traditional pintos were my second choice. The detail and texture of individual beans is great. no distracting shadows, and even the background is pretty clear. I might have cropped a bit differently to get the sprout a little lower, but I don''t know what you had to work with in the original. I don''t claim to be an expert, but I like this lots and don''t think I could have done better, probably not even as well.  This would be a good advertisement for a seed company.', '2002-08-15 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104026, 4406, 806, '<td valign="top">Cool!   -  and emotive!</td>', 'Cool!   -  and emotive!', '2002-08-15 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104027, 4406, 640, '<td valign="top">Unique and interesting</td>', 'Unique and interesting', '2002-08-15 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104028, 4406, 641, '<td valign="top">very original... nicely done also</td>', 'very original... nicely done also', '2002-08-15 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104029, 4406, 2123, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ll get comments like "the beans are too shiny" ;-) but I really like this shot.  I start at the top of the sprout and my eye travels down the roots.  I like the contrast of the green and brown too.  8</td>', 'I''m sure you''ll get comments like "the beans are too shiny" ;-) but I really like this shot.  I start at the top of the sprout and my eye travels down the roots.  I like the contrast of the green and brown too.  8', '2002-08-15 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104030, 4406, 3280, '<td valign="top">I really like the creativity of this photo.</td>', 'I really like the creativity of this photo.', '2002-08-15 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104031, 4406, 554, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea and so well executed too.  How many days did it take to sprout? This looks more like about 9 days to me but, whatdahiknow. top 4  I really like it.</td>', 'Fantastic idea and so well executed too.  How many days did it take to sprout? This looks more like about 9 days to me but, whatdahiknow. top 4  I really like it.', '2002-08-16 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104032, 4406, 2937, '<td valign="top">Hey, that a very nice picture. I tried somehow something similar. Yours is better. Congrats.</td>', 'Hey, that a very nice picture. I tried somehow something similar. Yours is better. Congrats.', '2002-08-16 04:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104033, 4406, 1280, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge:definetely<br/>Technical aspects: ok<br/>Artistic Merit:fair<br/>Suggestions:<br/><br/>Love the idea...actually had considered something very similar. A little detail is lost here though, on the sprouted bean.</td>', 'Meets challenge:definetelyTechnical aspects: okArtistic Merit:fairSuggestions:Love the idea...actually had considered something very similar. A little detail is lost here though, on the sprouted bean.', '2002-08-16 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104034, 4406, 1891, '<td valign="top">A powerful image altogether.</td>', 'A powerful image altogether.', '2002-08-16 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104035, 4406, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is just plain great.  How did you do this?  The sprout is very interesting and the beans really set it apart, nice touch.  9 Swash</td>', 'This is just plain great.  How did you do this?  The sprout is very interesting and the beans really set it apart, nice touch.  9 Swash', '2002-08-16 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
