(104093, 4408, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love this. If I were being picky I''d suggest that the furthest bottle seems to be positioned a little too low and leads to that patch of blue/ grey at the top left... nicer if it was all red glass throughout. <br/>But I do think this is very classy (and is the FIRST photo out of the WHOLE lot that I am scoring and commenting). I do like this very much.<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'I love this. If I were being picky I''d suggest that the furthest bottle seems to be positioned a little too low and leads to that patch of blue/ grey at the top left... nicer if it was all red glass throughout. But I do think this is very classy (and is the FIRST photo out of the WHOLE lot that I am scoring and commenting). I do like this very much.9, Kavey', '2002-08-12 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
