(104099, 4408, 1792, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  Color is good.  I might have had just enough of the front label readable so that the viewer would know it was the latest vintage without the title.<br/><br/>Nice effort.</td>', 'I like the idea.  Color is good.  I might have had just enough of the front label readable so that the viewer would know it was the latest vintage without the title.Nice effort.', '2002-08-14 01:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104100, 4408, 1175, '<td valign="top">Its great as an abstract. In some ways I wish I could see more of the label and in other ways I wish there wasn''t a label.</td>', 'Its great as an abstract. In some ways I wish I could see more of the label and in other ways I wish there wasn''t a label.', '2002-08-14 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104101, 4408, 3273, '<td valign="top">Excellent color, it makes me want to dive in and grab a bottle!</td>', 'Excellent color, it makes me want to dive in and grab a bottle!', '2002-08-14 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104102, 4408, 1005, '<td valign="top">You must have been going for a narrow depth of field, after all, we can see the first one really good.  Even though you would have gotten "beat up" for it, I think having the 2nd or 3rd bottle being the ONE in focus might have been more dramatic, but probably not worth the risk.  If I am all wrong about this DOF issue, subtract 2 points from your new score.  Started as a 7, upping to an 8 after better evaluation, should drop to 6, if DOF guess wrong.  8 Swash<br/>(Confused, almost got myself there....)</td>', 'You must have been going for a narrow depth of field, after all, we can see the first one really good.  Even though you would have gotten "beat up" for it, I think having the 2nd or 3rd bottle being the ONE in focus might have been more dramatic, but probably not worth the risk.  If I am all wrong about this DOF issue, subtract 2 points from your new score.  Started as a 7, upping to an 8 after better evaluation, should drop to 6, if DOF guess wrong.  8 Swash(Confused, almost got myself there....)', '2002-08-14 20:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104103, 4408, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful composition... the depth of field works perfectly in this shot.  The half visible label on the bottle offers a nice bit of intrigue that is making me wonder what the rest of it says... great shot :) = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a beautiful composition... the depth of field works perfectly in this shot.  The half visible label on the bottle offers a nice bit of intrigue that is making me wonder what the rest of it says... great shot :) = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-14 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104104, 4408, 2370, '<td valign="top">nice colours, but i would have like to see the 2002 label in full...</td>', 'nice colours, but i would have like to see the 2002 label in full...', '2002-08-15 07:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104105, 4408, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots I''m a sucker for I love the clever use of DOF to capture a really good shot, and this picture does just that.  The sharp foreground provides a great central focal point that contrasts against the out of focus background Great</td>', 'This is one of those shots I''m a sucker for I love the clever use of DOF to capture a really good shot, and this picture does just that.  The sharp foreground provides a great central focal point that contrasts against the out of focus background Great', '2002-08-15 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104106, 4408, 2829, '<td valign="top">I love it...Beautiful colors, excellent depth of field on the photo...Meets the challenge with and without the title. Nicely done.</td>', 'I love it...Beautiful colors, excellent depth of field on the photo...Meets the challenge with and without the title. Nicely done.', '2002-08-15 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104107, 4408, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice use of depth of field, did you read magnetic''s guide? = )    - 7</td>', 'Nice use of depth of field, did you read magnetic''s guide? = )    - 7', '2002-08-17 18:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104108, 4408, 3080, '<td valign="top">Are these pop bottles?  I''ve never seen them before.  They are pretty.  I like the shade of red.  the shot is nice.  I like how you have the first one in focus and the rest in the background.  Since I have never seen these before, I can only take your word for it that they are something new.   These would have looked good in the "red" challenge too.  Nice shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Are these pop bottles?  I''ve never seen them before.  They are pretty.  I like the shade of red.  the shot is nice.  I like how you have the first one in focus and the rest in the background.  Since I have never seen these before, I can only take your word for it that they are something new.   These would have looked good in the "red" challenge too.  Nice shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-17 21:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104109, 4408, 2983, '<td valign="top">Very well executed shot, though wine is not something you usually associate with new.</td>', 'Very well executed shot, though wine is not something you usually associate with new.', '2002-08-18 03:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104110, 4408, 326, '<td valign="top">Love the color and DOF...Great job.</td>', 'Love the color and DOF...Great job.', '2002-08-18 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104111, 4408, 3112, '<td valign="top">Ooooh!  I like.  Excellent composition overall, and in particular, use of DOF.<br/>Only detracting comment is the slightly-empty upper left corner, which affects the consistency of the field.</td>', 'Ooooh!  I like.  Excellent composition overall, and in particular, use of DOF.Only detracting comment is the slightly-empty upper left corner, which affects the consistency of the field.', '2002-08-18 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
