(104115, 4409, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition6<br/>Technical Aspects5<br/>Appeal7<br/>Creativity7<br/>Rating6Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition6Technical Aspects5Appeal7Creativity7Rating6Autool', '2002-08-12 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104116, 4409, 2422, '<td valign="top">Nice subject for the theme, well framed and good exposure.</td>', 'Nice subject for the theme, well framed and good exposure.', '2002-08-13 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104117, 4409, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great idea  I haven''t seen a Euro yet It meets the challenge.  In my opinion, I think the colours of the background and subject are too close creating a cast.  This may be due to white balance, but whatever it is, it doesn''t seem right</td>', 'Great idea  I haven''t seen a Euro yet It meets the challenge.  In my opinion, I think the colours of the background and subject are too close creating a cast.  This may be due to white balance, but whatever it is, it doesn''t seem right', '2002-08-13 06:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104118, 4409, 671, '<td valign="top">nice colors, composition</td>', 'nice colors, composition', '2002-08-13 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104119, 4409, 1792, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I would like to see the wording stand out just a wee bit more.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I would like to see the wording stand out just a wee bit more.', '2002-08-14 01:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104120, 4409, 714, '<td valign="top">The framing is great, but the lighting is really bright on the left.  5</td>', 'The framing is great, but the lighting is really bright on the left.  5', '2002-08-14 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104121, 4409, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting coins, kinda reminds me of some french coins I have (the two tone color coins).  Speaking of color (or is that colour?), are the coins really this dark bronzy color?  I was expecting lighter outside rings, with darker inside rings (than what I see here).  Very sharp w/ WIDE DOF, very, very nice.  I am going to bump your score up one from 7 to 8 (for a euro, I''ll go one more!)  Swash</td>', 'Interesting coins, kinda reminds me of some french coins I have (the two tone color coins).  Speaking of color (or is that colour?), are the coins really this dark bronzy color?  I was expecting lighter outside rings, with darker inside rings (than what I see here).  Very sharp w/ WIDE DOF, very, very nice.  I am going to bump your score up one from 7 to 8 (for a euro, I''ll go one more!)  Swash', '2002-08-14 20:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104122, 4409, 2587, '<td valign="top">Nice layout and subject. The only thing I would''ve done different is pick a less distracting background. The way you have your lighting set up it gives the background a lot of contrast and distracts the eye from the subject. I''m wondering if the coins are sitting on a rice crispy ... (I think I''m just hungry) ... sorry ... lol</td>', 'Nice layout and subject. The only thing I would''ve done different is pick a less distracting background. The way you have your lighting set up it gives the background a lot of contrast and distracts the eye from the subject. I''m wondering if the coins are sitting on a rice crispy ... (I think I''m just hungry) ... sorry ... lol', '2002-08-15 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104123, 4409, 3044, '<td valign="top">looks overexposed to me a bit. cool idea and nice set up.</td>', 'looks overexposed to me a bit. cool idea and nice set up.', '2002-08-15 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104124, 4409, 3198, '<td valign="top">there are more interesting ways to take pictures of money, but the idea is sound.</td>', 'there are more interesting ways to take pictures of money, but the idea is sound.', '2002-08-16 05:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104125, 4409, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good macro. Photo is overdriven, on the whole.</td>', 'Good macro. Photo is overdriven, on the whole.', '2002-08-17 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104126, 4409, 2204, '<td valign="top">I like thgolden cast of the entire picture.  I am not too impressed with the lighting..The shadows seem too dark and the flare areas too bright.  overall it is noci work though. =5 syamjonimi</td>', 'I like thgolden cast of the entire picture.  I am not too impressed with the lighting..The shadows seem too dark and the flare areas too bright.  overall it is noci work though. =5 syamjonimi', '2002-08-18 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104127, 4409, 3080, '<td valign="top">These coins we either sitting on a piece of cork board, or a hamburger.  It''s definately got some interesting texture.  I like how the coins are set up like that.  The angle is nice, however there seems to be a distracting bright spot towards the bottom left.  I have heard of a trick to lessen bright spots and make the lighting more balenced out.  Try putting a thin piece of cloth or thin paper between the subject and the light source.  Still lets the light through but not as harshly.  You can also use different colors of cloth or paper to create some really neat color effects.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'These coins we either sitting on a piece of cork board, or a hamburger.  It''s definately got some interesting texture.  I like how the coins are set up like that.  The angle is nice, however there seems to be a distracting bright spot towards the bottom left.  I have heard of a trick to lessen bright spots and make the lighting more balenced out.  Try putting a thin piece of cloth or thin paper between the subject and the light source.  Still lets the light through but not as harshly.  You can also use different colors of cloth or paper to create some really neat color effects.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-18 02:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104128, 4409, 2829, '<td valign="top">A bit harsh on the lighting...</td>', 'A bit harsh on the lighting...', '2002-08-19 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104129, 4410, 3127, '<td valign="top">Makes me thirsty!</td>', 'Makes me thirsty!', '2002-08-12 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104130, 4410, 2256, '<td valign="top">REALLY nice shot!</td>', 'REALLY nice shot!', '2002-08-12 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104131, 4410, 1779, '<td valign="top">nice, but did u shot it this week? : p</td>', 'nice, but did u shot it this week? : p', '2002-08-12 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104132, 4410, 715, '<td valign="top">Hey wait a minute, aug 07, that''s my birthday!  I''m older than 110 days by now tough :-)</td>', 'Hey wait a minute, aug 07, that''s my birthday!  I''m older than 110 days by now tough :-)', '2002-08-12 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104133, 4410, 3102, '<td valign="top">Clever...</td>', 'Clever...', '2002-08-12 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104134, 4410, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition5<br/>Technical Aspects6<br/>Appeal6<br/>Creativity5<br/>Rating6Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition5Technical Aspects6Appeal6Creativity5Rating6Autool', '2002-08-12 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104135, 4410, 2353, '<td valign="top">Good pic!  The cleverness of the subject is great.  I also like how you captured the water droplets on the bottle.  Good lighting also.  Composition is good.  I like that it is off centered...it makes the picture interesting.  Good job! - 9 :-)</td>', 'Good pic!  The cleverness of the subject is great.  I also like how you captured the water droplets on the bottle.  Good lighting also.  Composition is good.  I like that it is off centered...it makes the picture interesting.  Good job! - 9 :-)', '2002-08-13 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104136, 4410, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - pretty good<br/>Technical Aspects - pretty good. <br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  pretty good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - pretty goodTechnical Aspects - pretty good. Meets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  pretty goodJim msp', '2002-08-14 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104137, 4410, 1175, '<td valign="top">crappy beer</td>', 'crappy beer', '2002-08-14 09:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104138, 4410, 1826, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you''ve done the backround here. Realy focuses your eye on the subject. :)</td>', 'I really like the way you''ve done the backround here. Realy focuses your eye on the subject. :)', '2002-08-14 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104139, 4410, 2932, '<td valign="top">just a little too much white area on the right, and the lighting is a little glaring on the barcode, otherwise this has the makings of a beautiful shot</td>', 'just a little too much white area on the right, and the lighting is a little glaring on the barcode, otherwise this has the makings of a beautiful shot', '2002-08-14 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104140, 4410, 327, '<td valign="top">Good composition, just over exposed. Score-6 Kee</td>', 'Good composition, just over exposed. Score-6 Kee', '2002-08-15 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104141, 4410, 1005, '<td valign="top">Heck, this beer had to be at least four days old!  Love ya man!  I like the sweat droplets and the blown out counter, but that seems like a lot of white space, imo.  7 Swash</td>', 'Heck, this beer had to be at least four days old!  Love ya man!  I like the sweat droplets and the blown out counter, but that seems like a lot of white space, imo.  7 Swash', '2002-08-15 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104142, 4410, 2700, '<td valign="top">perhaps a "tad" too much contrast... who cares , looks dam good 9</td>', 'perhaps a "tad" too much contrast... who cares , looks dam good 9', '2002-08-16 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104143, 4410, 2815, '<td valign="top">that is a new brew</td>', 'that is a new brew', '2002-08-17 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104144, 4410, 2586, '<td valign="top">Like this composition with a lot of white negative space.It compensates for the bright colors on the can.  It makes for a pleasing, quiet effect overall. My only nitpick is that you didn''t straighten the image; the little black triangle in the corner is a little distracting.</td>', 'Like this composition with a lot of white negative space.It compensates for the bright colors on the can.  It makes for a pleasing, quiet effect overall. My only nitpick is that you didn''t straighten the image; the little black triangle in the corner is a little distracting.', '2002-08-17 22:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104145, 4410, 2798, '<td valign="top">Damn - now I''m thirsty. This would make a great product shot. Excellent white background and great focus. I''d love to know how you did the background.</td>', 'Damn - now I''m thirsty. This would make a great product shot. Excellent white background and great focus. I''d love to know how you did the background.', '2002-08-18 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104146, 4410, 3080, '<td valign="top">LOL.  born on dating.  Great idea.  I definately see the something new here.  I like the lighting and I like how it''s not centered, but to the left of the photo.  I think that it would have a higher visual impact if the edge of the label went right along the edge of the photo.  Maybe straighten it up a bit.  Other than that small detail, you have an excelent photo here.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'LOL.  born on dating.  Great idea.  I definately see the something new here.  I like the lighting and I like how it''s not centered, but to the left of the photo.  I think that it would have a higher visual impact if the edge of the label went right along the edge of the photo.  Maybe straighten it up a bit.  Other than that small detail, you have an excelent photo here.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-18 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104147, 4411, 2223, '<td valign="top">i like this...something bothers me about the shadows...but thats it.</td>', 'i like this...something bothers me about the shadows...but thats it.', '2002-08-12 01:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104148, 4411, 2607, '<td valign="top">nice focus.  nice contrast with the black and white</td>', 'nice focus.  nice contrast with the black and white', '2002-08-12 02:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104149, 4411, 1255, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - it definitely emphasized "Something New"</td>', 'Nice composition - it definitely emphasized "Something New"', '2002-08-12 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104150, 4411, 3127, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Good photo, but a little too bright.</td>', 'Interesting idea. Good photo, but a little too bright.', '2002-08-12 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104151, 4411, 3002, '<td valign="top">This is definitely different and creative.</td>', 'This is definitely different and creative.', '2002-08-12 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104152, 4411, 1882, '<td valign="top">Now THAT is a great idea for "new" (unlike most of the other photos).  Great job!</td>', 'Now THAT is a great idea for "new" (unlike most of the other photos).  Great job!', '2002-08-12 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104153, 4411, 1779, '<td valign="top">original. that''s cool. it needs more contrast and color.</td>', 'original. that''s cool. it needs more contrast and color.', '2002-08-12 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104154, 4411, 2256, '<td valign="top">striking..........HA! get it?! ha ha</td>', 'striking..........HA! get it?! ha ha', '2002-08-12 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104155, 4411, 3031, '<td valign="top">Like it. Original.</td>', 'Like it. Original.', '2002-08-12 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104156, 4411, 2204, '<td valign="top">Better lighting and less shadow would have helped me score this higher.  Good creative thought though....</td>', 'Better lighting and less shadow would have helped me score this higher.  Good creative thought though....', '2002-08-12 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104157, 4411, 3087, '<td valign="top">I think this idea is fabulous and the colours, crispness and contrast are fantastic. I don''t like the layout of the matches but that''s probably a personal preference. <br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'I think this idea is fabulous and the colours, crispness and contrast are fantastic. I don''t like the layout of the matches but that''s probably a personal preference. 7, Kavey', '2002-08-12 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104158, 4411, 3044, '<td valign="top">nice concept.</td>', 'nice concept.', '2002-08-12 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104159, 4411, 3102, '<td valign="top">Well done!  It''s a great idea and well organized.</td>', 'Well done!  It''s a great idea and well organized.', '2002-08-12 19:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104160, 4411, 1748, '<td valign="top">nice idea</td>', 'nice idea', '2002-08-12 20:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
