(104220, 4413, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool looking structure.  I''d call it a building, but it kind of looks like it has on overpass going over the road to the right.  I could just be looking at it all wrong.  My angle could be off.  Definately depcits something new, and not too bad to look at.  Lighting is good, not too dark, not too bright.  I like trying to figure out exactly what it is.  I hope you tell us when voting is said and done. Nice job and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This is a really cool looking structure.  I''d call it a building, but it kind of looks like it has on overpass going over the road to the right.  I could just be looking at it all wrong.  My angle could be off.  Definately depcits something new, and not too bad to look at.  Lighting is good, not too dark, not too bright.  I like trying to figure out exactly what it is.  I hope you tell us when voting is said and done. Nice job and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-18 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
