(104242, 4414, 2221, '<td valign="top">To me this looks a bit too weird. It looks like the rings are falling down the table. Strange balance.<br/>Other than that I like the red vs. metallic color. DOF is a bit too narrow.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'To me this looks a bit too weird. It looks like the rings are falling down the table. Strange balance.Other than that I like the red vs. metallic color. DOF is a bit too narrow.-stephan', '2002-08-17 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
