(104265, 4415, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That stands out so well from it''s surroundings, it almost appears to jump right out of the photo.  The background is pretty darn ugly, but I think that just adds to the actual subject in this case.  I don''t know what kind of plant it is, but it sure is pretty. Lighting is good and angle is good.  I wish that bright white squarish thing wasn''t in the top left corner, but there was probably nothing you could do about that.  Congrats and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow.  That stands out so well from it''s surroundings, it almost appears to jump right out of the photo.  The background is pretty darn ugly, but I think that just adds to the actual subject in this case.  I don''t know what kind of plant it is, but it sure is pretty. Lighting is good and angle is good.  I wish that bright white squarish thing wasn''t in the top left corner, but there was probably nothing you could do about that.  Congrats and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-18 03:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
