(104289, 4416, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea, "something new" is clear here.  I love the light star.  works well in this photo.  angle is nice.  i think I would have fast forwarded the tape so that we could view the actual tape through the clear plastic window in the video tape.  would have been a more powerfull comparrison that way.  the photo seems a bit grainy.  not sure what caused that, or what to do about it though.  overall nice photo. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very clever idea, "something new" is clear here.  I love the light star.  works well in this photo.  angle is nice.  i think I would have fast forwarded the tape so that we could view the actual tape through the clear plastic window in the video tape.  would have been a more powerfull comparrison that way.  the photo seems a bit grainy.  not sure what caused that, or what to do about it though.  overall nice photo. good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-18 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
