(104317, 4419, 1005, '<td valign="top">While I''m not crazy about the boy''s shoulder and upper half of the ball being washed out, the rest of the image is great!  I esp. like the ball in motion part.  Nice touch.  (were you throwing as well as picture taking?  If so, impressive)  While I had initially scored this as a 9, the glare is really bugging me.  No, let it ride!  Swash</td>', 'While I''m not crazy about the boy''s shoulder and upper half of the ball being washed out, the rest of the image is great!  I esp. like the ball in motion part.  Nice touch.  (were you throwing as well as picture taking?  If so, impressive)  While I had initially scored this as a 9, the glare is really bugging me.  No, let it ride!  Swash', '2002-08-16 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
