(104319, 4419, 1280, '<td valign="top">Great how you captured the ball in mid air and the look of concentration on the little slugger.  Very nice!  Grayce...aka...gracious</td>', 'Great how you captured the ball in mid air and the look of concentration on the little slugger.  Very nice!  Grayce...aka...gracious', '2002-08-18 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
