(104321, 4419, 3080, '<td valign="top">cute idea.  you can see the concentration on his face.  Another way you could present a new glove is to show it banded shut with the ball inside next to a bottle of glove oil.  I like how you did it too, with the little guy breaking it in.  the clarity of the photo is great and the lighting is nice too.  looks like he''s been practicing hard with those rosy cheeks. nice shot and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'cute idea.  you can see the concentration on his face.  Another way you could present a new glove is to show it banded shut with the ball inside next to a bottle of glove oil.  I like how you did it too, with the little guy breaking it in.  the clarity of the photo is great and the lighting is nice too.  looks like he''s been practicing hard with those rosy cheeks. nice shot and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-18 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104322, 4420, 3127, '<td valign="top">Great perspective.</td>', 'Great perspective.', '2002-08-12 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104323, 4420, 3002, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot.  A think it''s a bit too over-sharpened, as evidenced by the distortion on those metal things between each window.  While I think it is a good image, and that the photographer thought out this shot and did a good job, if s/he hadn''t put the date of construction in the title, what about the photographer reveals the ''newness'' of this?   Still, good work.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot.  A think it''s a bit too over-sharpened, as evidenced by the distortion on those metal things between each window.  While I think it is a good image, and that the photographer thought out this shot and did a good job, if s/he hadn''t put the date of construction in the title, what about the photographer reveals the ''newness'' of this?   Still, good work.', '2002-08-12 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104324, 4420, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings :)  This is a lovely architectural photo.  It simply does not relay a sense of ''new'' to me.  I would have to live in this community to know that this is new and understand the ramifications of that.  In my own mind, this image resembles many other train stations that I have seen in the past :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'Greetings :)  This is a lovely architectural photo.  It simply does not relay a sense of ''new'' to me.  I would have to live in this community to know that this is new and understand the ramifications of that.  In my own mind, this image resembles many other train stations that I have seen in the past :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-12 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104325, 4420, 811, '<td valign="top">Cool picture.  I think it would be even more effective if it were perfectly symmetrical.  I would draw the viewer in more, I think. karmat</td>', 'Cool picture.  I think it would be even more effective if it were perfectly symmetrical.  I would draw the viewer in more, I think. karmat', '2002-08-12 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
