(104350, 4421, 2011, '<td valign="top">Man I have been here before.</td>', 'Man I have been here before.', '2002-08-16 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104351, 4421, 3080, '<td valign="top">Too funny.  I think I would have liked a bit more of a closer look at this.  Got a lot of space to the right of the photo where there is nothing happening.  However, if you didn''t want to stand in the middle of the road to take a picture, I completely understand. lol  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Too funny.  I think I would have liked a bit more of a closer look at this.  Got a lot of space to the right of the photo where there is nothing happening.  However, if you didn''t want to stand in the middle of the road to take a picture, I completely understand. lol  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-17 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104352, 4421, 2829, '<td valign="top">Amusing shot, but it does not relate to the challenge aside from the title making the connection. Also, a little fuzzy to me. Probably beneficial to run unsharp mask on it.</td>', 'Amusing shot, but it does not relate to the challenge aside from the title making the connection. Also, a little fuzzy to me. Probably beneficial to run unsharp mask on it.', '2002-08-17 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104353, 4421, 1280, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the morning after Halloween in my neighborhood.  The kids throw toilet paper on the trees, and spray shaving cream on doors along with eggs, etc. Obviously this isn''t the case here though.  Halloween is in October.   Perhaps this was an act of disrespect towards an individual or familly since I see a house in the shadows of the trees.  The night could have been a nightmare for someone and when the day broke they were relieved but challenged to clean it up.  There seems to be a personal message here that is difficult for the casual observer to imagine...though I did give you my idea of what may have happened.  Funny thing is usually my husband has to remind me NOT to read too much into things.  In this case I must, or else I wouldn''t really get it.  You certainly captured the results of vandalism...the "NEW CHALLENGE" in your title?  I''d say the challenge of cleaning up the mess. What I like best about this image is the trees... I love the greens of nature, and there is a nice variety of green here.  In future pictures you may want to consider eliminating the distracting parts of the pictures...the parts that just don''t add to it.  Like the partial view of the car in the lower left...it''s no BIG deal but it doesn''t add anything to the photo. Hope my comments help.  Grayce...aka...gracious</td>', 'This reminds me of the morning after Halloween in my neighborhood.  The kids throw toilet paper on the trees, and spray shaving cream on doors along with eggs, etc. Obviously this isn''t the case here though.  Halloween is in October.   Perhaps this was an act of disrespect towards an individual or familly since I see a house in the shadows of the trees.  The night could have been a nightmare for someone and when the day broke they were relieved but challenged to clean it up.  There seems to be a personal message here that is difficult for the casual observer to imagine...though I did give you my idea of what may have happened.  Funny thing is usually my husband has to remind me NOT to read too much into things.  In this case I must, or else I wouldn''t really get it.  You certainly captured the results of vandalism...the "NEW CHALLENGE" in your title?  I''d say the challenge of cleaning up the mess. What I like best about this image is the trees... I love the greens of nature, and there is a nice variety of green here.  In future pictures you may want to consider eliminating the distracting parts of the pictures...the parts that just don''t add to it.  Like the partial view of the car in the lower left...it''s no BIG deal but it doesn''t add anything to the photo. Hope my comments help.  Grayce...aka...gracious', '2002-08-18 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104354, 4423, 2223, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting pic...theres some glare coming from the scissors, but otherwise its good. Hope you didnt injure yourself during this.</td>', 'this is an interesting pic...theres some glare coming from the scissors, but otherwise its good. Hope you didnt injure yourself during this.', '2002-08-12 01:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104355, 4423, 2907, '<td valign="top">strange ... did you use a photoshop filter?? or just blow out the saturation??</td>', 'strange ... did you use a photoshop filter?? or just blow out the saturation??', '2002-08-12 05:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104356, 4423, 2854, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I like the fact that its basically a black background and then you have this Sharp Shinning tool at the side of the subject''s head. The Expression is wonderfull, and i love the redness. Well done.</td>', 'I really like this. I like the fact that its basically a black background and then you have this Sharp Shinning tool at the side of the subject''s head. The Expression is wonderfull, and i love the redness. Well done.', '2002-08-12 05:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
