(104515, 4432, 772, '<td valign="top">great shot :)  I love the fine detail on this one... the only minor distraction that I catch here is the pole/wire in the background behind the main subject... = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'great shot :)  I love the fine detail on this one... the only minor distraction that I catch here is the pole/wire in the background behind the main subject... = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-17 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
