(104523, 4435, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - pretty good<br/>Technical Aspects - pretty good. <br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  pretty good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - pretty goodTechnical Aspects - pretty good. Meets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  pretty goodJim msp', '2002-08-13 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104524, 4435, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but it hardly relates to the challenge.  The crop on top may be a little too tight -- nothing else was cut off.</td>', 'Nice shot, but it hardly relates to the challenge.  The crop on top may be a little too tight -- nothing else was cut off.', '2002-08-14 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104525, 4435, 1005, '<td valign="top">Suggestion:  make the title possesive as in my newest dragon.  I like the shadow play on the dragon itself, but the details seem slightly blurred, esp. the feet.  The chain also seems to have a lack of definition, as well.  I want to comment/suggest something about the lighting, but I don''t know enough to be intelligent, so I will just suggest, try different lighting for this piece (maybe two lights, straight on each side?)  7 Swash</td>', 'Suggestion:  make the title possesive as in my newest dragon.  I like the shadow play on the dragon itself, but the details seem slightly blurred, esp. the feet.  The chain also seems to have a lack of definition, as well.  I want to comment/suggest something about the lighting, but I don''t know enough to be intelligent, so I will just suggest, try different lighting for this piece (maybe two lights, straight on each side?)  7 Swash', '2002-08-15 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104526, 4435, 3080, '<td valign="top">I have been pondering this photo all week.  I decided that I generally like it.  I like the placement although the chain should be totally in the photo rather than sneak off the top.  That''s no big deal though.  i like the subject, it''s pleasing to look at.  The only major thing I noticed is the lighting.  It is lit in such a way that in some places it looks gold and in some it looks silver.   If it''s gold, then the light shining on it makes it look silver, and if it''s silver, then something is reflecting on it making it look gold.  I don''t know what you could do about this though.  Maybe someone with some better knowledge of lighting can suggest something.  The only thing that comes to mind is to bounce the light, or put something like a thin cloth between the light source and the necklace to kind of make the light a little more mellow.  Great idea, and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I have been pondering this photo all week.  I decided that I generally like it.  I like the placement although the chain should be totally in the photo rather than sneak off the top.  That''s no big deal though.  i like the subject, it''s pleasing to look at.  The only major thing I noticed is the lighting.  It is lit in such a way that in some places it looks gold and in some it looks silver.   If it''s gold, then the light shining on it makes it look silver, and if it''s silver, then something is reflecting on it making it look gold.  I don''t know what you could do about this though.  Maybe someone with some better knowledge of lighting can suggest something.  The only thing that comes to mind is to bounce the light, or put something like a thin cloth between the light source and the necklace to kind of make the light a little more mellow.  Great idea, and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-18 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104527, 4436, 2754, '<td valign="top">Very good choice of background...enhances the sensuality of the picture.</td>', 'Very good choice of background...enhances the sensuality of the picture.', '2002-08-12 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
