(104538, 4436, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not much of a secret anymore is it?  Sorry, it had to be said.  I like the background in relation to the color of the bag and I like the layout of the nighty coming out of the bag.  Really crisp paper could give the over all picture a better feel of newness.  Not really realisticness...but definately newness.  I like the flow of the background in relation to the flow of the nighty as well.  Seems to flow in the same direction.  Don''t know if you did that on purpose or not, but it is visually interesting.  Great job and good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'Not much of a secret anymore is it?  Sorry, it had to be said.  I like the background in relation to the color of the bag and I like the layout of the nighty coming out of the bag.  Really crisp paper could give the over all picture a better feel of newness.  Not really realisticness...but definately newness.  I like the flow of the background in relation to the flow of the nighty as well.  Seems to flow in the same direction.  Don''t know if you did that on purpose or not, but it is visually interesting.  Great job and good luck on the challenge.', '2002-08-15 03:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104539, 4436, 2928, '<td valign="top">Fantastic This is one of those pictures that can tell many different stories  depending on your point of view :)  It is a very sensual image, I really like the colours and the composition is first class.  This is quality across the board  good luck.. (10) Easily</td>', 'Fantastic This is one of those pictures that can tell many different stories  depending on your point of view :)  It is a very sensual image, I really like the colours and the composition is first class.  This is quality across the board  good luck.. (10) Easily', '2002-08-15 06:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104540, 4436, 641, '<td valign="top">Nice color and composition. I think maybe some more different color paper coming out the top of the bag would really jazz it up.</td>', 'Nice color and composition. I think maybe some more different color paper coming out the top of the bag would really jazz it up.', '2002-08-15 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
