(104550, 4437, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the crescent at the bottom and the modern simplicity but there isn''t enough shadow in the etchings to allow easy reading and I would like a more vibrant colour.</td>', 'I like the crescent at the bottom and the modern simplicity but there isn''t enough shadow in the etchings to allow easy reading and I would like a more vibrant colour.', '2002-08-13 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
