(104567, 4438, 3087, '<td valign="top">I am not keen on soft focus and would prefer a sharper picture but like the content and composition. Find it a little too shadowy at the lower right. I like the way he''s looking down, it''s often said a people photo should have eye contact but I think this works well without it. Would like to lose the chair in the background and have it all blue as the wall.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'I am not keen on soft focus and would prefer a sharper picture but like the content and composition. Find it a little too shadowy at the lower right. I like the way he''s looking down, it''s often said a people photo should have eye contact but I think this works well without it. Would like to lose the chair in the background and have it all blue as the wall.5, Kavey', '2002-08-13 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
