(104573, 4438, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful portrait.  I love the lighting and the concentration on the child''s face.  This is either out of focus or it''s deliberate use of soft focus  What do I think? I think it''s a great shot by design and the result intended  (9)</td>', 'This is a wonderful portrait.  I love the lighting and the concentration on the child''s face.  This is either out of focus or it''s deliberate use of soft focus  What do I think? I think it''s a great shot by design and the result intended  (9)', '2002-08-16 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104574, 4438, 2881, '<td valign="top">This is a neat "kid" picture, although without the title, I''d have trouble making it fit the challenge. Maybe I''m just not imaginative enough. On my monitor it looks a bit out of focus, was this intentional, or is it just my perception?</td>', 'This is a neat "kid" picture, although without the title, I''d have trouble making it fit the challenge. Maybe I''m just not imaginative enough. On my monitor it looks a bit out of focus, was this intentional, or is it just my perception?', '2002-08-16 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104575, 4438, 2204, '<td valign="top">I have looked and looked at this and I think I''m just not getting it.  Please let me know your intent when the results are posted. syamjonimi</td>', 'I have looked and looked at this and I think I''m just not getting it.  Please let me know your intent when the results are posted. syamjonimi', '2002-08-17 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
