(104577, 4438, 2011, '<td valign="top">Sweet is the best word I can come up with for this shot. And I mean that in the best way.  I really like this.</td>', 'Sweet is the best word I can come up with for this shot. And I mean that in the best way.  I really like this.', '2002-08-18 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104578, 4438, 3080, '<td valign="top">Hey! I have one of these!  Every day is something new.  If this little guy is anything like mine, then he is never the same boy 2 days in a row.  I like the angle of this, and the lighting is good.  There seems to be a soft focus, but it works with this photo.  Kind of dreamy.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hey! I have one of these!  Every day is something new.  If this little guy is anything like mine, then he is never the same boy 2 days in a row.  I like the angle of this, and the lighting is good.  There seems to be a soft focus, but it works with this photo.  Kind of dreamy.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-18 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104579, 4438, 2829, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the soft focus works on this...</td>', 'I don''t think the soft focus works on this...', '2002-08-19 00:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104580, 4438, 3395, '<td valign="top">I think he is the cutest child I have ever seen. He looks so genuine and happy. It brings a smile to my face just seeing him! Beautiful child and a wonderful picture~</td>', 'I think he is the cutest child I have ever seen. He looks so genuine and happy. It brings a smile to my face just seeing him! Beautiful child and a wonderful picture~', '2002-08-20 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
