(104611, 4440, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a good photograph, but it''s just not inspiring to me.  This photo may have more impact if there was a dark or solid background behind it :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a good photograph, but it''s just not inspiring to me.  This photo may have more impact if there was a dark or solid background behind it :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-13 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
