(104623, 4441, 2427, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field, good colors, connection with newness a little too oblique</td>', 'Nice depth of field, good colors, connection with newness a little too oblique', '2002-08-13 10:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104624, 4441, 3087, '<td valign="top">Pretty and lovely colours.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Pretty and lovely colours.6, Kavey', '2002-08-13 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104625, 4441, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - pretty good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good. <br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  pretty good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - pretty goodTechnical Aspects - quite good. Meets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  pretty goodJim msp', '2002-08-13 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104626, 4441, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is without doubt, a superb picture.  It has the lot, and its not an easy shot.  My only gripe has nothing to do with the technical nature  that cannot be faulted  but the challenge link is a bit week.  But that seems a bit pedantic considering the quality of the picture. Im looking at it now, and I cant score this down (10)</td>', 'This is without doubt, a superb picture.  It has the lot, and its not an easy shot.  My only gripe has nothing to do with the technical nature  that cannot be faulted  but the challenge link is a bit week.  But that seems a bit pedantic considering the quality of the picture. Im looking at it now, and I cant score this down (10)', '2002-08-14 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104627, 4441, 2798, '<td valign="top">Great colours and framing.</td>', 'Great colours and framing.', '2002-08-15 07:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104628, 4441, 616, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of new. Butterflies are definitely new. Great DOF and composition.</td>', 'Nice capture of new. Butterflies are definitely new. Great DOF and composition.', '2002-08-15 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104629, 4441, 3112, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject.  Good coloration.  I would prefer a very deep field for this one. If I could give a 7.5, I would. 7</td>', 'Excellent subject.  Good coloration.  I would prefer a very deep field for this one. If I could give a 7.5, I would. 7', '2002-08-15 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104630, 4441, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot.  It''s hard to demonstrate the youth or lack there of in a butterfly, but I''m gonna give you the benefit of the doubt here.  You did track this down right after it escaped from it''s coccoon, right?  The swallowtail is nearly breathtaking.  The surrounding flowers are nice.  9 Swash</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot.  It''s hard to demonstrate the youth or lack there of in a butterfly, but I''m gonna give you the benefit of the doubt here.  You did track this down right after it escaped from it''s coccoon, right?  The swallowtail is nearly breathtaking.  The surrounding flowers are nice.  9 Swash', '2002-08-16 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104631, 4441, 1662, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and great find.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and great find.', '2002-08-16 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104632, 4441, 2204, '<td valign="top">Remarkable butterfly...I''ve been trying to get a good butterfly shot for months and haven''t succeeded yet.</td>', 'Remarkable butterfly...I''ve been trying to get a good butterfly shot for months and haven''t succeeded yet.', '2002-08-18 02:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104633, 4441, 2923, '<td valign="top">beautiful!!!</td>', 'beautiful!!!', '2002-08-18 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104634, 4441, 2983, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picure, though the green seems a little bizarre.</td>', 'This is a beautiful picure, though the green seems a little bizarre.', '2002-08-18 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104635, 4441, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I love the background.  It makes your subject stand out nicely.  This one is similar to the tomato worm photo in that the newness is symbolized by a stage in growth.  The lighting is great.  There may be a little too much dead space at the bottom.  Maybe crop off the flower in the bottom right that the broken stem is attached to.  Other than that, this photo is excelent.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice.  I love the background.  It makes your subject stand out nicely.  This one is similar to the tomato worm photo in that the newness is symbolized by a stage in growth.  The lighting is great.  There may be a little too much dead space at the bottom.  Maybe crop off the flower in the bottom right that the broken stem is attached to.  Other than that, this photo is excelent.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-18 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104636, 4441, 2667, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, well done.   ~mcmurma<br/>Aesthetics...10<br/>Meets Challenge...8<br/>Overall...9</td>', 'beautiful shot, well done.   ~mcmurmaAesthetics...10Meets Challenge...8Overall...9', '2002-08-18 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
