(104674, 4443, 3105, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting composition.  Looks kind of similar to one of the entries from the corporate challenge.  Same photographer maybe?  It''s a nice shade of blue off the windows.<br/>Score: 6<br/>Courtenay</td>', 'This is an interesting composition.  Looks kind of similar to one of the entries from the corporate challenge.  Same photographer maybe?  It''s a nice shade of blue off the windows.Score: 6Courtenay', '2002-08-14 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104675, 4443, 3230, '<td valign="top">Your composition is great. At first I wished that the bit ''o tree wasn''t shown, but now I think it''s a good way to communicate tension between nature and humankind''s creations.</td>', 'Your composition is great. At first I wished that the bit ''o tree wasn''t shown, but now I think it''s a good way to communicate tension between nature and humankind''s creations.', '2002-08-15 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104676, 4443, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice!  I think this is a great example of ''new'' technology... good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'very nice!  I think this is a great example of ''new'' technology... good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-16 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104677, 4443, 2881, '<td valign="top">I thought "new" architecture, or new buildings was over done in this challenge, but yours is probably the best one. Where I live, you can''t drive a mile without seeing lots of these modern "glass buildings" so I guess a picture like this doesn''t hold much appeal for me, although the satellite dishes at the base makes this one more interesting... changes the focal point from the building to something less obvious.  Not bad, all in all...</td>', 'I thought "new" architecture, or new buildings was over done in this challenge, but yours is probably the best one. Where I live, you can''t drive a mile without seeing lots of these modern "glass buildings" so I guess a picture like this doesn''t hold much appeal for me, although the satellite dishes at the base makes this one more interesting... changes the focal point from the building to something less obvious.  Not bad, all in all...', '2002-08-16 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104678, 4443, 2815, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot of what our New modern office building is like.  I really like it.  (9)</td>', 'This is a great shot of what our New modern office building is like.  I really like it.  (9)', '2002-08-17 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104679, 4443, 63, '<td valign="top">Great lines on building, technology not very new.</td>', 'Great lines on building, technology not very new.', '2002-08-17 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104680, 4443, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think it is amazing how you managed to get NO reflection in the windows of this building.  No clouds, no trees, not even air plane smoke.  Absolutely beautiful.  I get the reference to something new.  I like how there is that little bit of tree to the left and I like how the main line goes straight up the center of the photo.  Absolutely excelent work with a camera.  Congrats and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think it is amazing how you managed to get NO reflection in the windows of this building.  No clouds, no trees, not even air plane smoke.  Absolutely beautiful.  I get the reference to something new.  I like how there is that little bit of tree to the left and I like how the main line goes straight up the center of the photo.  Absolutely excelent work with a camera.  Congrats and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-17 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104681, 4443, 2798, '<td valign="top">I love this for it''s simplicity. It''s an excellent crop leaving me only to wish those few tree/bush tops werent there in the bottom left.</td>', 'I love this for it''s simplicity. It''s an excellent crop leaving me only to wish those few tree/bush tops werent there in the bottom left.', '2002-08-18 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
