(104726, 4447, 2997, '<td valign="top">I wanted to let you know that this is an excellent shot.  You made your point (no pun intended).  I didn''t grade this high (5) because I could not separate my gut feelings from my desire to be objective.  I''ve lost some friends to additions and the needles invokes too many bad memories.<br/>(Added 8/17: dpchallenge is a good thing.  The needle, in my mind, represents bad addictions.)</td>', 'I wanted to let you know that this is an excellent shot.  You made your point (no pun intended).  I didn''t grade this high (5) because I could not separate my gut feelings from my desire to be objective.  I''ve lost some friends to additions and the needles invokes too many bad memories.(Added 8/17: dpchallenge is a good thing.  The needle, in my mind, represents bad addictions.)', '2002-08-12 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104727, 4447, 1360, '<td valign="top">While not seeming to meet the chalenge at ALL, this, so far, is the most original submission i''ve seen, and I can''t bear to rate it anything lower than a 7.<br/><br/>P.S. Be sure to get rid of that bubble, or you''ll have more than an addiction... ;)</td>', 'While not seeming to meet the chalenge at ALL, this, so far, is the most original submission i''ve seen, and I can''t bear to rate it anything lower than a 7.P.S. Be sure to get rid of that bubble, or you''ll have more than an addiction... ;)', '2002-08-12 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
