(104730, 4447, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is cooooooooooooooooooool... The first two seconds I just saw the needle and the initial interpretation of a generic drug addiction. In the next two seconds I noticed the syringe box text. A few seconds later I noticed the coloured stuff on the plate - is that to show an addiction to photography because photography is about making things from colours and light? <br/>I like the way the pool of light pulls you in and keeps you within the frame. I like the colour of the liquid and the ''stuff''. <br/>I am, however, REALLY carefully not looking at the needle as I am a lady who quite literally screeches when needles and syringes pop up unexpectedly on TV. I really ought to stop watching Casualty I guess.<br/>8, kavey</td>', 'This is cooooooooooooooooooool... The first two seconds I just saw the needle and the initial interpretation of a generic drug addiction. In the next two seconds I noticed the syringe box text. A few seconds later I noticed the coloured stuff on the plate - is that to show an addiction to photography because photography is about making things from colours and light? I like the way the pool of light pulls you in and keeps you within the frame. I like the colour of the liquid and the ''stuff''. I am, however, REALLY carefully not looking at the needle as I am a lady who quite literally screeches when needles and syringes pop up unexpectedly on TV. I really ought to stop watching Casualty I guess.8, kavey', '2002-08-12 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
