(104780, 4448, 772, '<td valign="top">Well, lemme just start by saying that I guess yer wondering "WHY ME!"... lol.. this would have been a very nice photo for the next challenge... But I guess you have already heard that and will continue to hear it throughout this challenge :)  I''m giving this photo a 10 purely on its creativity.  This image creates a tough lighting situation, but you seem to have managed that fairly well.  The lighting coming in from the right side is a little harsh and the shadow on the left side looks a little strange... Your depth of field is excellent, as is the overall composition... At least you don''t have to go shopping before you do the next challenge :) Great shot.. I hope I see this one as a high scoring finisher this week :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'Well, lemme just start by saying that I guess yer wondering "WHY ME!"... lol.. this would have been a very nice photo for the next challenge... But I guess you have already heard that and will continue to hear it throughout this challenge :)  I''m giving this photo a 10 purely on its creativity.  This image creates a tough lighting situation, but you seem to have managed that fairly well.  The lighting coming in from the right side is a little harsh and the shadow on the left side looks a little strange... Your depth of field is excellent, as is the overall composition... At least you don''t have to go shopping before you do the next challenge :) Great shot.. I hope I see this one as a high scoring finisher this week :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-12 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104781, 4448, 3018, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture.  On my top 10.  The illusion of curved pencils is great!  A little shiny on the right.</td>', 'Excellent picture.  On my top 10.  The illusion of curved pencils is great!  A little shiny on the right.', '2002-08-12 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104782, 4448, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea and wonderfully graphic. And my favourite colour is YELLOW! The left and right side aren''t balanced, I find I want to move over to the left a bit. <br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Very cool idea and wonderfully graphic. And my favourite colour is YELLOW! The left and right side aren''t balanced, I find I want to move over to the left a bit. 7, Kavey', '2002-08-12 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104783, 4448, 117, '<td valign="top">and last but not least i know where the pencil idea come from, someone''s been peaking</td>', 'and last but not least i know where the pencil idea come from, someone''s been peaking', '2002-08-12 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104784, 4448, 2867, '<td valign="top">great pic!  wouldve been perfect for the pencil challange ;)</td>', 'great pic!  wouldve been perfect for the pencil challange ;)', '2002-08-12 19:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104785, 4448, 1748, '<td valign="top">more apt for next challenge would have scored higher but I still rate iit highly</td>', 'more apt for next challenge would have scored higher but I still rate iit highly', '2002-08-12 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104786, 4448, 2353, '<td valign="top">I really like this...to bad you didn''t know the pencil challenge was comming up!  I whish it were centered, though...or perhaps that was the effect you were going for?  Regardless, its cool good job!</td>', 'I really like this...to bad you didn''t know the pencil challenge was comming up!  I whish it were centered, though...or perhaps that was the effect you were going for?  Regardless, its cool good job!', '2002-08-12 21:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
