(104861, 4450, 327, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Please don''t get me wrong here...it''s good, clear, clean and the colors/light  are super. I think this would of been improved if you would of gotten down to her level. Also the background [left] is no help to the over all shot. It''s good work and a great lens. Score-7 Kee</td>', 'I love this shot. Please don''t get me wrong here...it''s good, clear, clean and the colors/light  are super. I think this would of been improved if you would of gotten down to her level. Also the background [left] is no help to the over all shot. It''s good work and a great lens. Score-7 Kee', '2002-08-15 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104862, 4450, 2261, '<td valign="top">A nice photo, shame that pipe is spoiling the background.</td>', 'A nice photo, shame that pipe is spoiling the background.', '2002-08-16 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104863, 4450, 3080, '<td valign="top">The little girl is adorable.  Looks like she''s going to overflow that tub any minute now. lol.  I wish the black corrogated tubing could be taken out of the photo.  It''s so close to the little girl that when I look at her, my eyes are drawn to it.  She is so cute that she deserves a prettier background.  However, I don''t think that huge tub of gallons upon gallons of water is going anywhere, so you probably didn''t get to do much picking of the background here.  Focus is good and lighting is great.  Adorable.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'The little girl is adorable.  Looks like she''s going to overflow that tub any minute now. lol.  I wish the black corrogated tubing could be taken out of the photo.  It''s so close to the little girl that when I look at her, my eyes are drawn to it.  She is so cute that she deserves a prettier background.  However, I don''t think that huge tub of gallons upon gallons of water is going anywhere, so you probably didn''t get to do much picking of the background here.  Focus is good and lighting is great.  Adorable.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-17 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104864, 4450, 2815, '<td valign="top">This is the best young person shot I have seen this week.  (8)</td>', 'This is the best young person shot I have seen this week.  (8)', '2002-08-18 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104865, 4450, 2783, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of your comments. You probably won''t believe me, but this is a snapshot and I really didn''t think it would turn out this good. I wish that the green tube wasn''t there, I knew when I submitted it that it was going to lower my score, but I had nothing else to submit. I also wish that there was more grass on the ground and no bald spots.</td>', 'Thanks for all of your comments. You probably won''t believe me, but this is a snapshot and I really didn''t think it would turn out this good. I wish that the green tube wasn''t there, I knew when I submitted it that it was going to lower my score, but I had nothing else to submit. I also wish that there was more grass on the ground and no bald spots.', '2002-08-19 02:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(104866, 4452, 2279, '<td valign="top">Could be a little bit brighter. 6.</td>', 'Could be a little bit brighter. 6.', '2002-08-12 04:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104867, 4452, 2586, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. It has a wonderful atmosphere and I LOVE that light outside of the window. It really conveys the early morning. Nice composition. Only negative for me is that at the front of the image there is the dark shadow of the basket and the light on the harvest isn''t ideal either because you were focusing the light on the outdoors.</td>', 'I like this a lot. It has a wonderful atmosphere and I LOVE that light outside of the window. It really conveys the early morning. Nice composition. Only negative for me is that at the front of the image there is the dark shadow of the basket and the light on the harvest isn''t ideal either because you were focusing the light on the outdoors.', '2002-08-12 04:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104868, 4452, 2781, '<td valign="top">I like how the light is coming in through the window onto the veggies.  Those must have been yummy to eat.</td>', 'I like how the light is coming in through the window onto the veggies.  Those must have been yummy to eat.', '2002-08-12 04:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104869, 4452, 2780, '<td valign="top">i was originally thinking something along these lines for my photo, but I gave up because I couldn''t get the effect I wanted. I think you''ve taken this shot VERY well indeed. I love the rays of light coming in through the windows. 10</td>', 'i was originally thinking something along these lines for my photo, but I gave up because I couldn''t get the effect I wanted. I think you''ve taken this shot VERY well indeed. I love the rays of light coming in through the windows. 10', '2002-08-12 05:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104870, 4452, 3002, '<td valign="top">I like this shot and compliement the photographer.  Beautiful colors, and I like the obviously new sunlight and the title.  I also appreciate it more because it is NOT a photo of a baby, flower bud, sunrise, puppy, etc.   Good work.</td>', 'I like this shot and compliement the photographer.  Beautiful colors, and I like the obviously new sunlight and the title.  I also appreciate it more because it is NOT a photo of a baby, flower bud, sunrise, puppy, etc.   Good work.', '2002-08-12 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
