(104893, 4452, 3087, '<td valign="top">I think the sunlight through the windows is fantastic - really makes me think of autumn and the changing seasons. The basket says new harvest to me very much - put it this way, harvest popped into my head as soon as I saw it, and I didn''t even think to look at the title, till just now writing this comment. But the shadows on the veg are too strong and the corn/ marrow thing is just tooo dark. I would score 7 for the same photo with better lighting on the veg. <br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'I think the sunlight through the windows is fantastic - really makes me think of autumn and the changing seasons. The basket says new harvest to me very much - put it this way, harvest popped into my head as soon as I saw it, and I didn''t even think to look at the title, till just now writing this comment. But the shadows on the veg are too strong and the corn/ marrow thing is just tooo dark. I would score 7 for the same photo with better lighting on the veg. 5, Kavey', '2002-08-13 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104894, 4452, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - very good<br/>Technical Aspects - very good, great use of background light<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  very good<br/>Top 5<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - very goodTechnical Aspects - very good, great use of background lightMeets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  very goodTop 5Jim msp', '2002-08-13 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
