(104896, 4452, 1792, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  Probably the most well done in the bunch.  New vegies, new morning---the light in the window is wonderful.  Can''t find anything to criticize.</td>', 'I like this one.  Probably the most well done in the bunch.  New vegies, new morning---the light in the window is wonderful.  Can''t find anything to criticize.', '2002-08-14 01:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104897, 4452, 3269, '<td valign="top">This is why we spend so much time working in the garden. You get the water boiling, I''ll slice the ''maters. Good picture.</td>', 'This is why we spend so much time working in the garden. You get the water boiling, I''ll slice the ''maters. Good picture.', '2002-08-14 03:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104898, 4452, 436, '<td valign="top">Should be an advertisement for something. Glorious lighting, nice arrangment in the basket.  I kinda wish the light could''ve picked up a bit more detail on the corn, but all in al, it''s great.</td>', 'Should be an advertisement for something. Glorious lighting, nice arrangment in the basket.  I kinda wish the light could''ve picked up a bit more detail on the corn, but all in al, it''s great.', '2002-08-14 09:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104899, 4452, 1003, '<td valign="top">nicely done</td>', 'nicely done', '2002-08-14 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104900, 4452, 1826, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.</td>', 'I really like this one.', '2002-08-14 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104901, 4452, 3105, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice composition.  Even though I can tell that it is sharp and in focus it still has a soft feel to it because of the dimly lit foreground, blurred background and sunlit haze, which I like.  I am wondering how it may look with a little more light from the right side to further illuminate the food and bring out a little more color to help balance out the greens.  Overall, very well done.<br/>Score: 8<br/>Courtenay<br/></td>', 'This is a really nice composition.  Even though I can tell that it is sharp and in focus it still has a soft feel to it because of the dimly lit foreground, blurred background and sunlit haze, which I like.  I am wondering how it may look with a little more light from the right side to further illuminate the food and bring out a little more color to help balance out the greens.  Overall, very well done.Score: 8Courtenay', '2002-08-14 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104902, 4452, 3185, '<td valign="top">I love the capture of the morning sun here.  You can almost feel the light!</td>', 'I love the capture of the morning sun here.  You can almost feel the light!', '2002-08-14 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104903, 4452, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite this week!</td>', 'This is my favorite this week!', '2002-08-14 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104904, 4452, 2173, '<td valign="top">really good picture</td>', 'really good picture', '2002-08-14 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104905, 4452, 1875, '<td valign="top">nice lighting</td>', 'nice lighting', '2002-08-14 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104906, 4452, 3230, '<td valign="top">Very cool, but the subject (as per the title) is mostly in shadow, so the eye is drawn to the brightest spot, the light outside rather than the veges. Nonetheless, I think the lighting is interesting, just not for the purposes of getting your audience to examine the contents of the basket.</td>', 'Very cool, but the subject (as per the title) is mostly in shadow, so the eye is drawn to the brightest spot, the light outside rather than the veges. Nonetheless, I think the lighting is interesting, just not for the purposes of getting your audience to examine the contents of the basket.', '2002-08-15 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104907, 4452, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a superbly atmospheric shot.  The use of the morning rays cutting through the mist outside the window is great.  DOF is spot on; the soft focus background and crispness of the foreground subject hold the attention while, at the same time, being pleasing on the eye.  The balance of high and low contrast is spot on, it looks early, it looks real and it hasn''t got a ''Set up'' feel  Great shot  worthy 10 Good luck</td>', 'This is a superbly atmospheric shot.  The use of the morning rays cutting through the mist outside the window is great.  DOF is spot on; the soft focus background and crispness of the foreground subject hold the attention while, at the same time, being pleasing on the eye.  The balance of high and low contrast is spot on, it looks early, it looks real and it hasn''t got a ''Set up'' feel  Great shot  worthy 10 Good luck', '2002-08-15 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104908, 4452, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea!  I love how it was done.  Maybe the vegetables could have a bit more lighting, but don''t know how you could have done that to make it still look good with that background lighting.  The title is Morning Harvest.  To me, that reminds me of the vegetables just coming in from outside.  Being picked first thing in the morning.  That image also produces little droplets of dew.  Could a spray bottle be used to produce that kind of slightly damp image I wonder?  Another thing that could have added to this already wonderful shot would be to have a longer stem coming off one of the tomatoes or to have the large tomato on the top turned slightly so the stem showed.  Great job with this one! Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a great idea!  I love how it was done.  Maybe the vegetables could have a bit more lighting, but don''t know how you could have done that to make it still look good with that background lighting.  The title is Morning Harvest.  To me, that reminds me of the vegetables just coming in from outside.  Being picked first thing in the morning.  That image also produces little droplets of dew.  Could a spray bottle be used to produce that kind of slightly damp image I wonder?  Another thing that could have added to this already wonderful shot would be to have a longer stem coming off one of the tomatoes or to have the large tomato on the top turned slightly so the stem showed.  Great job with this one! Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-15 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104909, 4452, 640, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot. The sun shining in looks great. On first glance I thought the  green vegetable on the left was an umbrella! It seems a little too long and puts an otherwise beautiful shot a little off balance.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot. The sun shining in looks great. On first glance I thought the  green vegetable on the left was an umbrella! It seems a little too long and puts an otherwise beautiful shot a little off balance.', '2002-08-15 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104910, 4452, 327, '<td valign="top">Great light!!!! Wonderful light!!!! Love it. Kee</td>', 'Great light!!!! Wonderful light!!!! Love it. Kee', '2002-08-15 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104911, 4452, 2881, '<td valign="top">A still life study of vegetables... a creative thought no one else had. While I don''t usually enjoy still life photos, I do like this one.  I love the use of &amp;lt;morning?&amp;gt; light coming in the windoes in the background. would it have been possible to lighten the vegetable backet to give more clarity, without making the background too light? I imagine you probably tried many different takes and submitted the one you liked best. I''ve found that what I think is best, is often different than someone else''s opinion.</td>', 'A still life study of vegetables... a creative thought no one else had. While I don''t usually enjoy still life photos, I do like this one.  I love the use of &lt;morning?&gt; light coming in the windoes in the background. would it have been possible to lighten the vegetable backet to give more clarity, without making the background too light? I imagine you probably tried many different takes and submitted the one you liked best. I''ve found that what I think is best, is often different than someone else''s opinion.', '2002-08-15 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104912, 4452, 2700, '<td valign="top">it would have helped to have a light closer to the fruit inside the room... the corn is dark on the left</td>', 'it would have helped to have a light closer to the fruit inside the room... the corn is dark on the left', '2002-08-16 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104913, 4452, 1280, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge:good<br/>Technical aspects: could be a little lighter to show more detail of the produce<br/>Artistic Merit:ok<br/>Suggestions:perhaps a different arrangement to allow more light on the subject. Remove the paper from the basket...it adds no virtue.</td>', 'Meets challenge:goodTechnical aspects: could be a little lighter to show more detail of the produceArtistic Merit:okSuggestions:perhaps a different arrangement to allow more light on the subject. Remove the paper from the basket...it adds no virtue.', '2002-08-16 11:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104914, 4452, 1041, '<td valign="top">that''s a very nice arrangements, the sunshine is superb, and the green of the window frame rounds everything off nicely.  your corn to the left and some of the tomatoes are a little dark, but that doesn''t distract much from the photo because it does give it that early morning feel. -- gr8photos (8)</td>', 'that''s a very nice arrangements, the sunshine is superb, and the green of the window frame rounds everything off nicely.  your corn to the left and some of the tomatoes are a little dark, but that doesn''t distract much from the photo because it does give it that early morning feel. -- gr8photos (8)', '2002-08-16 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104915, 4452, 3280, '<td valign="top">I liked your use of lighting and color. The background is excellent</td>', 'I liked your use of lighting and color. The background is excellent', '2002-08-16 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104916, 4452, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice setup.  The corn on the left is a tad dark, but still a nice presentation.  I esp. like the sun on the window, at first I thought it was early morning fog, but it still looks good to me.  9 Swash</td>', 'Nice setup.  The corn on the left is a tad dark, but still a nice presentation.  I esp. like the sun on the window, at first I thought it was early morning fog, but it still looks good to me.  9 Swash', '2002-08-16 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
