(104929, 4453, 772, '<td valign="top">You have met the challenge by photographing a new house :)  What this photo lacks is artistic punch.  I believe that the stronger entries in these challenge combine several elements.... Meeting the challenge, artistic punch, and good composition.  :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'You have met the challenge by photographing a new house :)  What this photo lacks is artistic punch.  I believe that the stronger entries in these challenge combine several elements.... Meeting the challenge, artistic punch, and good composition.  :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-12 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104930, 4453, 2170, '<td valign="top">The color is sort of washed out, unfortunately.  Looks like a great house, though.</td>', 'The color is sort of washed out, unfortunately.  Looks like a great house, though.', '2002-08-12 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104931, 4453, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition4<br/>Technical Aspects5<br/>Appeal5<br/>Creativity4<br/>Rating5Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition4Technical Aspects5Appeal5Creativity4Rating5Autool', '2002-08-12 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104932, 4453, 2200, '<td valign="top">Good concept of new. Perhaps a more interesting angle would make the photo more pleasing</td>', 'Good concept of new. Perhaps a more interesting angle would make the photo more pleasing', '2002-08-13 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104933, 4453, 1826, '<td valign="top">Where''s that Bob Villa when you need him? :)</td>', 'Where''s that Bob Villa when you need him? :)', '2002-08-14 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104934, 4453, 3080, '<td valign="top">nice angle of this house.  wow, look at all the windows!  definately depicts something new.  good lighting, nothing too bright and nothing too dark.  the top of the house up by the sky is close.  if it were any brighter, it might be distracting.  good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'nice angle of this house.  wow, look at all the windows!  definately depicts something new.  good lighting, nothing too bright and nothing too dark.  the top of the house up by the sky is close.  if it were any brighter, it might be distracting.  good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-18 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104935, 4453, 2867, '<td valign="top">once again thanks to everyone who gave me a comment!</td>', 'once again thanks to everyone who gave me a comment!', '2002-08-19 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(104936, 4454, 205, '<td valign="top">ooh its all arts and craftsy</td>', 'ooh its all arts and craftsy', '2002-08-12 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104937, 4454, 3044, '<td valign="top">lighting too harsh.</td>', 'lighting too harsh.', '2002-08-12 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104938, 4454, 2752, '<td valign="top">lover your idea..good composition,..I would have left some paint on the brush.</td>', 'lover your idea..good composition,..I would have left some paint on the brush.', '2002-08-12 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104939, 4454, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition7<br/>Technical Aspects6<br/>Appeal5<br/>Creativity6<br/>Rating6Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition7Technical Aspects6Appeal5Creativity6Rating6Autool', '2002-08-12 22:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104940, 4454, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - pretty good<br/>Technical Aspects - pretty good. <br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  pretty good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - pretty goodTechnical Aspects - pretty good. Meets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  pretty goodJim msp', '2002-08-13 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104941, 4454, 2928, '<td valign="top">Super shot I love the green.  I can''t find fault technically</td>', 'Super shot I love the green.  I can''t find fault technically', '2002-08-15 06:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104942, 4454, 641, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my doll houses when I was little... setup seems good, but the contrast just looks a little high or maybe the lighting just too harsh.</td>', 'Reminds me of my doll houses when I was little... setup seems good, but the contrast just looks a little high or maybe the lighting just too harsh.', '2002-08-15 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104943, 4454, 3112, '<td valign="top">Slightly overexposed, and colors are vivid to the point of being overdriven.  Good composition idea.<br/></td>', 'Slightly overexposed, and colors are vivid to the point of being overdriven.  Good composition idea.', '2002-08-15 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104944, 4454, 3198, '<td valign="top">nice composition and colors! it looks like an old ''50 shot. The background could have been done more carefully but i like it overall.</td>', 'nice composition and colors! it looks like an old ''50 shot. The background could have been done more carefully but i like it overall.', '2002-08-16 05:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104945, 4454, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like how you angled the photo so that we could see the yellow paint on the roof.  It''s slightly reflecting the bottle of green paint and that helps to show how new and shiny it is.  You did a really great job of not getting glare, or too much reflection in the paint.  I like the bright color, and I like how there is still a bit of green paint on the brush indicating that it was done recently.  It makes me wonder if there is more of the house to the right.  Great idea, good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I like how you angled the photo so that we could see the yellow paint on the roof.  It''s slightly reflecting the bottle of green paint and that helps to show how new and shiny it is.  You did a really great job of not getting glare, or too much reflection in the paint.  I like the bright color, and I like how there is still a bit of green paint on the brush indicating that it was done recently.  It makes me wonder if there is more of the house to the right.  Great idea, good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-17 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104946, 4455, 2123, '<td valign="top">I know you didn''t have control over the weather, but for a topic that should be happy and exciting, this looks bleak and depressing. :-(</td>', 'I know you didn''t have control over the weather, but for a topic that should be happy and exciting, this looks bleak and depressing. :-(', '2002-08-12 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104947, 4455, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, but the colors are a little muted for me.  maybe boost the contrast and/or saturation, some? karmat</td>', 'Nice perspective, but the colors are a little muted for me.  maybe boost the contrast and/or saturation, some? karmat', '2002-08-12 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104948, 4455, 2817, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really strike me as an awesome picture as some do.</td>', 'Doesn''t really strike me as an awesome picture as some do.', '2002-08-12 20:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104949, 4455, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition5<br/>Technical Aspects4<br/>Appeal4<br/>Creativity4<br/>Rating4Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition5Technical Aspects4Appeal4Creativity4Rating4Autool', '2002-08-12 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104950, 4455, 2928, '<td valign="top">The idea is good and the picture is fine.  It does seem (in my opinion) to lack a central theme.  I''m not really sure how to be constructive here, but I''ll try.  It has a snapshot quality about it.  Perhaps, taking the shot lying down or from another (equally odd angle) would have helped</td>', 'The idea is good and the picture is fine.  It does seem (in my opinion) to lack a central theme.  I''m not really sure how to be constructive here, but I''ll try.  It has a snapshot quality about it.  Perhaps, taking the shot lying down or from another (equally odd angle) would have helped', '2002-08-13 06:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104951, 4455, 772, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge... I, personally, would enjoy more artistic interpretations :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This meets the challenge... I, personally, would enjoy more artistic interpretations :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-13 10:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104952, 4455, 3260, '<td valign="top">can''t say the subject looks too pretty...<br/>and i wouldnt crop that last house on the left. otherwise, nice pic</td>', 'can''t say the subject looks too pretty...and i wouldnt crop that last house on the left. otherwise, nice pic', '2002-08-14 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104953, 4455, 641, '<td valign="top">Hey..looks like my neighborhood! I''d crop about 2 inches off the bottom personally, but that''s just me.</td>', 'Hey..looks like my neighborhood! I''d crop about 2 inches off the bottom personally, but that''s just me.', '2002-08-15 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104954, 4455, 2881, '<td valign="top">I don''t like to see the name of the challenge (new) used in the title... too cliche or something. There are lots of other, more creative ways to express it.  Kind of depressing... when I drive through cities and see row after row of new homes all with the same lines, that look like the same floor plans, I''m glad I live in the country in an order home when there was more "uinqueness" built into each house. This photo gives me a feeling of claustrophobia.</td>', 'I don''t like to see the name of the challenge (new) used in the title... too cliche or something. There are lots of other, more creative ways to express it.  Kind of depressing... when I drive through cities and see row after row of new homes all with the same lines, that look like the same floor plans, I''m glad I live in the country in an order home when there was more "uinqueness" built into each house. This photo gives me a feeling of claustrophobia.', '2002-08-15 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104955, 4455, 1280, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge:yes<br/>Technical aspects:good<br/>Artistic Merit:hmmmmmm...?  <br/></td>', 'Meets challenge:yesTechnical aspects:goodArtistic Merit:hmmmmmm...?  ', '2002-08-16 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104956, 4455, 3080, '<td valign="top">Portrays something new perfectly.  It''s not very pleasing to look at though cause of all the mud and water puddles.  Kind of takes away from the houses.  The lighting is great, no distracting shadows.  Not too bright and not too dark.  Congrats and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Portrays something new perfectly.  It''s not very pleasing to look at though cause of all the mud and water puddles.  Kind of takes away from the houses.  The lighting is great, no distracting shadows.  Not too bright and not too dark.  Congrats and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-17 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104957, 4455, 3351, '<td valign="top">creepy, conformist, houses with no individuality scare me...but the pic is nonetheless interesting. move into an old house! theyre better!</td>', 'creepy, conformist, houses with no individuality scare me...but the pic is nonetheless interesting. move into an old house! theyre better!', '2002-08-18 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104958, 4456, 2223, '<td valign="top">nice sky..next time crop out the houses below.</td>', 'nice sky..next time crop out the houses below.', '2002-08-12 01:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104959, 4456, 2279, '<td valign="top">Really neat sunrise, but I would have liked it more with the bottom cropped out.</td>', 'Really neat sunrise, but I would have liked it more with the bottom cropped out.', '2002-08-12 04:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104960, 4456, 2781, '<td valign="top">You should have cropped out the building tops, they distract from the sky.  Or you could have put them on a "1/3" line.</td>', 'You should have cropped out the building tops, they distract from the sky.  Or you could have put them on a "1/3" line.', '2002-08-12 04:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104961, 4456, 2596, '<td valign="top">This is taken to late to say "a new day" the sun is to high</td>', 'This is taken to late to say "a new day" the sun is to high', '2002-08-12 06:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104962, 4456, 1779, '<td valign="top">please loose the houses and cables, ad more contrast and saturation and we have a winner!</td>', 'please loose the houses and cables, ad more contrast and saturation and we have a winner!', '2002-08-12 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104963, 4456, 2256, '<td valign="top">great sky.....I hate those electrical wires, though.......</td>', 'great sky.....I hate those electrical wires, though.......', '2002-08-12 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104964, 4456, 2490, '<td valign="top">Oops, power lines.  Sorry but they do knock it down about 2 points on my intial impression.  7 nards656</td>', 'Oops, power lines.  Sorry but they do knock it down about 2 points on my intial impression.  7 nards656', '2002-08-12 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104965, 4456, 2353, '<td valign="top">Maybe if you had left the roof tops and powerlines out?  Beautiful sun breaking through the clouds, though :)</td>', 'Maybe if you had left the roof tops and powerlines out?  Beautiful sun breaking through the clouds, though :)', '2002-08-12 21:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104966, 4456, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition6<br/>Technical Aspects5<br/>Appeal5<br/>Creativity5<br/>Rating5Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition6Technical Aspects5Appeal5Creativity5Rating5Autool', '2002-08-12 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104967, 4456, 2058, '<td valign="top">This would be better if there were no buildings at all I think</td>', 'This would be better if there were no buildings at all I think', '2002-08-13 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104968, 4456, 3213, '<td valign="top">I liked the sun rising between the clouds, but I think it would have been better if you just cut the bottom part.</td>', 'I liked the sun rising between the clouds, but I think it would have been better if you just cut the bottom part.', '2002-08-13 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104969, 4456, 2154, '<td valign="top">nice picture, but sunrise would have matched the title better</td>', 'nice picture, but sunrise would have matched the title better', '2002-08-13 04:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104970, 4456, 2907, '<td valign="top">Dropping the exposure another stop or two would help bring out the clouds or some simple adjustment in photoshop would have easily helped this image...<br/>If you would like to see what I mean / get some help, PM me... <br/><br/>jeremya<br/><br/>Note: My vote for this image is locked in and will not change....<br/><br/>Also getting up earlier helps... but I know this is hard :-)</td>', 'Dropping the exposure another stop or two would help bring out the clouds or some simple adjustment in photoshop would have easily helped this image...If you would like to see what I mean / get some help, PM me... jeremyaNote: My vote for this image is locked in and will not change....Also getting up earlier helps... but I know this is hard :-)', '2002-08-13 05:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104971, 4456, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the sky and clouds but I think the silhouettes here are ugly. They don''t add to the stunning sky at all. I''d either crop out the lower part completely or look for a tree or something more striking to use as the foreground silhouette.<br/>I''d have scored 7 for the same shot cropped to lose all the buildings.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Love the sky and clouds but I think the silhouettes here are ugly. They don''t add to the stunning sky at all. I''d either crop out the lower part completely or look for a tree or something more striking to use as the foreground silhouette.I''d have scored 7 for the same shot cropped to lose all the buildings.5, Kavey', '2002-08-13 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104972, 4456, 3071, '<td valign="top">good idea, but i think a lower sun with a little more orange would of been better (but i''m no expert, by any means)</td>', 'good idea, but i think a lower sun with a little more orange would of been better (but i''m no expert, by any means)', '2002-08-14 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104973, 4456, 2173, '<td valign="top">if you only take the sun part it will be most beauty., but its ok 8</td>', 'if you only take the sun part it will be most beauty., but its ok 8', '2002-08-14 17:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104974, 4456, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky. Less lovely telegraph pole.</td>', 'Lovely sky. Less lovely telegraph pole.', '2002-08-15 08:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104975, 4456, 2928, '<td valign="top">This would have been a great shot had the sun been much lower in the sky (I think); just peeping over the roof perhaps.  It looks too much like deliberate over exposure to create the atmosphere, rather than natural Good shot, good idea</td>', 'This would have been a great shot had the sun been much lower in the sky (I think); just peeping over the roof perhaps.  It looks too much like deliberate over exposure to create the atmosphere, rather than natural Good shot, good idea', '2002-08-15 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104976, 4456, 3044, '<td valign="top">bump up the saturation and crop out the rooftops would be my only suggestion. nice shot</td>', 'bump up the saturation and crop out the rooftops would be my only suggestion. nice shot', '2002-08-15 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104977, 4456, 806, '<td valign="top">bbeautifull - but without the house tops.</td>', 'bbeautifull - but without the house tops.', '2002-08-15 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104978, 4456, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this, but the bottom [Telephone pole etc] is a distraction, could of cut that out.<br/>Still it''s nice a good capture. Score-6 Kee</td>', 'I like this, but the bottom [Telephone pole etc] is a distraction, could of cut that out.Still it''s nice a good capture. Score-6 Kee', '2002-08-15 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104979, 4456, 3050, '<td valign="top">Love the sky.  I''d have cropped it a bit more to take out the building s and power lines; I often have the same dilemma when faced with a beautiful cloud formation matched with an inopportune skyline.</td>', 'Love the sky.  I''d have cropped it a bit more to take out the building s and power lines; I often have the same dilemma when faced with a beautiful cloud formation matched with an inopportune skyline.', '2002-08-15 19:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104980, 4456, 2700, '<td valign="top">This photo would have worked better if you would have cropped out the houses</td>', 'This photo would have worked better if you would have cropped out the houses', '2002-08-16 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104981, 4456, 1280, '<td valign="top">Because the sun is high in the sky it doesn''t really say "new" to me.  Looks to be about 11 or 12 o''clock.  But I guess if you just woke up it would be a new day....so I guess I can''t say it''s not new.  I think this could be a more interesting shot of this beautiful sky with an increase in brightness and contrast and to point the camera higher to eliminate the dark distractions at the bottom.  I think you are well on your way to a good shot here. Great colors.</td>', 'Because the sun is high in the sky it doesn''t really say "new" to me.  Looks to be about 11 or 12 o''clock.  But I guess if you just woke up it would be a new day....so I guess I can''t say it''s not new.  I think this could be a more interesting shot of this beautiful sky with an increase in brightness and contrast and to point the camera higher to eliminate the dark distractions at the bottom.  I think you are well on your way to a good shot here. Great colors.', '2002-08-16 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104982, 4456, 2923, '<td valign="top">Actually, an old day, this isn''t a sunrise or dawn...</td>', 'Actually, an old day, this isn''t a sunrise or dawn...', '2002-08-16 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104983, 4456, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  I love how the houses are just shadows and I love how the sun peeks out of the clouds.  The sun seems quite high into the sky for it to be a very new day.  I''m thinking still before noon, but do you have a horrizon?  I know we have too many trees here to get a good horizon, so maybe it''s not possible, but I think a horizon would add to the feeling of newness.  Don''t think you could have got such a beautiful shot of the sun coming out of the clouds on a horizon though, so it''s a toss up.  I like your photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  I love how the houses are just shadows and I love how the sun peeks out of the clouds.  The sun seems quite high into the sky for it to be a very new day.  I''m thinking still before noon, but do you have a horrizon?  I know we have too many trees here to get a good horizon, so maybe it''s not possible, but I think a horizon would add to the feeling of newness.  Don''t think you could have got such a beautiful shot of the sun coming out of the clouds on a horizon though, so it''s a toss up.  I like your photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-17 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104984, 4456, 3112, '<td valign="top">Lens flare is unfortunate.  Try cropping to just the sun and the beginnings of the <br/>beams, and boost contrast.</td>', 'Lens flare is unfortunate.  Try cropping to just the sun and the beginnings of the beams, and boost contrast.', '2002-08-17 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104985, 4456, 63, '<td valign="top">Sun has been up a while.  You need to get up earlier to call it a new day.</td>', 'Sun has been up a while.  You need to get up earlier to call it a new day.', '2002-08-17 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104986, 4456, 2983, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, except the silhouette, powerlines etc. aren''t as awe-inspiring.</td>', 'Beautiful, except the silhouette, powerlines etc. aren''t as awe-inspiring.', '2002-08-18 04:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104987, 4457, 3002, '<td valign="top">Polished perhaps, but new?</td>', 'Polished perhaps, but new?', '2002-08-12 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104988, 4457, 772, '<td valign="top">I am trying to conclude that the ''new'' factor in this photo is that the stones are newly polished?  I''m a little lost on the intention of this photo... - jmsetzler</td>', 'I am trying to conclude that the ''new'' factor in this photo is that the stones are newly polished?  I''m a little lost on the intention of this photo... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-12 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104989, 4457, 3031, '<td valign="top">I''m a succer for colors, so this picture is very nice. Some stones are shining a bit to much for my taste.</td>', 'I''m a succer for colors, so this picture is very nice. Some stones are shining a bit to much for my taste.', '2002-08-12 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104990, 4457, 2754, '<td valign="top">Can I make this into a jigsaw puzzle?</td>', 'Can I make this into a jigsaw puzzle?', '2002-08-12 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104991, 4457, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very sharp -- quite colorful!</td>', 'Very sharp -- quite colorful!', '2002-08-12 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104992, 4457, 656, '<td valign="top">a riot of colours - very nice.  A polariser might help cut down the glare and bring out the colours even more ?</td>', 'a riot of colours - very nice.  A polariser might help cut down the glare and bring out the colours even more ?', '2002-08-12 22:53:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(104993, 4457, 3208, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject(s).  Nice photo.</td>', 'Very interesting subject(s).  Nice photo.', '2002-08-13 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104994, 4457, 3127, '<td valign="top">Great colors!</td>', 'Great colors!', '2002-08-13 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104995, 4457, 1877, '<td valign="top">Great colors.. a few bright white spots though, but I dont know how to get rid of those... sorry can''t offer advice, someone more experienced would know. Neat collection too, I like that yellow one with red streaks. Without the title, I wouldn''t have really thought this to be "something new".. so i gotta give you a 6.</td>', 'Great colors.. a few bright white spots though, but I dont know how to get rid of those... sorry can''t offer advice, someone more experienced would know. Neat collection too, I like that yellow one with red streaks. Without the title, I wouldn''t have really thought this to be "something new".. so i gotta give you a 6.', '2002-08-13 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104996, 4457, 2295, '<td valign="top">Nice, colorful picture.  Focus looks good, lighting is excellent.  Are those new rocks?  6</td>', 'Nice, colorful picture.  Focus looks good, lighting is excellent.  Are those new rocks?  6', '2002-08-13 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104997, 4457, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition5<br/>Technical Aspects4<br/>Appeal4<br/>Creativity4<br/>Rating4Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition5Technical Aspects4Appeal4Creativity4Rating4Autool', '2002-08-13 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104998, 4457, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - pretty good. <br/>Meets Challenge - yes, I assume so<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  pretty good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - pretty good. Meets Challenge - yes, I assume soVisual Impact / Originality  pretty goodJim msp', '2002-08-13 23:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(104999, 4457, 2932, '<td valign="top">shiny and new really do go together!</td>', 'shiny and new really do go together!', '2002-08-15 01:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105000, 4457, 2798, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Needs a touch more contrast and colour to really make it pop off the page.</td>', 'Good idea. Needs a touch more contrast and colour to really make it pop off the page.', '2002-08-15 07:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105001, 4457, 641, '<td valign="top">Oh I love tumbled stones! What I would do for a pretty collection like that. Great color and lighting.</td>', 'Oh I love tumbled stones! What I would do for a pretty collection like that. Great color and lighting.', '2002-08-15 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105002, 4457, 3198, '<td valign="top">like the stones. but the flash is really harsh and makes them look dirty, plain and dull!</td>', 'like the stones. but the flash is really harsh and makes them look dirty, plain and dull!', '2002-08-16 05:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105003, 4457, 2983, '<td valign="top">Very colorful.  Lighting seems too strong.</td>', 'Very colorful.  Lighting seems too strong.', '2002-08-18 04:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105004, 4457, 3080, '<td valign="top">Newly pollished, yes.  However, precious stones, and even semi precious stones are quite old.  I still feel it meets the challenge though cause of them being newly polished and all shiny.  unless you were trying to get a light glare, you could try placing a thin cloth or thin paper between your light source and the subject and it will help to spread out the light more so it doesn''t glare so bad.  I love the assortment of color, and I like how it fills the entire photo.  nice shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Newly pollished, yes.  However, precious stones, and even semi precious stones are quite old.  I still feel it meets the challenge though cause of them being newly polished and all shiny.  unless you were trying to get a light glare, you could try placing a thin cloth or thin paper between your light source and the subject and it will help to spread out the light more so it doesn''t glare so bad.  I love the assortment of color, and I like how it fills the entire photo.  nice shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-18 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105005, 4458, 2437, '<td valign="top">jagged edges on the car</td>', 'jagged edges on the car', '2002-08-12 05:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105006, 4458, 2553, '<td valign="top">My husband''s wish list also !   I would like to have seen a little bit of  a sharper angle so that the tree could have been cut out - I find it distracting;  and I would have liked to have seen a bit more light on the car in the forefront.  I like the pitch black background, and the general composition. lhall</td>', 'My husband''s wish list also !   I would like to have seen a little bit of  a sharper angle so that the tree could have been cut out - I find it distracting;  and I would have liked to have seen a bit more light on the car in the forefront.  I like the pitch black background, and the general composition. lhall', '2002-08-12 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105007, 4458, 2997, '<td valign="top">I am looking forward to finding out who took this picture.  I''ll explain later.<br/>Okay, it is so late in the voting, what''s the likelihood you''ll read this before tomorrow:<br/>I took the other PTCruiser picture.  I accomplished the same goal as you did, but I love the night lighting in this picture.<br/>In mine, I attempted to completely play down WHAT the car was and focus on the elements of new.  There were three: 1) the dealer plate (no license yet), 2) the zero-percent financing (as in yours), and 3) the dealer flags reflected in the car window and hood.  In spite of all that, I have consistently all week held at 4.1 in my feedback.  And someone actually has the gall to tell me I didn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'I am looking forward to finding out who took this picture.  I''ll explain later.Okay, it is so late in the voting, what''s the likelihood you''ll read this before tomorrow:I took the other PTCruiser picture.  I accomplished the same goal as you did, but I love the night lighting in this picture.In mine, I attempted to completely play down WHAT the car was and focus on the elements of new.  There were three: 1) the dealer plate (no license yet), 2) the zero-percent financing (as in yours), and 3) the dealer flags reflected in the car window and hood.  In spite of all that, I have consistently all week held at 4.1 in my feedback.  And someone actually has the gall to tell me I didn''t meet the challenge.', '2002-08-12 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105008, 4458, 2818, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  One of my ideas was to do something along this line, but chose to do something else.  Good to see I wasn''t the only one with the idea.</td>', 'Great picture.  One of my ideas was to do something along this line, but chose to do something else.  Good to see I wasn''t the only one with the idea.', '2002-08-12 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105009, 4458, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is probably a stupid question but why is this shot at night? Interesting though.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'This is probably a stupid question but why is this shot at night? Interesting though.5, Kavey', '2002-08-13 18:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105010, 4458, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this photo would have done much better during the daylight.  The moisture condensation on the hood of the cars and the flourescent markings on the windows ahve been accented too heavily by your flash.  Daylight would also allow more detail of the cars to show through :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'I think this photo would have done much better during the daylight.  The moisture condensation on the hood of the cars and the flourescent markings on the windows ahve been accented too heavily by your flash.  Daylight would also allow more detail of the cars to show through :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-13 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105011, 4458, 436, '<td valign="top">too dim. Dew on hood distracting.  good subject matter</td>', 'too dim. Dew on hood distracting.  good subject matter', '2002-08-13 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
