(105039, 4459, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautiful. I don''t generally respond to baby photos particularly well. I think that people who have children forget that those of us who don''t might not feel the same way they do when we see a photo of their baby. But this photo shows me the emotions that exist between a mother and her baby, in a very direct, warm, genuine way. Putting their faces together and framing them so tightly gives a great sense of scale to the newborn, makes it seem tiny and vulnerable, and makes the mother''s face seem protecting and loving. 10 from me! - lisae</td>', 'This is absolutely beautiful. I don''t generally respond to baby photos particularly well. I think that people who have children forget that those of us who don''t might not feel the same way they do when we see a photo of their baby. But this photo shows me the emotions that exist between a mother and her baby, in a very direct, warm, genuine way. Putting their faces together and framing them so tightly gives a great sense of scale to the newborn, makes it seem tiny and vulnerable, and makes the mother''s face seem protecting and loving. 10 from me! - lisae', '2002-08-14 04:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105040, 4459, 436, '<td valign="top">Excellent work, composition and subject.<br/>At last a baby picture that shows the joy of new parenthood and does not obscure the infant''s face.<br/>Print it LARGE and Frame it!  This is a keeper!!  10 crisa58</td>', 'Excellent work, composition and subject.At last a baby picture that shows the joy of new parenthood and does not obscure the infant''s face.Print it LARGE and Frame it!  This is a keeper!!  10 crisa58', '2002-08-14 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105041, 4459, 2111, '<td valign="top">excellent 7</td>', 'excellent 7', '2002-08-14 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
