(105044, 4459, 573, '<td valign="top">I don''t normaly rate baby pictures high because they are normaly snapshots.  But you have captured the intamacy between mother and child in a technicaly supurb photograph. One of my nines for this week.</td>', 'I don''t normaly rate baby pictures high because they are normaly snapshots.  But you have captured the intamacy between mother and child in a technicaly supurb photograph. One of my nines for this week.', '2002-08-14 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105045, 4459, 2337, '<td valign="top">At first I thought I was staring at this shot for a long time so I could think of a good comment... now I realise I''m staring at it for a long time cause I just love this shot... Solid 10</td>', 'At first I thought I was staring at this shot for a long time so I could think of a good comment... now I realise I''m staring at it for a long time cause I just love this shot... Solid 10', '2002-08-14 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
