(105047, 4459, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo of a very tender moment.  I think you might have turned up the color saturation, but if so, you have did it well.  I''m not fond of baby shots, but even so, I am raising your score from a 7 to an 8.  Nice job!  Swash</td>', 'This is a very nice photo of a very tender moment.  I think you might have turned up the color saturation, but if so, you have did it well.  I''m not fond of baby shots, but even so, I am raising your score from a 7 to an 8.  Nice job!  Swash', '2002-08-15 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
