(105082, 4460, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a love it/ hate it shot Personally, I love it.  Use of B&amp;W stops it from being over cluttered; this gives the image more personality and the light reflection off the bales has been well used.  Overall, it''s a fairly boring shot made interesting by good technique No offence meant by the way (8)</td>', 'This is a love it/ hate it shot Personally, I love it.  Use of B&W stops it from being over cluttered; this gives the image more personality and the light reflection off the bales has been well used.  Overall, it''s a fairly boring shot made interesting by good technique No offence meant by the way (8)', '2002-08-15 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
