(105091, 4460, 2815, '<td valign="top">I think this photo will freak out some people.  I don''t know if everyone knnows this or not, but these are hay bales that have been wrapped in plastic to keep them fresh and free of bugs. If you don''t know what they are they can look a little scary.  It looks like aliens came down and cacooned them in some kind of protectice sealent.  I think this is a great photo.  You get a (9)</td>', 'I think this photo will freak out some people.  I don''t know if everyone knnows this or not, but these are hay bales that have been wrapped in plastic to keep them fresh and free of bugs. If you don''t know what they are they can look a little scary.  It looks like aliens came down and cacooned them in some kind of protectice sealent.  I think this is a great photo.  You get a (9)', '2002-08-17 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105092, 4460, 312, '<td valign="top">this shot has a really flat tonal range, and it hurts it a lot. the lack of any real black or white makes this a bad candidate for a black and white photo. i don''t know if you used a star filter to get those light flares, but i think they add a harshness to this image that detracts a bit.</td>', 'this shot has a really flat tonal range, and it hurts it a lot. the lack of any real black or white makes this a bad candidate for a black and white photo. i don''t know if you used a star filter to get those light flares, but i think they add a harshness to this image that detracts a bit.', '2002-08-18 04:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105093, 4460, 3351, '<td valign="top">bales of hay sparkle?</td>', 'bales of hay sparkle?', '2002-08-18 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105094, 4460, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image... the color range seems a little flat though... I like the glisten from the hay bales but would like to see a little more contrast in the overall image... good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a nice image... the color range seems a little flat though... I like the glisten from the hay bales but would like to see a little more contrast in the overall image... good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-18 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
