(105107, 4461, 3080, '<td valign="top">I was one of the few people that got a chance to read your post in the forums before it got deleted.  I think maybe what people are probably seeing in your photo is just the tail light.  Maybe if we got the shot with a little angle going down the side of the car as well, people might associate the photo as being of the car, and not just the tail light.    After all, it''s a new car, not a new tail light, right?  Don''t be discouraged, someone said my photo didn''t meet the challenge too, and the rest of the comments are all about how they LOVE the reference to new. lol.  There''s one in every bunch.</td>', 'I was one of the few people that got a chance to read your post in the forums before it got deleted.  I think maybe what people are probably seeing in your photo is just the tail light.  Maybe if we got the shot with a little angle going down the side of the car as well, people might associate the photo as being of the car, and not just the tail light.    After all, it''s a new car, not a new tail light, right?  Don''t be discouraged, someone said my photo didn''t meet the challenge too, and the rest of the comments are all about how they LOVE the reference to new. lol.  There''s one in every bunch.', '2002-08-17 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
