(105119, 4462, 3087, '<td valign="top">I feel a desperate need to crop and rotate this... I even saved as just to satisfy the urge in photoshop, but mindful of copyright and invasion of privacy I have now deleted it completely from my PC. Lovely subject matter and I love that you have him facing the school rather than you. I find the image overall too dark.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'I feel a desperate need to crop and rotate this... I even saved as just to satisfy the urge in photoshop, but mindful of copyright and invasion of privacy I have now deleted it completely from my PC. Lovely subject matter and I love that you have him facing the school rather than you. I find the image overall too dark.6, Kavey', '2002-08-12 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105120, 4462, 2553, '<td valign="top">A rather poignant shot.  I can feel his pain! I really like this shot, and at first thought that I would rather see his face, but after coming back to it, I think that his position and posture say it all. lhall</td>', 'A rather poignant shot.  I can feel his pain! I really like this shot, and at first thought that I would rather see his face, but after coming back to it, I think that his position and posture say it all. lhall', '2002-08-12 20:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
