(105171, 4463, 806, '<td valign="top">Neat sculpture.<br/>The background takes away from this, as well as the people on the bottom.<br/>Of course, even at a different angle we would still be left with a photograph of someone else''s artwork.</td>', 'Neat sculpture.The background takes away from this, as well as the people on the bottom.Of course, even at a different angle we would still be left with a photograph of someone else''s artwork.', '2002-08-15 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
