(105202, 4465, 3273, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  Not sure if the two pylons on the other bank are required.  Nice clear photo, good color.</td>', 'Good photo.  Not sure if the two pylons on the other bank are required.  Nice clear photo, good color.', '2002-08-14 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105203, 4465, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo.  Depict something new very well.  I can''t quite make out everything the sign says, but wouldn''t want the angle to change. I like the angle and the lighting is great.  Hope you let us know the location of this.  Very intriguing.  Great job and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This is a very nice photo.  Depict something new very well.  I can''t quite make out everything the sign says, but wouldn''t want the angle to change. I like the angle and the lighting is great.  Hope you let us know the location of this.  Very intriguing.  Great job and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-16 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105204, 4465, 117, '<td valign="top">I won''t give a location for this new bridge. Since 9/11 I have quit taking pictures of military values and describing locations of possible key interests. I am sure the terrorists know of this bridge but I am not going to help them either.</td>', 'I won''t give a location for this new bridge. Since 9/11 I have quit taking pictures of military values and describing locations of possible key interests. I am sure the terrorists know of this bridge but I am not going to help them either.', '2002-08-19 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(105205, 4466, 2607, '<td valign="top">oh that is sad :(</td>', 'oh that is sad :(', '2002-08-12 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105206, 4466, 2553, '<td valign="top">This makes me very sad - I''ve been there.  Just proof that not everything that is new is bright, shiny, and fun. lhall</td>', 'This makes me very sad - I''ve been there.  Just proof that not everything that is new is bright, shiny, and fun. lhall', '2002-08-12 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105207, 4466, 92, '<td valign="top">What a emotional photo. In my heart...I believe in New Life and this meets the challenge. hugs and prayers...Angel</td>', 'What a emotional photo. In my heart...I believe in New Life and this meets the challenge. hugs and prayers...Angel', '2002-08-12 02:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105208, 4466, 1856, '<td valign="top">This is a very powerful image.  I am sorry for your loss. Lisa</td>', 'This is a very powerful image.  I am sorry for your loss. Lisa', '2002-08-12 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105209, 4466, 2752, '<td valign="top">Sorry about your brother...composition is good</td>', 'Sorry about your brother...composition is good', '2002-08-12 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105210, 4466, 3002, '<td valign="top">This photo makes me feel very sad.  My condolences to the photographer.  However, this photo doesn''t really meet the requirements of the challenge, IMHO.</td>', 'This photo makes me feel very sad.  My condolences to the photographer.  However, this photo doesn''t really meet the requirements of the challenge, IMHO.', '2002-08-12 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105211, 4466, 1882, '<td valign="top">that''s depressing.</td>', 'that''s depressing.', '2002-08-12 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105212, 4466, 2256, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry for your loss</td>', 'I''m sorry for your loss', '2002-08-12 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105213, 4466, 2997, '<td valign="top">My sincere condolances.  I lost my dear father earlier this year.</td>', 'My sincere condolances.  I lost my dear father earlier this year.', '2002-08-12 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105214, 4466, 1360, '<td valign="top">Had I had some real time this week, I would have submitted something along these lines.  It''s nice to see some other people taking different turns with this challenge.</td>', 'Had I had some real time this week, I would have submitted something along these lines.  It''s nice to see some other people taking different turns with this challenge.', '2002-08-12 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105215, 4466, 3161, '<td valign="top">This begs many questions ...</td>', 'This begs many questions ...', '2002-08-12 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105216, 4466, 2490, '<td valign="top">Really your brother?  I''m sorry if so, but I do believe in life after death, so your point is well taken.  There are some things I know you couldn''t control, and this event may have consumed your entire week, but I want to judge it as a photo, not as an experience.  Challenge - 5 points.  Photo quality and personal impression - 2 points.  7 nards656</td>', 'Really your brother?  I''m sorry if so, but I do believe in life after death, so your point is well taken.  There are some things I know you couldn''t control, and this event may have consumed your entire week, but I want to judge it as a photo, not as an experience.  Challenge - 5 points.  Photo quality and personal impression - 2 points.  7 nards656', '2002-08-12 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105217, 4466, 1922, '<td valign="top">sorry about your loss,</td>', 'sorry about your loss,', '2002-08-12 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
