(105222, 4466, 3071, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title to go with the picture, and how is this the start of something new</td>', 'I don''t get the title to go with the picture, and how is this the start of something new', '2002-08-14 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105223, 4466, 2798, '<td valign="top">I think I''d rather think about how *your* life is new now that your brother isnt directly in it any more. The title suggests irony and perhaps slight morbidity. Death is about change. How death changes *us* and how we cope is both more interesting and more important than what happens to the body. Your picture is well framed and technically fine. This person was obviously well loved. - floyd</td>', 'I think I''d rather think about how *your* life is new now that your brother isnt directly in it any more. The title suggests irony and perhaps slight morbidity. Death is about change. How death changes *us* and how we cope is both more interesting and more important than what happens to the body. Your picture is well framed and technically fine. This person was obviously well loved. - floyd', '2002-08-14 07:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
