(105261, 4468, 641, '<td valign="top">I like it..except for the shiny gold thing sticking up behind him.</td>', 'I like it..except for the shiny gold thing sticking up behind him.', '2002-08-15 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105262, 4468, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think this little guy is so cute.  I think the metal object behind him is a little screw thing, which would help to understand his tiny size.  The title is gameboy, but the object he''s holding is a bit dark to really get any detail of what it is exactly.  He looks like he''s made of wax and is sitting on something that looks to have dirt on it.  I like the lighting and orange tint.  Makes him look like he''s chilling out by a campfire or something.  He''s got one eye closed, but I''m not sure why cause I still can''t get the detail on what he''s holding.  i tried enlarging it and brightening it, still no luck.  Just because I don''t understand it, doesn''t mean that the message isn''t clear to someone who knows what they are looking at.  The actual focus of the photo is great.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I think this little guy is so cute.  I think the metal object behind him is a little screw thing, which would help to understand his tiny size.  The title is gameboy, but the object he''s holding is a bit dark to really get any detail of what it is exactly.  He looks like he''s made of wax and is sitting on something that looks to have dirt on it.  I like the lighting and orange tint.  Makes him look like he''s chilling out by a campfire or something.  He''s got one eye closed, but I''m not sure why cause I still can''t get the detail on what he''s holding.  i tried enlarging it and brightening it, still no luck.  Just because I don''t understand it, doesn''t mean that the message isn''t clear to someone who knows what they are looking at.  The actual focus of the photo is great.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-16 22:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105263, 4468, 312, '<td valign="top">great subject. good composition and lighting. nice macro. good job.</td>', 'great subject. good composition and lighting. nice macro. good job.', '2002-08-18 04:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
