(105291, 4470, 2798, '<td valign="top">Your picture has a very strong cyan tint to it. It doesnt look deliberate to be so it''s probably because you had the white balance on your camera set for something other than daylight. You chose a good angle, though, and your framing is good. Perhaps you should have cropped out the pole on the right, though.</td>', 'Your picture has a very strong cyan tint to it. It doesnt look deliberate to be so it''s probably because you had the white balance on your camera set for something other than daylight. You chose a good angle, though, and your framing is good. Perhaps you should have cropped out the pole on the right, though.', '2002-08-18 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
