(105422, 4476, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - Very good. Rose &amp; painted nails sets this apart.<br/>Technical Aspects - very good. Perhaps a little bright on top of box, but so what.<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  high<br/>Top 5<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - Very good. Rose & painted nails sets this apart.Technical Aspects - very good. Perhaps a little bright on top of box, but so what.Meets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  highTop 5Jim msp', '2002-08-13 18:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
