(105437, 4477, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - pretty good<br/>Technical Aspects - pretty good. <br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  pretty good<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - pretty goodTechnical Aspects - pretty good. Meets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  pretty goodJim msp', '2002-08-14 00:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105438, 4477, 327, '<td valign="top">Clean, clear, good color, on topic, but not a _wow_ for interest.  I really like the perspective and the guy up there. Not sure how this could be improved, but it''s nice work. Score-7 Kee</td>', 'Clean, clear, good color, on topic, but not a _wow_ for interest.  I really like the perspective and the guy up there. Not sure how this could be improved, but it''s nice work. Score-7 Kee', '2002-08-15 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105439, 4477, 2881, '<td valign="top">How to get an interesting picture of a construction site... not a bad job. the photo almost looks like it belongs in a magazine... an ad or something.</td>', 'How to get an interesting picture of a construction site... not a bad job. the photo almost looks like it belongs in a magazine... an ad or something.', '2002-08-15 20:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105440, 4477, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute title, is that really apt. 24F?  (Seems more like office space)  I like how you included the crane, but I don''t see the window, is it off frame or already off the crane''s strap?  Very nice blue sky.  Challenge well met.  8 Swash</td>', 'Cute title, is that really apt. 24F?  (Seems more like office space)  I like how you included the crane, but I don''t see the window, is it off frame or already off the crane''s strap?  Very nice blue sky.  Challenge well met.  8 Swash', '2002-08-15 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105441, 4477, 3095, '<td valign="top">Nice primary colors</td>', 'Nice primary colors', '2002-08-18 03:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
