(105443, 4477, 2829, '<td valign="top">So far this is one of the better building shots I have rated...Definitely has the connection to the challenge without the title being present.</td>', 'So far this is one of the better building shots I have rated...Definitely has the connection to the challenge without the title being present.', '2002-08-18 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105444, 4477, 3080, '<td valign="top">Is that REALLY apartment 24F?? Or were you just guessing. LOL  I''m just playing.  It''s late and I thought I had all my commenting done, when I looked and saw 6 more left to do!!  The angle and lighting are good.  Definately depicts something new.  It appears to be straight with the edge of the photo.  That guy is looking at you like "what is that crazy person doing taking pictures of this?"  I get that a lot.  Especially at the zoo, when I was taking pictures of the really cool bench, when there was a giraffe trying to eat out of my pocket. lol.  Great shot and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Is that REALLY apartment 24F?? Or were you just guessing. LOL  I''m just playing.  It''s late and I thought I had all my commenting done, when I looked and saw 6 more left to do!!  The angle and lighting are good.  Definately depicts something new.  It appears to be straight with the edge of the photo.  That guy is looking at you like "what is that crazy person doing taking pictures of this?"  I get that a lot.  Especially at the zoo, when I was taking pictures of the really cool bench, when there was a giraffe trying to eat out of my pocket. lol.  Great shot and good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-19 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
