(105515, 4480, 3080, '<td valign="top">I thought that the title of this photo was probably kind of car that was in the photo.  However, I looked it up and couldn''t find anything called a Tauri.  So, I thought that maybe you were trying to portray the plural of Taurus, but these aren''t even Ford made cars.  However, what ever it is (looks like a chrystler concord or lhs or 300m, something of that nature) they are definately new.  I like the angle and the repetitive-ness (if that''s even a word).  Lighting is good, not too dark, not too bright.  Great depiction of something new. Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I thought that the title of this photo was probably kind of car that was in the photo.  However, I looked it up and couldn''t find anything called a Tauri.  So, I thought that maybe you were trying to portray the plural of Taurus, but these aren''t even Ford made cars.  However, what ever it is (looks like a chrystler concord or lhs or 300m, something of that nature) they are definately new.  I like the angle and the repetitive-ness (if that''s even a word).  Lighting is good, not too dark, not too bright.  Great depiction of something new. Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-18 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
