(105525, 4481, 3127, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t for the title, I never would have known what this was a photo of.</td>', 'If it weren''t for the title, I never would have known what this was a photo of.', '2002-08-13 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105526, 4481, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition4<br/>Technical Aspects3<br/>Appeal3<br/>Creativity4<br/>Rating4Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition4Technical Aspects3Appeal3Creativity4Rating4Autool', '2002-08-13 21:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105527, 4481, 2643, '<td valign="top">Is that really ice?</td>', 'Is that really ice?', '2002-08-13 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105528, 4481, 1826, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but your lighting is a little harsh.</td>', 'I like the concept, but your lighting is a little harsh.', '2002-08-14 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105529, 4481, 2829, '<td valign="top">Ok, I see...new ice is usually thin...There''s a connection to the challenge...but it''s very hard to tell that is ice in the picture...Actually it looks a lot like wax. And, the bright spot right above it is a bit distracting. An original idea however...</td>', 'Ok, I see...new ice is usually thin...There''s a connection to the challenge...but it''s very hard to tell that is ice in the picture...Actually it looks a lot like wax. And, the bright spot right above it is a bit distracting. An original idea however...', '2002-08-14 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105530, 4481, 3016, '<td valign="top">glare, subject not clear</td>', 'glare, subject not clear', '2002-08-14 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105531, 4481, 2370, '<td valign="top">good idea, but maybe you could have positioned a light source to capture light reflections off the ice to make it more attractive? The grey''s kinda dull here..</td>', 'good idea, but maybe you could have positioned a light source to capture light reflections off the ice to make it more attractive? The grey''s kinda dull here..', '2002-08-15 07:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105532, 4481, 2815, '<td valign="top">Too close,  it is hrad to tell what we are looking at</td>', 'Too close,  it is hrad to tell what we are looking at', '2002-08-16 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105533, 4481, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a little bright at the top.  Maybe you could have tried to reduce the light a bit by placing something between the light source and the subject.  I have heard that a thin cloth or a thin paper placed between the light and the subject helps to reduce glare and help from getting a too bright look.  You did a good job of taking the photo so that we can tell exactly what it is.  Even without the title, I still think we would be able to know what it is.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This is a little bright at the top.  Maybe you could have tried to reduce the light a bit by placing something between the light source and the subject.  I have heard that a thin cloth or a thin paper placed between the light and the subject helps to reduce glare and help from getting a too bright look.  You did a good job of taking the photo so that we can tell exactly what it is.  Even without the title, I still think we would be able to know what it is.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-17 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105534, 4481, 3112, '<td valign="top">interesting subject, though a bit confusing.</td>', 'interesting subject, though a bit confusing.', '2002-08-17 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105535, 4481, 312, '<td valign="top">the lighting here is really harsh, and you subject isn''t really very interesting. i''m not sure i really get the connection to the challenge, either, but i don''t take points off for that. you might want to crop off the top corners where your pan ends, and try to get more natural lighting instead of bouncing the harsh flash off the metal surface.</td>', 'the lighting here is really harsh, and you subject isn''t really very interesting. i''m not sure i really get the connection to the challenge, either, but i don''t take points off for that. you might want to crop off the top corners where your pan ends, and try to get more natural lighting instead of bouncing the harsh flash off the metal surface.', '2002-08-18 04:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105536, 4481, 2798, '<td valign="top">Im afraid I dont undertstand your concept for this one. It sure looks like a thin piece of ice. But Im not clear on what it''s about.</td>', 'Im afraid I dont undertstand your concept for this one. It sure looks like a thin piece of ice. But Im not clear on what it''s about.', '2002-08-18 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105537, 4481, 3351, '<td valign="top">is that ice in a pan?</td>', 'is that ice in a pan?', '2002-08-18 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105538, 4482, 92, '<td valign="top">This would have worked much better without the fake blood</td>', 'This would have worked much better without the fake blood', '2002-08-12 02:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105539, 4482, 2586, '<td valign="top">New???? Nice image though. It looks rather contrived because I suspect the ketchup is only there for photographic effect.</td>', 'New???? Nice image though. It looks rather contrived because I suspect the ketchup is only there for photographic effect.', '2002-08-12 04:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105540, 4482, 2596, '<td valign="top">WHAT??</td>', 'WHAT??', '2002-08-12 07:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105541, 4482, 2466, '<td valign="top">It would be much better without the red juice</td>', 'It would be much better without the red juice', '2002-08-12 08:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105542, 4482, 3127, '<td valign="top">The colors are visually appealing, but a little too much of a setup. Barbeque sauce?</td>', 'The colors are visually appealing, but a little too much of a setup. Barbeque sauce?', '2002-08-12 10:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105543, 4482, 1779, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and lighting. the blood is a bit fake you should''ve done it for real, no? just kidding. good photo... : p</td>', 'I like the idea and lighting. the blood is a bit fake you should''ve done it for real, no? just kidding. good photo... : p', '2002-08-12 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105544, 4482, 1827, '<td valign="top">Yuck.</td>', 'Yuck.', '2002-08-12 14:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105545, 4482, 3018, '<td valign="top">Looks more like ketchup.</td>', 'Looks more like ketchup.', '2002-08-12 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105546, 4482, 714, '<td valign="top">I won''t look at bell peppers in the same way.</td>', 'I won''t look at bell peppers in the same way.', '2002-08-12 22:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105547, 4482, 656, '<td valign="top">very vibrant colours</td>', 'very vibrant colours', '2002-08-12 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105548, 4482, 1031, '<td valign="top">No sacrifice too great for art!</td>', 'No sacrifice too great for art!', '2002-08-13 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105549, 4482, 737, '<td valign="top">Something new. <br/>Composition - quite good<br/>Technical Aspects - quite good - except for the cutting skills  ;-)<br/>Meets Challenge - yes<br/>Visual Impact / Originality  quite good<br/>Maybe the title should be "New Cook"<br/>Jim msp<br/></td>', 'Something new. Composition - quite goodTechnical Aspects - quite good - except for the cutting skills  ;-)Meets Challenge - yesVisual Impact / Originality  quite goodMaybe the title should be "New Cook"Jim msp', '2002-08-13 19:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105550, 4482, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition6<br/>Technical Aspects5<br/>Appeal4<br/>Creativity7<br/>Rating6Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition6Technical Aspects5Appeal4Creativity7Rating6Autool', '2002-08-13 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105551, 4482, 3269, '<td valign="top">This is probably the most disturbing vegeatable shot I have seen in some time. Creative. Excellent contrasts in color and tone. Moody in a clinical sort of way. And thank you, but I prefer creamy french.........</td>', 'This is probably the most disturbing vegeatable shot I have seen in some time. Creative. Excellent contrasts in color and tone. Moody in a clinical sort of way. And thank you, but I prefer creamy french.........', '2002-08-14 03:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105552, 4482, 3236, '<td valign="top">Looks too posed.  Where did the red come from, and what is it supposed to be?</td>', 'Looks too posed.  Where did the red come from, and what is it supposed to be?', '2002-08-14 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105553, 4482, 2857, '<td valign="top">gross</td>', 'gross', '2002-08-14 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105554, 4482, 921, '<td valign="top">Ouch</td>', 'Ouch', '2002-08-14 21:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105555, 4482, 2735, '<td valign="top">???</td>', '???', '2002-08-14 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105556, 4482, 2829, '<td valign="top">New knives or new salad? It looks interesting...I suppose I can make an association with the image. It''s visually appealing and makes me hungry. Original as well...</td>', 'New knives or new salad? It looks interesting...I suppose I can make an association with the image. It''s visually appealing and makes me hungry. Original as well...', '2002-08-15 08:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105557, 4482, 2928, '<td valign="top">Hmmm Has great bad taste, yuck value.  It''s a superb shot, I can''t fault it technically; my only gripe  and I may be missing the point  is that it doesn''t meet the challenge New knife perhaps, still a bit weak, Sorry</td>', 'Hmmm Has great bad taste, yuck value.  It''s a superb shot, I can''t fault it technically; my only gripe  and I may be missing the point  is that it doesn''t meet the challenge New knife perhaps, still a bit weak, Sorry', '2002-08-15 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105558, 4482, 641, '<td valign="top">Great color and lighting.</td>', 'Great color and lighting.', '2002-08-15 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105559, 4482, 2204, '<td valign="top">Good photo but, I can''t quite put this with the challenge topic.  New knife?  Newly sliced pepper?  New cut from a new knife slicing a new pepper?  My mind keeps going in different directions on this one.</td>', 'Good photo but, I can''t quite put this with the challenge topic.  New knife?  Newly sliced pepper?  New cut from a new knife slicing a new pepper?  My mind keeps going in different directions on this one.', '2002-08-16 00:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105560, 4482, 3080, '<td valign="top">I get the point behind this.  new knife.  At first, the seeds bothered me, but then when I pictured it without the seeds, it looked boring. So the seeds are important to the photo.  As I sit here reviewing it, I notice the word "sharp" on the knife and I like that too.  It seems to be a little too bright.  The vast majority of the photo is just fine, but toward the top right it gets a bit washed out.  The substance used to resemble blood looks great, however where it had been put on the knife, it looks grainy and almost seasoned.  Overall affect is very good.  Good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'I get the point behind this.  new knife.  At first, the seeds bothered me, but then when I pictured it without the seeds, it looked boring. So the seeds are important to the photo.  As I sit here reviewing it, I notice the word "sharp" on the knife and I like that too.  It seems to be a little too bright.  The vast majority of the photo is just fine, but toward the top right it gets a bit washed out.  The substance used to resemble blood looks great, however where it had been put on the knife, it looks grainy and almost seasoned.  Overall affect is very good.  Good luck with the challenge!', '2002-08-16 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105561, 4482, 933, '<td valign="top">Very funny!  I Love it.  I''d be interested to see if eliminating the pepper from the upper left improves the photo at all.  Great job!  9 md</td>', 'Very funny!  I Love it.  I''d be interested to see if eliminating the pepper from the upper left improves the photo at all.  Great job!  9 md', '2002-08-16 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105562, 4482, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, very colourful and high contrast, really emphasising the sharpness of the knife and the red colour of the "blood". It looks a lot more like tomato sauce/catsup, but a fun idea :)</td>', 'I love this photo, very colourful and high contrast, really emphasising the sharpness of the knife and the red colour of the "blood". It looks a lot more like tomato sauce/catsup, but a fun idea :)', '2002-08-17 07:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105563, 4482, 2261, '<td valign="top">Excellent. The detail is superb. The cropping is spot on as is the lighting.</td>', 'Excellent. The detail is superb. The cropping is spot on as is the lighting.', '2002-08-17 08:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105564, 4482, 3320, '<td valign="top">Good picture ... very nice .. nice colors ( I love the green of the pepper) ....</td>', 'Good picture ... very nice .. nice colors ( I love the green of the pepper) ....', '2002-08-17 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105565, 4482, 2997, '<td valign="top">I like the way you composed your shot.<br/>Where did the "red" come from?  It doesn''t seem to fit in.<br/>I don''t understand what is new about this picture.</td>', 'I like the way you composed your shot.Where did the "red" come from?  It doesn''t seem to fit in.I don''t understand what is new about this picture.', '2002-08-18 03:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105566, 4482, 2716, '<td valign="top">Love those Henkels.  Nice colors</td>', 'Love those Henkels.  Nice colors', '2002-08-18 19:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105567, 4482, 312, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone who commented. "New Knife" was the concept of this photo. I figured new knives cut people. I really like Jim''s suggestion of the title "New Cook" or "New Chef". That would definitely have fit as well.<br/><br/>Anyway, as you can see by my description of the photo, I knew the "blood" was bad. I could have sworn I had some fake blood around, but I couldn''t find it. I shot this at like 10pm Sunday night and we didn''t even have any food coloring. I believe the final concoction was a mix of Caro Syrop, Ketchup, and Hershey''s Chocolate Syrup. Definitely didn''t come out good on the knife, but I don''t think the rest is too bad.<br/><br/>Anyway, thanks again.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone who commented. "New Knife" was the concept of this photo. I figured new knives cut people. I really like Jim''s suggestion of the title "New Cook" or "New Chef". That would definitely have fit as well.Anyway, as you can see by my description of the photo, I knew the "blood" was bad. I could have sworn I had some fake blood around, but I couldn''t find it. I shot this at like 10pm Sunday night and we didn''t even have any food coloring. I believe the final concoction was a mix of Caro Syrop, Ketchup, and Hershey''s Chocolate Syrup. Definitely didn''t come out good on the knife, but I don''t think the rest is too bad.Anyway, thanks again.', '2002-08-19 02:30:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(105568, 4482, 3080, '<td valign="top">I am shocked at the amount of people that didn''t get this.  The newness jumped right out at me.  Maybe from my personal experience with new knives. lol.  I personally think you did a great job with this.</td>', 'I am shocked at the amount of people that didn''t get this.  The newness jumped right out at me.  Maybe from my personal experience with new knives. lol.  I personally think you did a great job with this.', '2002-08-21 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(105569, 4483, 2058, '<td valign="top">Since you''re not showing much sky anyway, I would have just framed the shot so there was no sky at all</td>', 'Since you''re not showing much sky anyway, I would have just framed the shot so there was no sky at all', '2002-08-12 03:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105570, 4483, 2780, '<td valign="top">This looks such a great view, but it will never look at good on film :( Maybe this would look a lot better if the horizon was horizontal along the picture, or maybe even cropped out all the way. Also you could probably have increased the contrast a little to help the scenery stand out more, rather than the plant-life in front.</td>', 'This looks such a great view, but it will never look at good on film :( Maybe this would look a lot better if the horizon was horizontal along the picture, or maybe even cropped out all the way. Also you could probably have increased the contrast a little to help the scenery stand out more, rather than the plant-life in front.', '2002-08-12 04:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105571, 4483, 2256, '<td valign="top">WOW....</td>', 'WOW....', '2002-08-12 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105572, 4483, 2173, '<td valign="top">nice!!!!!!</td>', 'nice!!!!!!', '2002-08-12 13:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105573, 4483, 2752, '<td valign="top">Great shot..good depth and I like the framing with the folliage in the foreground</td>', 'Great shot..good depth and I like the framing with the folliage in the foreground', '2002-08-12 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105574, 4483, 205, '<td valign="top">Seems slightly tilted</td>', 'Seems slightly tilted', '2002-08-12 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105575, 4483, 2764, '<td valign="top">Do me a favor and straighten the horizon .</td>', 'Do me a favor and straighten the horizon .', '2002-08-12 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105576, 4483, 117, '<td valign="top">is that the north rim great shot</td>', 'is that the north rim great shot', '2002-08-12 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105577, 4483, 2247, '<td valign="top">(Gasp!) Wow, what a view!</td>', '(Gasp!) Wow, what a view!', '2002-08-12 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105578, 4483, 3102, '<td valign="top">Seems like the title is a stretch to work this photo in to the challenge.  It should have included a sunrise or nicely tinted sky to match the title.  It is a great shot -- I like how the canyon is framed by the foliage... but I just think it would have been more appropriate in a different challenge.  Also, it seems to be a little unnaturally tilted to the right.</td>', 'Seems like the title is a stretch to work this photo in to the challenge.  It should have included a sunrise or nicely tinted sky to match the title.  It is a great shot -- I like how the canyon is framed by the foliage... but I just think it would have been more appropriate in a different challenge.  Also, it seems to be a little unnaturally tilted to the right.', '2002-08-12 20:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105579, 4483, 2553, '<td valign="top">It might be a "new morning", but I would have much rather seen this in the "Something Old" challenge!  This really does not convery "new" to me at all.  Very beautiful shot though. lhall</td>', 'It might be a "new morning", but I would have much rather seen this in the "Something Old" challenge!  This really does not convery "new" to me at all.  Very beautiful shot though. lhall', '2002-08-12 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105580, 4483, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition5<br/>Technical Aspects5<br/>Appeal6<br/>Creativity4<br/>Rating5Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition5Technical Aspects5Appeal6Creativity4Rating5Autool', '2002-08-12 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105581, 4483, 656, '<td valign="top">Some people have all the best locations :^)  Not sure if the horizon is actually sloping or is titled, but it feels odd.  A polarising filter or sheet would have helped cut through the haze in this shot, if your camera lets you use one,  This sort of thing is always more dramatic at dawn/ dusk</td>', 'Some people have all the best locations :^)  Not sure if the horizon is actually sloping or is titled, but it feels odd.  A polarising filter or sheet would have helped cut through the haze in this shot, if your camera lets you use one,  This sort of thing is always more dramatic at dawn/ dusk', '2002-08-12 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105582, 4483, 671, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, a little weak on the challenge.  But OK, I''ll buy it.  7</td>', 'Beautiful picture, a little weak on the challenge.  But OK, I''ll buy it.  7', '2002-08-13 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105583, 4483, 2587, '<td valign="top">Would''ve liked to see the horizon line up with the top of the frame ... other than that ... what a view!</td>', 'Would''ve liked to see the horizon line up with the top of the frame ... other than that ... what a view!', '2002-08-13 09:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105584, 4483, 1141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!! You captured this really well</td>', 'Beautiful!!! You captured this really well', '2002-08-13 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105585, 4483, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  I was thinking that you could adjust the gamma down a bit to bring out more color in the canyon, but you be a bit dark on the trees.  Focus looks good.  Lighting is good.  Assuming it really is morning, the subject matter is good and is presented well.  7</td>', 'Very nice image.  I was thinking that you could adjust the gamma down a bit to bring out more color in the canyon, but you be a bit dark on the trees.  Focus looks good.  Lighting is good.  Assuming it really is morning, the subject matter is good and is presented well.  7', '2002-08-13 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105586, 4483, 1908, '<td valign="top">nice shoot but u need to strigthen the horizion out not have it on the angle</td>', 'nice shoot but u need to strigthen the horizion out not have it on the angle', '2002-08-13 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105587, 4483, 436, '<td valign="top">what striking scenry.</td>', 'what striking scenry.', '2002-08-13 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105588, 4483, 2353, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot..great job.  I love how the trees frame what is a breath taking landscape...</td>', 'Beautiful shot..great job.  I love how the trees frame what is a breath taking landscape...', '2002-08-13 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105589, 4483, 1792, '<td valign="top">Neat look at Grand Canyon.  Horizon seems to be off quite a bit, and that seems to detract from everything else.</td>', 'Neat look at Grand Canyon.  Horizon seems to be off quite a bit, and that seems to detract from everything else.', '2002-08-14 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105590, 4483, 1875, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous picture. not too original</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous picture. not too original', '2002-08-14 18:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105591, 4483, 714, '<td valign="top">I am sure I am not the only one who noticed the horizon seem bent.  Nice photo, but maybe you could have tried a different time of day and left the sky out of the picture. 5</td>', 'I am sure I am not the only one who noticed the horizon seem bent.  Nice photo, but maybe you could have tried a different time of day and left the sky out of the picture. 5', '2002-08-14 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105592, 4483, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great shot, great sense of scale, great colour.  Only fault, it does look slightly over exposed (I think) at the top.</td>', 'Great shot, great sense of scale, great colour.  Only fault, it does look slightly over exposed (I think) at the top.', '2002-08-15 06:11:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(105593, 4483, 3044, '<td valign="top">nice framing with the greenery. i think i would try to bring up the color in the canyon some more. nice job.</td>', 'nice framing with the greenery. i think i would try to bring up the color in the canyon some more. nice job.', '2002-08-15 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105594, 4483, 2881, '<td valign="top">I don''t like to see the name of the challenge (new) used in the title... too cliche or something. There are lots of other, more creative ways to express it.  Nice picture but a bit too much haze in the background, mutes the rich colors of the canyon. I like the way the trees frame the photo, but think I would have cropped the sky out above the rocks.</td>', 'I don''t like to see the name of the challenge (new) used in the title... too cliche or something. There are lots of other, more creative ways to express it.  Nice picture but a bit too much haze in the background, mutes the rich colors of the canyon. I like the way the trees frame the photo, but think I would have cropped the sky out above the rocks.', '2002-08-15 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105595, 4483, 3198, '<td valign="top">horizon is falling to the right. rest is just a well-known image. holiday shot not very imaginative</td>', 'horizon is falling to the right. rest is just a well-known image. holiday shot not very imaginative', '2002-08-16 05:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105596, 4483, 3280, '<td valign="top">I like the framing and color usage.</td>', 'I like the framing and color usage.', '2002-08-16 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105597, 4483, 1019, '<td valign="top">Beautiful view nicely framed by the greenery---good contrast between the green and the desert--andrewm</td>', 'Beautiful view nicely framed by the greenery---good contrast between the green and the desert--andrewm', '2002-08-16 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105598, 4483, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, well framed by the trees.  Do you have a haze filter?  9 Swash</td>', 'Very nice photo, well framed by the trees.  Do you have a haze filter?  9 Swash', '2002-08-16 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105599, 4483, 2204, '<td valign="top">Cropping off the sky at the top would improve the visual quality.  Otherwise this is really good.</td>', 'Cropping off the sky at the top would improve the visual quality.  Otherwise this is really good.', '2002-08-17 00:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105600, 4483, 3080, '<td valign="top">I love how this is framed by the plants, and it is a magnificant sight.  Never been there myself.  The lighting is great, however I don''t see any indication of weather is is morning noon or night except by the title.  Like I said, I have never been there though, to know what morning looks like there, so I have to go by your word on this.  It is a great shot.  You should try it on other sites as well. Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I love how this is framed by the plants, and it is a magnificant sight.  Never been there myself.  The lighting is great, however I don''t see any indication of weather is is morning noon or night except by the title.  Like I said, I have never been there though, to know what morning looks like there, so I have to go by your word on this.  It is a great shot.  You should try it on other sites as well. Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-18 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
