(105609, 4484, 1005, '<td valign="top">What was wrong with the old settlers?  (pun on your title)  The busy, busy background is very distracting, focus is a bit soft around the edges,  and you caught yourself in the frame.  I like the shadow across the forehead of the man''s silhouette, makes it look like he has a hat on.  7 Swash</td>', 'What was wrong with the old settlers?  (pun on your title)  The busy, busy background is very distracting, focus is a bit soft around the edges,  and you caught yourself in the frame.  I like the shadow across the forehead of the man''s silhouette, makes it look like he has a hat on.  7 Swash', '2002-08-15 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
