(105626, 4485, 2815, '<td valign="top">I am giving you an 8 for a  Couple of reasons.  One I love Nokia phones, and two the time you took the photo and the time on the clock match.   the funny thing is they don''t always match when people enter photos on this site.  I hate it when they don''t match.  it makes me suspcious,  NormW</td>', 'I am giving you an 8 for a  Couple of reasons.  One I love Nokia phones, and two the time you took the photo and the time on the clock match.   the funny thing is they don''t always match when people enter photos on this site.  I hate it when they don''t match.  it makes me suspcious,  NormW', '2002-08-17 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105627, 4485, 3080, '<td valign="top">LOL.  This one definately got my vote for humor.  Definately new, that''s for sure.  The face plate on your phone though is textured and colored just right to make it look like the photo was sharpened too much, so if you get that comment, that could be the reason.  The angle is good and lighting is good, however, it gets a tad bright going into the bottom left corner.  i assume that''s where your light source is reflecting.  Overall nice photo.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'LOL.  This one definately got my vote for humor.  Definately new, that''s for sure.  The face plate on your phone though is textured and colored just right to make it look like the photo was sharpened too much, so if you get that comment, that could be the reason.  The angle is good and lighting is good, however, it gets a tad bright going into the bottom left corner.  i assume that''s where your light source is reflecting.  Overall nice photo.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2002-08-18 03:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(105628, 4485, 2997, '<td valign="top">I think you framed this picture very well.<br/>I have come back to this picture several times.  Something struck me as odd and I now know what it is.  You didn''t really photo something new.  You photographed a message that implied something is new.  In my opinoin, it just is not the same thing.</td>', 'I think you framed this picture very well.I have come back to this picture several times.  Something struck me as odd and I now know what it is.  You didn''t really photo something new.  You photographed a message that implied something is new.  In my opinoin, it just is not the same thing.', '2002-08-18 03:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
